<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">RRK23.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ISAAYA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Isaaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Isa</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">ISAAYA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okutonganisa abantu be n'okubahana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:32-16:20">2 Bag 15:32—16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:1-20:21">18:1—20:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:1-32:33">2 Bus 26:1—32:33</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 7:1-12">Isa 7:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-39:8">36:1—39:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okworekwa kwa Isaaya mwene Amozi, oku yaareebire ahari Yuda na Yerusaalemu obu busingye bwa Uziya, Yosamu, Ahazi na Hezekia abagabe ba Yuda.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:26">Bir 4:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:1">32:1</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe iguru 'we, hurira; naiwe nsi 'we, tega okutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA agizire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">Nkontsya abaana, naaboorora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">Kwonka mbwenu bangomeire.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Ente emanya mukama waayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">N'endogoya emanya eka ya mukama waayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">Kwonka Israeli taine ki arikumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">Abantu bangye tibarikwetegyereza.<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:24">Isa 5:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:5">Ezk 14:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai bambe, eihanga ry'ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Abantu abaijwire okutahikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Oruzaaro rw'enkozi z'ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Abaana abarikukora ebitahikire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Baimwire MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Baagaya Orikwera wa Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Baahinduka, baagaruka enyima.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:30">Yer 2:30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:3">5:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimwendera ki kuguma nimuteerwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Nimuturwa okugumizamu nimugoma?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Omutwe gwona gurwaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Omutima gugwereire kimwe enshazi;<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Okuruga aha mara g'ekigyere okuhika aha mutwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">Tihaine hahuriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">Kureka ebihuta, n'ebihonoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">N'ebironda ebirikunuuka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">Tibikamigwaga, tibikashembwaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">Nobu kwakuba okubobeezibwa n'amajuta.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:11">Isa 6:11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 6:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:51">Bir 28:51</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ensi yaanyu n'amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">Endembo zaanyu zookibwe n'omuriro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">Ensi yaanyu abanyamahanga nibagibariira omu maisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">Ebaire amatongo, emazirweho abanyamahanga.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:18">Yob 27:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saayuuni etsigirweho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:8">Nk'akaju k'omu musiri gw'emizaabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:8">Nk'eirindiro ry'omu musiri gw'emyongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:8">Nk'orurembo rugotsirwe.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Kut 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:29">Rom 9:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kuri MUKAMA ow'amahe ataratukwatiire ihembe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:9">Tukaabaire nka Sodoma, tuba nka Gomora.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Imwe bategyeki ba Sodoma 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">Muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">Naimwe abantu ba Gomora, mutegye okutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">Muhurire ebiragiro bya Ruhanga waitu!<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 15:8">Enf 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:20">Yer 6:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">Ebitambo byanyu ebirengyesereize nibingasira ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">Ntamirwe ebitambo byanyu ebyokize eby'empaya z'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">N'ebishaju by'amatungo agagomokire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">Kandi tindikushemerererwa shagama y'enimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">Nari ey'abaana b'entaama, nari ey'empaya z'embuzi.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Ku muba mwizire omu maisho gangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:12">N'oha owaabaragiire kuguma nimundibatiiririra ekibuga?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:9">Kub 28:9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 28:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:15">Yoel 2:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutagaruka kundeetera empongano ezitaine mugasho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Obubaane n'ekirikunugwa ahariinye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Okuboneka kw'ameezi, na zaasabato, n'okutaho enteerane-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Tindikubaasa kugumisiririza kutahikiirira hamwe n'okuteerana okurikwera.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Amagyenyi gaanyu ag'okuboneka kw'okwezi, n'agandi agaatairweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:14">omutima gwangye nigugangira kimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:14">Gankabize; okugagumisiririza kunduhize.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:22">1 Bag 8:22</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:4">Mik 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muritega emikono yaanyu, ndyabaima amaisho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">Nangwa n'obu muriguma nimushaba hakye-hakye, tindibahurira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">Ahabw'okuba engaro zaanyu ziijwire eshagama.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16, 17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:14">Zab 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:14">Yer 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:3">22:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwogye, mweboneze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:16">Mwiheho obubi bw'emicwe yaanyu omu maisho gangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:16">Murekye kukora kubi,<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Mwegye okukora gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">Musherure eby'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">Muhane abarikuhata abandi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">Murwanirire efuuzi, mutonganire abafaakazi.<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:26">Isa 43:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:7">Zab 51:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Mbwenu nimwije tuhanuure hamwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">Ebibi byanyu n'obu biraabe nibitukura nka karari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">Biryayera nk'orubaare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">N'obu biraabe nibitukura tuku-tuku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">Biryaba nk'ebyoya by'entaama ebirikwera.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Ku muraikirize, mwayoroba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:19">Muryarya ebirungi by'ensi;<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:5">Isa 40:5</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:4">Mik 4:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku muraayangye, mukagoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:20">Muryariibwa rurara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:20">Ahabw'okuba akanwa ka MUKAMA niko kaakigamba.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:20">Yer 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:23">31:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orurembo orwabaire nirwesigwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">Ka ruhindukire maraaya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">Omu eby'oburyo byabaire biri, n'eby'okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">Mbwenu hati abaitsi nibo barimu.<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Efeeza yaawe ehindukire enkamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:22">Viinyo yaawe efungwire;<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:28">Yer 5:28</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:3">Mik 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:10">Zek 7:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyiginya baawe n'abagomi, kandi nibakwatanisa n'abashuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Buri muntu naayenda enguzi n'okutoijerwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Tibarikurwanirira fuuzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Kandi emanja z'abafaakazi tizaakihika mu maramuriro gaabo.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:24">Kut 49:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">Ow'obushoboorozi owa Israeli arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">Iwe, ndyayemarira ekiniga aha bazigu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">N'ababisha bangye mbahoore enzigu.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 22:20">Ezk 22:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakutaho omukono gwangye, gukurwanise,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:25">Nyihiremu kimwe enkamba zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:25">Nkumaremu ebyoma by'amabaati.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:3">Zek 8:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyagaruraho abaramuzi baawe nk'obunyakare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">N'abahi b'obwengye baawe nk'omu kutandika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">Bwanyima oryayetwa orurembo rw'okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">Kandi orw'okwesigwa.<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Saayuuni eryacungurwa okukora eby'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:27">N'abaamwo abarikweteisa bacungurwe okuhikiirira;<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Kwonka abagomi n'abasiisi baryacwekyerezibwa kumwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:28">N'abarikwimuura MUKAMA bamarweho.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:5">Isa 57:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:3">65:3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:13">Hos 4:13</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 4:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba muryakwatwa enshoni ahabw'ebiti by'emirinzi ebi mwakunzire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:29">Kandi n'ahabw'emisiri ei mwayetooraniire;<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:7">Yer 17:7</ref>, <ref loc="JER 17:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba muryaba nk'omwela oguhotoka amababi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:30">N'omusiri ogutaine maizi.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Ow'amaani aryaba nk'eshisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">N'omurimo gwe guryaba nk'esiriira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">Byombi biryahiira hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">Habure ow'okubiraaza.<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Isaaya okuhanuurira enju ya Yakobo eby'obusingye</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Eki Isaaya mwene Amozi yaareebire ahari Yuda na Yerusaalemu-<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:2-4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 4:1-3">Mik 4:1-3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obunaku buryahika omu biro bya bwanyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">Orushozi rw'enju ya MUKAMA ruhamibwe aha mitwe y'enshozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">Rutunguukye, rukire ebibungo byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">N'amahanga goona gahimintikireyo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:20-23">Zek 8:20-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47">Luk 24:47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi amahanga maingi garyaija, gagire gati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Mwije twinamukye aha rushozi rwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Omu nju ya Ruhanga wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Atwegyese emitwarize ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Naitwe tubone kugigyenderamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Ahabw'okuba ebiragiro biryaruga Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">N'ekigambo kya MUKAMA kirugye Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:7">Zab 72:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:10">Zek 9:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryacwera amahanga emanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Aramure enganda nyingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Obwo zaarurara zaabo baryaziheeshamu amafuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">N'amacumu gaabo bagaheeshemu empabyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Eihanga tiriribangira rindi rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Kandi tibarigaruka kwega by'engamba.<verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Imwe nju ya Yakobo 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:5">Nimwije tugyendere omu mushana gwa MUKAMA.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhanuurira enju ya Yakobo ebirikutiinisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:14">Bir 18:14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 1:2">2 Bag 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:7">16:7</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 16:8">8</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 16:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 16:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okareka abantu baawe, enju ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">Noobatura okugira abafumu baingi b'oburugwa-izooba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">N'abaraguzi nk'Abafilistia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">Kandi n'okukora endagaano n'abanyamahanga.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Ensi yaabo eijwire efeeza n'ezaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">Obutungi bwabo tibwine bugarukiro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">Ensi yaabo eijwire embaraasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">N'ebigaari byabo tibiine bugarukiro.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:28">Yer 2:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ensi yaabo eijwire ebishushani ebirikuramibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:8">Nibaramya emirimo y'emikono yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:8">Ebi engaro zaabo ahabwabo zikozire.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Abantu b'obutoosha nibacureezibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:9">N'abakuru nibagarurwa ahansi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:9">N'ahabw'ekyo otabasaasira.<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 1:9">2 Tes 1:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Taaha omu nkiri z'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:10">Oyesherekye omu mucuucu okutiinisa kwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:10">N'ekitiinisa ky'obukuru bwe.<verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Emyekuniko y'omuntu eryagarurwa ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:11">N'amaryo g'abantu garibatiirirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:11">Eryo izooba MUKAMA wenka niwe arihimbisibwa.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 40:11">Yob 40:11</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 40:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ow'amahe aine ekiro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:12">Eki arirwanisizaho eby'amaryo n'ebirikwekuza byona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:12">N'ekintu kyona ekirikwetunguura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:12">Kandi byona biryagarurwa ahansi;<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 11:1">Zek 11:1</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 11:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akarwanisa emyereezi ya Lebanooni yoona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:13">Emiraingwa kandi erikwetunguura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:13">N'emyela ya Bashani yoona,<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />N'enshozi zoona endaingwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:14">N'ebibungo byona ebiraingwa,<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />N'omunaara gwona omuraingwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:15">N'orugo rwona orw'amabaare orugumire,<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:22">1 Bag 10:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'emeeri zoona eza Tarushiishi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:16">N'ebishushani byona ebirikushemeza.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Kandi emyekuniko y'omuntu eryacureezibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:17">N'amaryo g'abantu garyagarurwa ahansi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:17">Eryo izooba MUKAMA wenka niwe arihimbisibwa.<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Ebishushani byona ebirikuramibwa biryahweraho kimwe.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu baryahungira omu nyanga z'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">N'omu biina by'eitaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">Nibahunga okutiinisa kwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">N'ekitiinisa ky'obukuru bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">Ku ariimuka kutetemya ensi munonga.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:22">Isa 30:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:7">31:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba abantu baryanaga ebishushani byabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:20">Eby'efeeza n'eby'ezaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:20">Ebi baayekoreire kuramya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:20">Babinagire efukuzi n'obuhundu,<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />Beesherekye omu nyanga n'omu biharamanga by'amabaare agaatikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">Nibahunga okutiinisa kwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">N'ekitiinisa ky'obukuru bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">Ku ariimuka kutetemya ensi munonga.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:7">Kut 2:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Murugye aha bantu-buntu abarikwitsya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:22">Mbwenu bo nibo baahi?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarikureetwa ebibi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:26">Lev 26:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 4:16">Ezk 4:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">Naija kwiha ahari Yerusaalemu na Yuda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">Ekibaire kibatungire, n'eki babaire beegamiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">Eby'okurya byona n'amaizi goona ebibaire bibatungire-<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />Ow'amaani weena, omurwani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:2">Omuramuzi, nabi, omufumu, omukuru,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />Omukuru w'engabo makumi ataano, ow'ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:3">Omuhi w'obwengye, omunyamwoga w'obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:3">N'omuhaki w'engisha.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 10:16">Mub 10:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyataho abaana babe abanyiginya baabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:4">N'abeereere babategyekye.<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 7:2">Mik 7:2</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 7:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu baryaitwa kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">Omuntu weena aite kubi mugyenzi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">Na buri muntu mutaahi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">Abato bagaye abakuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">N'abataine kitiinisa bagaye abakiine.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Obwo omuntu aryakwata mwene ishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">Ow'omu ka ya ishe, amugire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">Iwe, nk'oku oine eky'okujwara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">Obe niiwe waaba omutegyeki waitu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">N'eri itongo, obe niiwe waaritegyeka;<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Eryo izooba aryahakana, agambe munonga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">Tindikwikiriza kuba ow'okubatambira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">Ahabw'okuba omu ka yangye tiharimu by'okurya, nari ebijwaro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">Timurikwija kungira mutegyeki w'abantu;<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:3">Isa 65:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba Yerusaalemu ecwekyereziibwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">Na Yuda egwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">Kandi nabarwanisa MUKAMA omu bigambo byabo n'omu bi barikukora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">Bagwisa kubi amaisho ge ag'ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Emireebekyere yaabo neehamya ku orubanja rubasingire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Nibakora ekibi butunu nk'aba Sodoma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Tibarikukishereka. Baryareeba enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Ahabw'okuba beereeteire akabi!<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 8:12">Mub 8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mugambire abahikiriire, ku barikwija kuba gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:10">Ahabw'okuba baryarya ebi emikono yaabo ekozire.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 8:13">Mub 8:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omubi we aryareeba enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:11">Ahabw'okuba ebi emikono ye yaakozire nibyo arizimuurirwa.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Abantu bangye nibaitwa kubi abaana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">Kandi nibategyekwa abakazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">Ai bambe bantu bangye! Abeebembezi baanyu nibabahabya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">Batsibyatsibya emihanda ei murikurabamu.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 4:1">Hos 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA aimukire kutonganisa abantu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:13">Ayemereire kubacwera orubanja.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 14:4">Zab 14:4</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:10">Amo 3:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naija kucwera emanja abakuru n'abanyiginya b'eihanga rye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">Mukama RUHANGA ow'amahe naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">Niimwe mwariire omusiri gw'emizaabibu, mukagumaraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">N'ebi mwanyagire abooro biri omu maka gaanyu.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 94:5">Zab 94:5</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:3">Mik 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki eki mukozire niki, kusingyera abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:15">N'okucwa abooro obusaasingo.<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuheru gw'abakazi b'emyekuniko</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">Abaishiki ba Saayuuni baine emyekuniko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">Nibagyenda nibanaga ebitsya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">Nibareebana n'amaisho g'amakune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">Nibagyenda nibakimbagira, nibarangiza amajugo aha maguru;<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Nikyo MUKAMA arirwariza aba baishiki ba Saayuuni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:17">Ebiguuna omu mitwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:17">Akajweka busha ebicweka byabo ebirikwitsa enshoni.<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Eryo izooba Mukama aryacwa enyerere zaabo ezi babaire nibakunisa, amahunde n'ebirezi <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />ebitaako, endaaba, ebitambaara, <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />ebikwemba, engoro, emyeko, otushanduukye tw'emigaju, engisha, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:47">Kut 24:47</ref>. </char></note> empeta z'omu nkumu n'ez'omu nyindo, <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />ebijwaro by'amagyenyi, emyenda, eminagiro, enshaho z'omu ngaro, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />emyenda y'obutimba n'eya kitaani, ebikwemba n'eby'okwetwekyerera ahamaisho.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:12">Isa 22:12</ref>; <ref loc="EST 2:12">Est 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omu mwanya gw'emigaju haryabamu ekinuuko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 3:24">Omu mwanya gw'omweko habemu omugoye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 3:24">Omu mwanya gw'eishokye ry'omushasha habemu oruhara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 3:24">Omu mwanya gw'okwezirika emitanda, beezirikye ebiguniya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 3:24">N'ahaabaire hari harungi hagire enkojo.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Abashaija baawe baryaitwa rurara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 3:25">N'amamanzi gaawe gagwe aha rugamba.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:2">Yer 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:4">Tonz 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:10">2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu marembo ga Saayuuni baryarira, baboroogye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 3:26">Bashutame ahansi beeshobeire.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 3:6">Isa 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 30:23">Kut 30:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba abakazi mushanju baryaza aha mushaija omwe, bamugire bati: Nitwija kweriisa, twejwekye, kwonka otwikirize, twetererwe eiziina ryawe; otwiheho ekihemu.<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukama okuraganisa Saayuuni ebirungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:6">27:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:15">33:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:8">Zek 3:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:12">6:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba eitaagi rya MUKAMA riryaba rirungi kandi ery'ekitiinisa; n'Abaisraeli abariba bahonokireho, ebyezire omu nsi yaabo biryabeehimbisisa, bibareetere ekitiinisa. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:13">Isa 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:20">10:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:28">Zab 69:28</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:32">Kur 32:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:20">Luk 10:20</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omuntu weena oriba atsigaireho omuri Saayuuni na Yerusaalemu, akahandiikwa omu bahuriire baamwo, aryayetwa orikwera, <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezk 36:25</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Mukama ku ariba yaherize kwozya oburofa bw'abaishiki ba Saayuuni, n'okumaraho amabara g'eshagama omuri Yerusaalemu, naabiihisaho omwoyo gw'emanja z'oburyo n'ogurikwotsya. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Kur 13:21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima MUKAMA aryata aha rushozi rwona orwa Saayuuni n'aha bantu abariba bateeraniireyo ekicu n'omwika nyomushana, n'okuhweza kw'omuriro ogurikwaka nyekiro; ahabw'okuba ekitiinisa kyaho kyona haryagira eky'okukisangira kandi n'eihema; <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:4">Isa 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:5">Zab 27:5</ref>. </char></note> kibe eky'okukisangira omushana nyomushana, kandi obuhungiro n'obwegamo bw'eihunga n'enjura.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mukama okwemeza abantu be okumuhemukaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:8">Zab 80:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1">Mak 12:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ka nyeshongorere nkunzi yangye ekyeshongoro kya rukundo aha musiri gwe gw'emizaabibu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">Nkunzi yangye akaba aine omusiri gw'emizaabibu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">Aha kibungo kirikweza munonga.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:21">Yer 2:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaaguhinga, yaagwihamu amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Yaagubyaramu omuzaabibu ogurikuhita endiijo yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Yaagwombekamu omunaara gw'abarinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Yaagutamu einyuukiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Yaagira ngu nigwija kwana emizaabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Kwonka gwayana ey'omu kishaka.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />Mbwenu imwe batuuzi ba Yerusaalemu 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:3">N'abashaija ba Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:3">Nimbeeshengyereza mutushoboorore</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:3">Nyowe n'omusiri gwangye gw'emizaabibu.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 6:3">Mik 6:3</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 6:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekindi nkaakoreire ki ogu musiri gwangye gw'emizaabibu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">Eki ntaragukoreire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">Nkaba nyine amatsiko ngu guryayera emizaabibu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">Mbwenu ahabw'enki gwanire ey'omu kishaka?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:12">Zab 80:12</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:12">Hos 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu ka mbagambire eki ndaakore omusiri gwangye gw'emizaabibu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Niinyija kwihaho orugo rwagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Haza gwonerwe kimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Nsheenye orugo rwagwo rw'amabaare, guribatiirirwe;<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:23">Isa 7:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nguraze gurekye kusharirwa n'okuhingirirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">Kureka gumerwemu emikwatangwe n'amahwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">Kandi ndyaragiira ebicu birekye kugugwisiza enjura.<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Ahabw'okuba omusiri gw'emizaabibu ogwa MUKAMA ow'amahe n'enju ya Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">N'abashaija ba Yuda nikyo kibyairwe kye ekirikushemeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">akaba abaineho amatsiko g'okukora eby'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Kwonka yaabashangamu okusheesha eshagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">N'amatsiko g'okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Kwonka yaabashangamu okurira!<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuteisa enkozi z'ebibi ebitari bimwe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 2:2">Mik 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryareeba enaku, abarikwongyera amaka aha gandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">Bakeekubiraho ebibanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">Okuhitsya obu baraabimareho, hatagire ahatsigara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">Naimwe mukatsigara omu nsi mwenka.<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Mpuriire MUKAMA ow'amahe naarahira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:9">Buzimazima amaka maingi, amahango kandi amarungi garyaba emishaka;<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 45:11">Ezk 45:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba emisiri y'emizaabibu ikumi eryarugwamu ekiibo kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:10">Na homero emwe y'embibo erugwemu eefa emwe.<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 23:29">Enf 23:29</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 23:30">30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryareeba enaku, abaimuka kare</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:11">Kuza kusherura ebirikusinza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:11">Abatarama bakarenzya, okuhitsya obu amaarwa gabasinza!<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa 26:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:27">Yob 34:27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 6:5">Amo 6:5</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 6:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu magyenyi gaabo bagira enanga n'endingiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">Ebitaasa n'esheegu na viinyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">Kwonka tibeeta ha mirimo ya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">N'obu kwakuba okuteekateeka aha bi arikukora.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:3">Isa 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:7">Tonz 4:7</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 4:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:6">Hos 4:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo abantu bangye barikutwarirwa omu bukwatwa ahabw'okutamanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:13">Abashaija baabo b'ekitiinisa bakaitwa enjara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:13">N'abandi boona bakaitwa omwoma.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo Okuzimu eruruuhire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">Yaarangaaza munonga akanwa kaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">Abakungu ba Yerusaalemu n'abantu baamwo nibashuumayo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">Hamwe n'orikugyehimbisizamu.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:15, 16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:9">Isa 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu w'obutoosha agarwirwe ahansi, n'abakuru bacwirwe eishaija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:15">N'amaisho g'abarikwekunika gacureeziibwe;<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Kwonka MUKAMA ow'amahe ahimbisiibwe ahabw'okukora eby'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:16">Ruhanga orikwera naayeyoreka ku ari orikwera omu kuhikiirira.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Omu biro ebyo abaana b'entaama baryarya nk'oku bariira omu mariisizo gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:17">Enyana ezigomokire n'abaana b'embuzi biriire omu matongo.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Baryareeba enaku, abakurura okutahikiirira n'emirunga y'ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:18">Abakurura ekibi nk'oku bakurura ekigaari n'emirunga,<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:5">Isa 66:5</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:4">2 Pet 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abagira bati: Naayehuute!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">Naarahutsye emirimo ye, tugireebe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">Enaama z'Orikwera wa Israeli zihikye haihi, ziije tuzimanye!<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Baryareeba enaku, abeeta ekibi ekirungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">N'ekirungi bakakyeta ekibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">Abata omwirima omu mwanya gw'omushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">N'omushana omu mwanya gw'omwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">Abata ebirikushaarira omu mwanya gw'ekirikunuuriirira!<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:7">Enf 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:16">Rom 12:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryareeba enaku, abeemanya obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:21">Bakeeteekateekaho ku bari enkyengi.<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:11">Isa 5:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryareeba enaku, baarurangaanwa omu kunywa amaarwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:22">N'amamanzi omu kuturira ebirikusinza,<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:8">Kur 23:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abasingisa abaakusingirwe ahabw'enguzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:23">N'otaine rubanja bakamwima ebimushemereire!<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:4">Isa 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:9">30:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:5">Yoel 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo nk'oku ekirimi ky'omuriro kyokyeza kimwe ebitsintsi by'embuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">Kandi nk'oku ebinyaatsi byomire bihwererera omu muriro ogurikwaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">Nikwo emizi yaabo eriba obujunde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">N'ebirabyo byabo bikooma, bikatuumuuka nk'omucuucu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">Ahabw'okuba bakanga Ebiragiro bya MUKAMA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">Baagaya ekigambo ky'Orikwera wa Israeli.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:12">Isa 9:12</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 9:17">17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 9:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:4">10:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 22:17">2 Bag 22:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo Ruhanga agiririire abantu be ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Akabanga omukono kubarwanisa, akabateera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Enshozi zikatetema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Emitumbi yaabo ekaba nk'esingo omu mihanda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Hoona nabwo ekiniga kye tikikabarugireho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Kureka omukono gwe gukibangire.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:18">Isa 7:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 18:3">18:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:49">Bir 28:49</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryaimukiza amahanga ga hare orurango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:26">Ageetese ekicurizo, garugye aha muheru gw'ensi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:26">Nago gaije juba nigeehuuta.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Omurigo tiharigira owaaruha, akateera entsibo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">Tihaine n'omwe orihungira nari origwejegyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">Enkoba ezi beezirikiise tiziriyuga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">N'enkaito zaabo tiziricweka;<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Emyambi yaabo eryaba eine obwogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">amata gaabo gareegire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">Ebyara by'embaraasi zaabo biryaba nibishusha nk'amabaare g'enkangabuye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">Na nyamuziga zaabo niziiruka nk'akasoorora.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Okutsinda kwabo kuryaba nk'okw'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">Batsinde nk'emigunju y'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">Baryaruruma, bakwate eminyago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">Bagitwarire kimwe, habure ow'okujuna.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:22">Isa 8:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba baryabahoorereraho nk'okuhoorera kw'enyanja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">Omuntu weena ku ariza kugira ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">Aryareeba ensi eijwire omwirima n'obusaasi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">Kandi n'ebicu bizibiire omushana kwaka.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mukama okweyoreka Isaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:19">1 Bag 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:23">2 Bus 26:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:41">Yoh 12:41</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka ogu omugabe Uziya yaafeereiremu, nkareeba Mukama ashutami aha kitebe ky'obukama, kiraingwa, ekitairwe ahaiguru, n'ebijwaro bye ebiragaize biijwire hekalu. <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Baaserafi beemereire ahaiguru ye; buri omwe aine amapapa mukaaga, abiri ageekingiize ahamaisho, abiri agashwekire ebigyere, kandi abiri naagagurukisa. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:21">Kub 14:21</ref>. </char></note> Omwe yayeta mugyenzi we naagira ati: MUKAMA ow'amahe n'Orikwera, n'Orikwera, n'Orikwera; ensi yoona eijwire ekitiinisa kye. <verse eid="ISA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:10">1 Bag 8:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 8:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Emisingi y'ebiti by'amarembo yaatengyetsibwa eiraka ry'ogwo owaagambire, enju yaijura omwika. <verse eid="ISA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:8">Luk 5:8</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naagira nti: Ai bambe! Mbwenuho naahitsya, ahakuba ndi omuntu w'eminwa etashemeire, kandi ntuura omu bantu abaine eminwa etashemeire; ahabw'okuba amaisho gangye gaareeba Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe.<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Ahonaaho omwe ahari baaserafi yaaguruka, yaija ahi ndi aine eikara eririkwotsya omu ngaro, eri yaiha aha itambiro n'oruhana. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Yaarinta aha minwa, yaagira ati: Reeba, eri ryakukora aha minwa, okutahikiira kwawe kwakwihwaho, n'ekibi kyawe kyasaasirwa. <verse eid="ISA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Kut 1:26</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naahurira eiraka rya Mukama naagira ati: Ntume oha, kandi n'oha oraatugyendere? Ntyo naagarukamu nti: Ndi aha; ba niinye waatuma. <verse eid="ISA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9, 10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:14">Mat 13:14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mak 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:10">Luk 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:26">Byak 28:26</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 28:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Irooko ogambire abo bantu oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">Okuhurira kwo muhurire, kwonka mutashoborokyerwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">N'okureeba mureebe, kwonka muteetegyereza;<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Yoh 12:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hindura emitima y'abo bantu ebirite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Oigare amatu gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Kandi ohumye amaisho gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Batakaareebesa amaisho gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">N'okuhurira n'amatu gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">N'okwetegyereza n'emitima yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">N'okuhinduka ngu bakizibwe.<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:7">Isa 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naagira nti: Mukama wangye, ebyo biryahitsya ryari? Yangarukamu ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">Okuhitsya obu endembo ziriba emishaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">Hatakiine otwiremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">N'amaju hatakiine ogarimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">N'ensi ekabeera kimwe amatongo,<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />MUKAMA akaihayo abantu, akabatwara hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:12">Omu nsi yoona hakabamu emyanya mingi y'ebifurukwa.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:6">Bir 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14:7">Yob 14:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi n'obu haritsigaramu ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">Nakyo kiryamarwaho, nk'ekiti ky'omwela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">Nari omunyinya, ekyatemirwe kikatsigara kiri ekitsintsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">Nikwo n'oruzaaro orurikwera ruriba ekitsintsi kyabo.<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Isaaya okugambira Ahazi eby'okumugumya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:37">2 Bag 15:37</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:5">16:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu busingye bwa Ahazi mwene Yosamu, mutabani wa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda, Rezini omugabe wa Siria na Peeka mwene Remalia omugabe wa Israeli, bakainamuka Yerusaalemu kugirwanisa, kwonka tibaagibaasa. <verse eid="ISA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:12">Isa 8:12</ref>. </char></note> Ab'enju ya Daudi ku baagambiirwe ngu Abasiria bakwataniise na Abaefuraimu, omutima gwa Ahazi n'emitima y'abantu be yaatetema nk'emiti y'omu kibira erikutengyetsibwa omuyaga. <verse eid="ISA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 36:2">Isa 36:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:17">2 Bag 18:17</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira Isaaya ati: shohora hati, ogyende na mutabani waawe Sheari-yashubu, obugane Ahazi aha muheru gw'omukura gw'ekiyanja kya ruguru, ekiri aha muhanda ogurikuza aha musiri gw'omwozi; <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />haza omugire oti: Oyerinde, ohitsye omutima omunda, orekye kutiina, kandi otahahaazibwa ekiniga kingi kya Rezini n'Abasiria, n'ekya mwene Remalia; bari nk'ebicumurwa bibiri by'enkanza zirikucumba. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Noomanya ku Abasiria n'Abaefuraimu na mwene Remalia bakugiriire enaama mbi nibagira bati: <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />Mwije twinamukye tuteere Yuda, tubatiinise, tubeekubuurire, twemekye mwene Tabeeli, abe omugabe waayo. <verse eid="ISA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:10">Isa 8:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Mukama RUHANGA agizire ati: Enaama yaabo terikwija kuhama, kandi terihikiirira; <verse eid="ISA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />Ahabw'okuba omutwe gwa Siria ni Damasiko, n'omutwe gwa Damasiko ni Rezini; kandi emyaka makumi mukaaga n'etaano etakahwireho, Abaefuraimu baryacuubwamu ebicweka, babe batakiba ihanga. <verse eid="ISA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:20">2 Bus 20:20</ref>. </char></note> Omutwe gwa Efuraimu ni Samaria, n'omutwe gwa Samaria ni mwene Remalia. Ku muraayangye kwikiriza, buzimazima timurihama.<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akamanyiso ka Emanueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />MUKAMA yaagaruka yaagira Ahazi ati: <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />Shaba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akamanyiso, oshabe akarikuhika Okuzimu owa Nyamuteza, nari akarikuhika ahaiguru owa Herebe. <verse eid="ISA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Kwonka Ahazi yaagira ati: Tindikwija kushaba, kandi tindikwija kugyeza MUKAMA. <verse eid="ISA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Isaaya yaagira ati: Imwe nju ya Daudi 'mwe, nimuhurire! Nimugira ngu n'ekintu kikye okurusya abantu, mukataho n'okurusya Ruhanga wangye? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:23">Mat 1:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1:31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:34">34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:35">35</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Mukama wenka aribaheera akamanyiso. Reeba, omwishiki oshugaine aryagira enda, azaare omwana w'omwojo, amwete Emanueli. <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />Ogwo mwana, ku arimanya kwanga ekibi n'okwihamu ekirungi, aryatungwa amate g'amakamo n'obwoki. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:12">Isa 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:4">8:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba omwana ogwo ku ariba atakagizire bwengye bw'okwanga ekibi n'okwihamu ekirungi, ensi z'abo bagabe bombi, abu orikutiina, ziryaba ebifurukwa. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:7">Isa 8:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 8:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:32">Neh 9:32</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:20">2 Bus 28:20</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:16">1 Bag 12:16</ref>. </char></note> Iwe n'abantu baawe n'enju ya sho, MUKAMA aryabareetaho ebiro ebitakabahoga okwiha obu Abaefuraimu baataana n'Abayuda, nikwo kuteerwa omugabe wa Asiria.<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucwekyerezibwa kw'ensi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Omu bunaku obwo MUKAMA aryayetesa ekicurizo eshohera eziri omu bicweka by'obukomooko bw'emigyera ya Misri, n'enjoki z'omu nsi ya Asiria, <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />byona biije bijanjaare omu mpanga ezitatuurwamu n'omu nyanga z'amabaare n'omu bishaka by'amahwa byona n'omu mariisizo goona. <verse eid="ISA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:7">Isa 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:13-16">2 Bag 18:13-16</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo Mukama aryamwa eishokye aha mutwe n'obwoya aha bigyere, abimwaise orumweiso rw'entiizano oruriruga seeri y'omugyera Furaati, niwe mugabe wa Asiria; kandi rumareho n'obureju.<verse eid="ISA 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />Omuri obwo bunaku omuntu aryariisa ente nto y'ejigija, n'entaama ibiri; <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />kandi ahabw'amate agu zirikukamwa kuba maingi, aryatungwa amate g'amakamo; kandi n'abaritsigara omu nsi boona baryatungwa amate g'amakamo n'obwoki. <verse eid="ISA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:6">Isa 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu bunaku obwo omwanya gwona ogwabaire gubamu emizaabibu rukumi, erikugura shekeli rukumi, guryamerwamu emikwatangwe n'amahwa. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Oine obuta n'emyambi niwe arihikayo, ahabw'okuba ensi yoona eryaba emezibwamu emikwatangwe n'amahwa. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:12">Isa 32:12</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 32:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'ebibungo byona ebyabaire bihingisibwa efuka, oryatiina kubihikamu ahabw'egyo mikwatangwe n'amahwa, kureka biryaba eby'okunaguramu ente n'entaama.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Akamanyiso ka Maheri-shalali-hashibaazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:2">Hab 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yangira ati: Twara ekishate kihango ky'eibaare, okihandiikyeho omu nyuguta mpango oti: Ebya Maheri-shalali-hashibaazi. <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:10">2 Bag 16:10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naatunga baakareebi abarikwesigwa kubihamya, Uriya omunyamurwa na Zekaria mwene Yeberekia. <verse eid="ISA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Ntyo naaza owa nabikazi, yaagira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo. Bwanyima MUKAMA yangira ati: Mwete eiziina Mahari-shalali-hashibaazi; <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:16">Isa 7:16</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba ogwo mwana ku ariba atakamanyire kugamba “taata” nari “maama”, obutungi bwa Damasiko n'eminyago ya Samaria biryatwarwa omugabe wa Asiria, agyende abyebembeize.<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />MUKAMA yaagaruka yangira ati: <verse eid="ISA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:7">Yoh 9:7</ref>. </char></note> Aba bantu obu baayanga amaizi ga Shiloa agarikugyenda mpora, bakatiina Rezini na mwene Ramalia, <verse eid="ISA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:20">Isa 7:20</ref>. </char></note> Mukama naija kubarwanisa n'amaizi maingi g'amaani ag'omugyera Furaati, niwe mugabe wa Asiria n'ekitiinisa kye kyona; amaizi ago garyaijura, gashwekye emikura yoona, garengyere n'aha nkungu zaagwo zoona; <verse eid="ISA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa 7:14</ref>. </char></note> kandi garyahimintika, gahikye Yuda, gashandaare, gaijure, gahikye omu bitsya, kandi n'amapapa gaago agashashaanwire garyabuga ensi yaawe yoona, Emanueli.<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Imwe mahanga 'mwe, mweteerane, kwonka muryahendagurika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:9">Kandi naimwe ab'omu nsi za hare, mutegye amatu mwena;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:9">Mwezirikye, kwonka muryahendagurika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:9">Mutyo mwezirikye, kwonka muryahendagurika.<verse eid="ISA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Muhanuure hamwe, kwonka enaama zaanyu ziryafa busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:10">Mugambe ekigambo, kwonka tikirihama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:10">Ahabw'okuba Ruhanga ari hamwe naitwe.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />MUKAMA antaireho omukono gwe gw'amaani, yanteisa okutagyendera omu mitwarize y'eihanga eri nagira ati: <verse eid="ISA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:2">Isa 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:14">1 Pet 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Eki ab'eihanga eri barikweta obugomi, murekye kukyeta obugomi, kandi mutaritiina eki barikutiina, n'obu kwakuba okwitwa obwoba; <verse eid="ISA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:12">Kub 20:12</ref>. </char></note> kureka MUKAMA ow'amahe mube niwe mwaha ekitiinisa ahabw'okwera kwe, mube niwe mwatiina, akabaitsa obwoba. <verse eid="ISA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:16">Ezk 11:16</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Rom 9:33</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:8">1 Pet 2:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi niwe aribabeera Omwanya ogurikwera; kwonka aryabeera amaju ga Israeli gombi eibaare eririkuteeza entsibo n'orukiri orurikugwisa, abeere abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu obusya n'omutego. <verse eid="ISA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:13">Isa 28:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:44">Mat 21:44</ref>. </char></note> Baingi baryamuteeraho entsibo, bagwe, bahendekye, bakwatwe omutego, batwarwe.<verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:1">Isa 8:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 8:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Komera kimwe ebirikuhamya, ohamye n'akamanyiso ebiragiro omu beegi bangye. <verse eid="ISA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:15">Isa 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:3">Hab 2:3</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA orikwima enju ya Yakobo amaisho ndyamutegyereza, mmwineho amatsiko. <verse eid="ISA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:3">Isa 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:3">8:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:13">Heb 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, nyowe n'abaana abu MUKAMA ampaire turi akamanyiso n'eky'okutangaarira ahari Israeli, ebirikuruga ahari MUKAMA ow'amahe, otuura aha rushozi Saayuuni. <verse eid="ISA 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:3">Isa 19:3</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lev 19:31</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:11-14">1 Sam 28:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:24">2 Bag 23:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku baraabagire ngu, muraguze aha barikugambisa emizimu n'aha bafumu, abarikuviigiira, n'abarikuhuhuma, timurikumanya ngu abantu bashemereire kwehanuuza ahari Ruhanga waabo? Nimugira ngu eby'abahuriire bishemereire kwehanuuzibwa aha baafiire? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Ebiragiro n'ebirikuhamya mube nibyo mwayehanuuzaho! Ku baraabe batarikugamba nk'oku ekigambo eki kiri, buzimazima omushekye tiguribajugutira. <verse eid="ISA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Kureka baryaraba omu nsi, baine obusaasi bwingi n'enjara; kandi ku barigira enjara, baryagira ekiniga kingi, bakyeene omugabe waabo na Ruhanga waabo, baimutsye amaisho, bagahangye eiguru, <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:30">Isa 5:30</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:8">Nah 1:8</ref>. </char></note> kandi bagahangye ensi, babure eki baareeba, kureka obusaasi n'omwirima n'enaku eziri nk'obwire; bwanyima banagwe omu mwirima ndindindi.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ebirikuhanuura aha Mujuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1, 2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:15">Mat 4:15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 4:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka aha mwishiki ogwo owaabaire aine obusaasi, tiharibaho mwirima. Omu biro bya ira Ruhanga akagayisa ensi ya Zebuluuni n'eya Nafutaali, kwonka omu biro bya bwanyima egyo nsi aryagihindura ey'ekitiinisa, Galilaaya eyaabaire ekubwirwe abanyamahanga, seenu ya Yorudani, aha muhanda ogurikuza aha Nyanja.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Bag 15:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:4">2 Bus 16:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:79">Luk 1:79</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:8">Efe 5:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu abaabaire nibagyendera omu mwirima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:2">Bareebire omushana mwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:2">N'abaabaire batwire omu nsi y'ekibunda kya rufu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:2">Omushana gubajwereire.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:15">Isa 26:15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:36">Yoh 4:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okanyiise eihanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">Waayongyera aha kushemererwa kwabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">Nibashemererwa omu maisho gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">Nk'oku abashaija bashemererwa nibabagana eminyago.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:5">Isa 10:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 10:26">26</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 10:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:13">Nah 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 7:19-25">Bar 7:19-25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba omutwaro ogwabaire gubaremereire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">N'enkoni eyaabaire ebatuura aha mabega,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">N'ekihuuzo ky'orikubahata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">Obihenzire nk'aha izooba rya Midiani;<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Ahakuba eby'okurwanisa byona ebihagatirwa abarwani aha rugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:5">N'ebijwaro ebikuringirwe omu shagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:5">Biryaba eby'okwokibwa nk'enku omu muriro;<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:21">10:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:29">28:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:16">63:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:18">Yer 32:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mat 28:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:11">Luk 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:25">1 Kor 15:25</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:14">Efe 2:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba Omwana atuzaariirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Omwana w'omwojo atuhairwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Obutegyeki buryaba aha mabega ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">N'eiziina rye aryayetwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Omuhanuuzi orikutangaaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Tataitwe otahwaho, Mukama w'obusingye.<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:31">2 Bag 19:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:4">Zab 89:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:32">Luk 1:32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:33">33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okweyongyera kw'obutegyeki bwe n'obusingye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Tibirigira bugarukiro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Aha kitebe kya Daudi n'aha bukama bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Okubutaho n'okubuhigikiza eby'oburyo n'okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Okwiha hati n'okuhitsya ebiro byona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Obweziriki bwa MUKAMA ow'amahe nibwo burihikiiriza ekyo.<verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukama okuhana abantu be</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Mukama atumire ekigambo kuhana Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:8">Nikiija kuhika n'ahari Israeli,<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Kandi abantu boona baryakimanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:9">Abaefuraimu n'abatwire omuri Samaria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:9">Abarikugambisa amaryo n'emyekuniko y'omu mutima, nibagira bati:<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />Amatafaari gagwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:10">Kwonka nitwija kwombekyesa amabaare gabaizire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:10">Emisikamoori etemirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:10">Kwonka omu mwanya gwayo nitwija kutamu emyereezi.<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Nikyo MUKAMA arikwija kwimukiza ababisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:11">N'abazigu baabo kubarwanisa,<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:25">Isa 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:6">2 Bag 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:18">2 Bus 28:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abasiria bakareetwa oburugwa-izooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:12">N'Abafilistia oburengyerwa-izooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:12">Baarangaaza akanwa, baamira Abaisraeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:12">Hoona nabwo ekiniga kya MUKAMA tikikabarugireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:12">Omukono gwe gukibangire.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 7:10">Hos 7:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka abantu tibakagarukiire owaabateire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:13">N'obu kwakuba okusherura MUKAMA ow'amahe.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:15">Isa 19:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:13">Bir 28:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikwizira kutema ahari Israeli omutwe n'omukira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:14">akamaraho amataagi g'emikindo n'ekibingo aha izooba rimwe.<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Omushaija mukuru ow'ekitiinisa, nigwo mutwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:15">Kandi nabi orikwegyesa ebishuba, nigwo mukira;<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Ahabw'okuba abarikwebembera aba bantu nibabahabisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:16">Kandi abo abu beebembeire nibamarwaho.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />N'ahabw'ekyo Mukama tarikwesiima habw'abatsigazi baabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Kandi tarigirira saasi fuuzi zaabo n'abafaakazi baabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">ahakuba buri muntu tarikweta hari Ruhanga, kandi n'enkozi y'ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Kandi omuntu weena naagamba eby'obushema.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Hoona nabwo ekiniga kya MUKAMA tikikabarugireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Omukono gwe gukibangire.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Manya, okutahikiirira nikwotsya nk'omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:18">Kumaraho emikwatangwe n'amahwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:18">kutweka ekishaka kikwataine eky'omu kibira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:18">Bituumuukira omu kiika kingi.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 7:2">Mik 7:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'ekiniga kya MUKAMA ow'amahe ensi neesya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:19">N'abantu baayo nibashusha nk'enku z'okuhembesa omuriro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:19">Tihariho n'omwe orikusaasira mwene ishe.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:21">Isa 8:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu aryashahura eby'okurya aha rubaju rwa buryo, kwonka agume n'enjara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">Ondiijo aryamirakwo eby'aha rubaju rwa bumosho, kwonka tarihaaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">Buri muntu aryarya enyama y'omubiri gwa mutaahi we.<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 28:6-8">2 Bus 28:6-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manaase aryarya Efuraimu, na Efuraimu arye Manaase;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:21">Kandi bombi bakwatanise bateere Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:21">Hoona nabwo ekiniga kye tikikabarugireho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:21">Omukono gwe gukibangire.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 94:20">Zab 94:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:8">Yer 8:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryakara abataho ebiragiro ebitari by'okuhikiirira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:1">N'abahandiiki abahandiika eby'okuhata,<verse eid="ISA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />Ngu babone kwitaita emanja z'abakyene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:2">N'okwaka abooro b'omu bantu bangye ebibashemereire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:2">N'okunyaga abafaakazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:2">N'efuuzi okuzigira eminyago.<verse eid="ISA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:26">Isa 5:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:29">Yer 5:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muryakora ki aha izooba ry'okufubirwa kwanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:3">N'okuhwerekyerezibwa okuriruga hare?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:3">Muryahungira ahari oha, ngu abahe emikono?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:3">Kandi obutungi bwanyu muryabutsiga hi?<verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:12">Isa 9:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muryaba mutakiine kindi ky'okukora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:4">Kureka okweyinamirira omu mbohe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:4">Nari okugwa ahansi omu baitsirwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:4">Hoona nabwo ekiniga kye tikikabarugireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:4">Omukono gwe gukibangire.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhanwa kw'Abaasiria</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:4">Isa 9:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Asiria, enkoni y'okuguubwa kubi kwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:5">Ekihuuzo ky'ekiniga kyangye,<verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Ndyamwohereza kurwanisa eihanga eriteeta hari Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:6">Mmuragiire kuteera abantu abu nyiniire ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:6">Abanyagye, atware eminyago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:6">Abaribatiiririre ahansi nk'ebyondo by'omu muhanda.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 4:12">Mik 4:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka tikwo arikwenda kukora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:7">N'omutima gwe tikwo gurikuteekateeka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:7">Kureka ekiri omu mutima gwe n'okucwekyereza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:7">Kandi n'okumariraho kimwe amahanga gatari makye;<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Ahabw'okuba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:8">Abakuru b'engabo zangye boona t'abagabe?<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:9">2 Bag 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:6">17:6</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:13">19:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kalino terikwingana na Kakemishi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:9">Hamasi terikwingana na Arupaadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:9">Nari shi Samaria na Damasiko?<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:17">2 Bag 19:17</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 19:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku omukono gwangye gwahikire aha mahanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:10">Agaabaire garimu ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, ebibaizire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:10">Ebirikukira eby'omuri Yerusaalemu na Samaria,<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:8">Isa 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:34">2 Bag 18:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tindigira Yerusaalemu n'ebishushani byayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:11">Nk'oku naagizire Samaria n'ebyabyo?<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:4">Isa 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:31">2 Bag 19:31</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 19:35-37">35-37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukama ku ariheza kukora byona, ebi amaririire kukora aha rushozi Saayuuni na Yerusaalemu, aryafubira omugabe wa Asiria naamutura amaryo ge n'okwehimbisa kwe n'emyekuniko ye; <verse eid="ISA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13, 14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:23-25">Isa 37:23-25</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">Nkabikoresa amaani g'omukono gwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">N'obwengye bwangye, ahakuba nyine okwetegyereza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">Naihaho emyatano y'amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">Naanyaga obutungi bwago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">Nk'emanzi naiha aha ngoma abaabaire bari aha bitebe by'obugabe.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Omukono gwangye gwagwa aha butungi bw'amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Nk'owaagwa aha kyashuri ky'enyonyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Kandi nk'oku omuntu ateeranira hamwe amahuri agu enyonyi etsigireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Nikwo naanye naateeraniire hamwe amahanga g'ensi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Hakabura owaimutsya eipapa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Nari owaayashamya akanwa, n'obu kwakuba okuteeza.<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Nimugira ngu empango neebaasa kwehimbisiza aha muntu orikugitemesa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:15">Nari omusimeeno ahari ogwo orikugusharisa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:15">Ni nk'oku enkoni yaakutengyetsa ogikwaitse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:15">Nari nk'oku ekihuuzo kyakwimutsya omuntu otari kiti!<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Nikyo Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:16">Arirwariza engabo ze amamanzi omunywengyerero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:16">Kandi ahansi y'ekitiinisa kye haryaimukayo okwaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:16">Okurikushusha okwaka kw'omuriro.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="OBA 1:18">Oba 18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushana gwa Israeli guryaba omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:17">N'Orikwera we abe ekirimi kyagwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:17">Ogwo muriro guryayotsya amahwa ge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:17">N'emikwatangwe ye, gubimareho eizooba rimwe.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:33">Isa 10:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA aryamaraho ekitiinisa ky'ekibira kye n'eky'ensi ye erikweza munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:18">Ahwerekyereze omutima n'omubiri gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:18">Abe nk'omuntu orwaire oku ahwa aha magufa.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Emiti eritsigara omu kibira kye ebe mikye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:19">Ei omwana arikubaasa kuhandiika.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 4:2">Isa 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:7">2 Bag 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:14">19:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba Abaisraeli abariba batsigaireho, n'ab'enju ya Yakobo abariba bahonokireho, tibarigaruka kwegamira owaabateire, kureka omu mazima baryayegamira MUKAMA Orikwera wa Israeli. <verse eid="ISA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Aba Yakobo abariba bahonokireho baryagarukira Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi. <verse eid="ISA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22, 23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:13">Isa 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:22">28:22</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:27">Rom 9:27</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 9:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka, n'obu abantu baawe Abaisraeli baraabe nibaingana nk'omusheenyi gw'aha nyanja, ekicweka kyabo kikye ekirihonokaho nikyo kirigaruka. Okucwekyerera kukaragiirwa, kushandaarira hamwe n'okuhikiirira, <verse eid="ISA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />ahabw'okuba Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe, aryabamaraho omu nsi yoona, nk'oku kyaragiirwe.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Nikyo Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe, arikugirira ati: Imwe bantu bangye mwe, abatwire Saayuuni, mutatiina Abaasiria, ku baraabateeze enkoni, baababangira ebihuuzo, baabagira nk'oku Abanyamisri baabagizire, <verse eid="ISA 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 17:14">Isa 17:14</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba hatsigaireho akaanya kakye, okuguubwa kubi kwangye kurugye ahariimwe; bwanyima ekiniga kyangye kiryabahindukana, mbacwekyereze. <verse eid="ISA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:4">Isa 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:16">Kur 14:16</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:35">2 Bag 19:35</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA ow'amahe aryabaasha, nk'oku yaagizire Midiani aha rukiri rwa Orebu, kandi enkoni ye aryagiimutsya aha nyanja, agibangye, nk'oku yaagizire omuri Misri. <verse eid="ISA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Eryo izooba omutwaro ogu yaakwekoreize guryakuruga aha ibega, kandi enkomo ye eryakwihwa omu bitsya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:27">Yainamuka naaruga Rimoni,<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Yaahika Ayasi, yaaraba Migirooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:28">Mikimaashi niyo abiikire ebintu bye,<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Baarengyera omu kakiro, baaraara Geeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:29">Aba Raama nibatetema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:29">Aba Gibeya eya Saulo baahunga.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Iwe Galimu, imutsya eiraka, otakye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:30">Naiwe Laisha, okihurire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:30">Iwe Anatoosi, mugarukyemu!<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Aba Madimeena nibacwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:31">N'abatuuzi ba Gebimu nibahunga kuronda obukiriro.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Eri izooba naija kuraara Noobu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:32">Atigitire orushozi Saayuuni entomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:32">Nikyo kibungo kya Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:33, 34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:18">Isa 10:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:3">Ezk 31:3</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:12">Nah 1:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:33">Aryatema amataagi n'amaani garikutiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:33">Abarikukira abandi aha mutwe baryatemwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:33">N'abaraingwa baryagarurwa ahansi;<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Kandi aryamaraho ebishaka by'omu kibira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:34">Lebanooni eryagwa n'emiti yaayo ey'ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhanuura ahari Yesu n'ebi arikora</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 17:12">1 Sam 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:8">Zek 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kitsintsi kya Yese haryatookamu akataagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:1">N'omu mizi ye haryarugamu eitaagi.<verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:10">Mak 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:32">Yoh 1:32</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:38">Byak 10:38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwoyo wa MUKAMA aryaguma ahariwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:2">Agire omwoyo gw'obwengye n'okwetegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:2">Omwoyo gw'okuhanuura n'obushoboorozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:2">Omwoyo gw'okumanya n'okutiina MUKAMA.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:24">Yoh 7:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kutiina MUKAMA nimwo arishemerererwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:3">Taricwa rubanja rw'amaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:3">N'obu rwakuba orw'okugambirwa,<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:2">Zab 72:2</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 72:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:6">Mal 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:8">2 Tes 2:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kureka aryacwera abooro emanja omu kuhikiirira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">N'abacureezi b'omu nsi aryabashoboorora omu bwinganisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">Kandi ensi aryagiteeza enkoni y'akanwa ke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">N'ababi aryabaitsa omwitsyo gwe.<verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe 6:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuhikiirira kuryaba orukoba rwe rw'okwezirikisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:5">N'obwesigwa bube orukoba omu bwezirikiro bwe.<verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 2:18">Hos 2:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushega guryataaha n'omwana gw'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">N'engwe eryabyama n'omwana gw'embuzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">Enyana n'entare n'enimi y'ekimasha ekigomokire biryaguma hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">Kandi omwana muto niwe aribifunya.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:25">Isa 65:25</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:14">Hab 2:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ente ziryariira hamwe n'edubu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:7">Abaana baazo baraare hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:7">Kandi entare eryarya obunyaatsi nk'ente.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Omwana orikwonka aryazaanira aha mwina gw'encwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:8">N'omwana w'encuukye aryata omukono gwe aha kiina ky'empiri.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Ebyo byona tibirikora kubi, n'obu kwakuba okwita</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">Aha rushozi rwangye rwona orurikwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">Ahabw'okuba okumanya MUKAMA kuryabuga ensi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">Nk'oku amaizi gabuga hoona omu nyanja.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okugarura Abaisraeli n'Abayuda abaatwairwe omu bukwatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:22">Isa 49:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:12">Rom 15:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi eryo izooba Orikwetwa ekitsintsi kya Yese aryabeera amahanga orurango; niwe amahanga garyetuurira, n'obutaaho bwe buryagira ekitiinisa. <verse eid="ISA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:13">Isa 27:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:1">Yer 44:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:10">Zek 10:10</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba Mukama aryagorora omukono gwe obwa kabiri kugarura abantu be abaahonokireho, naabaiha Asiria, Misri, Patiroosi, Esiopia, Elamu, Shinaari, Hamasi, n'aha birwa by'omu nyanja.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 56:8">Isa 56:8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:35">Yoh 7:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryaimukiza amahanga orurango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:12">Ateeranire hamwe Abaisraeli abaabingirwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:12">N'Abayuda abaataataine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:12">Naabaiha aha nshonda ina z'ensi.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:21">Isa 9:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:16">Ezk 37:16</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 37:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eihari rya Efuraimu riryahwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:13">Abarikuburabuza Yuda baryamarwaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:13">Efuraimu tarigirira Yuda ihari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:13">Na Yuda tariburabuza Efuraimu.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:1">2 Sam 8:1</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 8:2">2</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 8:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:26">12:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:28">Yer 49:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryahanantuka, bagwe aha mabega g'Abafilistia oburengyerwa-izooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:14">Kandi baryakwatanisa, banyagye ab'oburugwa-izooba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:14">Baryabangira Edomu na Moabu emikono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:14">N'Abaamoni baryabakubuukira.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:20">Isa 7:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA aryayomeza kimwe omukono gw'enyanja ya Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Aryareeta omuyaga gwe ogurikwomya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Naarabya omukono gwe aha mugyera Furaati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Aguteere, agucwemu emigyera mushanju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Abantu babone kugwambuka enkaito zitajubire.<verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:23">Isa 19:23</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:29">Kur 14:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abantu be abaahonokireho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:16">Baryabona omuhanda rugyendwa gw'okubaiha Asiria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:16">Nk'ogu Abaisraeli baaboine</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:16">Nibaruga omu nsi ya Misri.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Embabazi za Mukama aha bantu be</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Eryo izooba muryagira muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">MUKAMA, ninkusiima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">Ahabw'okuba, n'obu wangiriire ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">Kikatuuba; mbwenu ongarwire omutima omunda.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:2">Kur 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:14">Zab 118:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, Ruhanga niwe kujunwa kwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">Ndyaguma nimmwesiga, tinditiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Yehoova niwe maani gangye n'ekyeshongoro kyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">Kandi ahindukire okujunwa kwangye.<verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:14">Yoh 4:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo muriguma nimutahira amaizi omu maziba g'okujunwa mushemereirwe; <verse eid="ISA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:1">Zab 105:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 145:4">145:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 145:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 148:13">148:13</ref>. </char></note> kandi eryo izooba muryagira muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">Musiime MUKAMA, mutakire eiziina rye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">Mubuzye omu mahanga ebi yaakozire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">Murangye eiziina rye kuririkuhimbisibwa.<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />Mweshongorere MUKAMA eby'okumuhimbisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:5">Ahabw'okuba akozire eby'ekitiinisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:5">Ebyo bibugye ensi yoona.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:4">Isa 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 11:9">Hos 11:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe mutuuzi wa Saayuuni 'we, teera akaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:6">Oyeshongore ahabw'okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:6">Ahabw'okuba Orikwera wa Israeli ori omuriiwe ni mukuru.<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ekifubiro kya Babulooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Eby'okuhanuura ebi Isaaya mwene Amozi yaareebire ahari Babulooni.<verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:26">Isa 5:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwimutsye orurango aha kibungo kiraingwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:2">Mubarangire n'eiraka rihango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:2">Mubeetese omukono, bataahe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:2">Omu marembo g'abakuru.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Nyowe ndagiire abu naashoroire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:3">Naayeta amamanzi gangye agarikugyenda nigeesiima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:3">Kuhikiiriza eki ndikwenda ahabw'ekiniga kyangye.<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Nimuhurire! Omu bibungo nihareetwamu orwari</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Nk'orw'omutwe gw'abantu baingi munonga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Muhurire oruyombo rw'amahanga agateeraniire hamwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">MUKAMA ow'amahe naateerateerana amahe kuza aha rugamba.<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Garugire omu nsi ya hare aha muheru gw'eiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:5">Gari hamwe na MUKAMA n'eby'okurwanisa by'ekiniga kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:5">Naaza kucwekyereza ensi yoona.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 1:15">Yoel 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:7">Zef 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muboroogye, ahabw'okuba eizooba rya MUKAMA riri haihi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:6">Niriija nk'okucwekyereza okurikuruga aha W'obushoboorozi bwona!<verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:7, 8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:24">Yer 6:24</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 2:10">Nah 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo emikono yoona neija kuhwa amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:7">Buri muntu omutima gumuhwe omunda, bahahaare,<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Bagire obuhuruzi n'obusaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:8">Bashaashe nk'omukazi orikurumwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:8">Baryareebana nibatangaara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:8">Amaisho gabatukure.<verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Reeba, eizooba rya MUKAMA niriija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:9">Ritarikusaasira, riine ekiniga kingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:9">Okuhindura ensi amatongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:9">N'okucwekyereza abasiisi baayo n'okubamaramu.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezk 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">Yoel 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24">Mak 13:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba enyonyoozi z'omu iguru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:10">Na zaakakaaga zaazo tiziryaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:10">Eizooba riryairagura nirituruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:10">N'okwezi tikuryaka.<verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Ndyafubira ensi yoona ningitura eby'okushiisha byayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:11">N'ababi ahabw'okutahikiirira kwabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:11">Ndyamaraho emyehimbiso y'abanyamaryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:11">Ntuubye emyekuniko y'abataine saasi.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Abashaija baryaba ab'eicweka okukira ezaabu eshemeziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:12">N'ekyetwa omuntu okukira ezaabu ya Ofiri.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo nditengyetseza eiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:13">N'ensi ekatengyeta, ekaruga omu mwanya gwayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:13">ahabw'ekiniga kya MUKAMA ow'amahe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:13">Aha izooba ry'ekishinjo kye ekingi.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:16">Yer 50:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:9">51:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'esirabo ehiigirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:14">Nk'entaama ezitaine kitanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:14">Buri muntu aryagaruka omu ihanga rye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:14">N'omuntu weena ahungire omu nsi yaabo.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Orireebwa weena aryacumitwa, ryogyemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:15">Kandi orikwatwa weena aryagwa na rurara.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NAM 3:10">Nah 3:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abeereere baabo baryateerwa ahansi bacwagurikye, nibabareeba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:16">Amaju gaabo garyanyagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:16">N'abakazi baabo bahambwe.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:11">Yer 51:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nimbaimukiza Abameedi kubarwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:17">Abantu abateeta aha feeza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:17">N'obu kwakuba okukunda ezaabu.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Amata gaabo garyaita abatsigazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:18">tibarisaasira ruzaaro rw'enda zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:18">Kandi amaisho gaabo tigarigirira baana saasi.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 47:5">Isa 47:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:40">Yer 50:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Babulooni, ekitiinisa ky'amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:19">Oburungi n'okwehimbisa by'Abakaludaaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:19">Eryaba nka Sodoma na Gomora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:19">Obu Ruhanga yaazicwekyereza.<verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:43">Yer 51:43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Terigaruka kutaahwamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:20">Nari okutuurwamu obusingye bwona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:20">Abaharabu tibariteerayo mahema gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:20">Kandi n'abariisa tibarizaagizayo magana gaabo;<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:21, 22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:13">Isa 34:13</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 34:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kureka haryazaagirayo enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:21">Kandi amaju gaayo garyaijura enyamaishwa ezirikuhuuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:21">Okwo niyo maaya zirituura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:21">N'embuzi z'obwoshe niyo zirikinira.<verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Empitsi ziryahuumira omu minaara yaarwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:22">Na zaamuha ziboigorere omu bikaari birungi byarwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:22">Mbwenu obunaku bwarwo bwafunzire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:22">N'ebiro byarwo tibyakyongyerwaho.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ekifubiro ky'omugabe wa Babulooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:22">2 Bus 36:22</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:13">Zab 102:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:17">Zek 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:22">8:22</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 8:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA aryagirira Yakobo esaasi, kandi aryagaruka atoorane Abaisraeli, abagarure omu nsi yaabo; n'abanyamahanga baryaija beeteerane nabo, beekome aha nju ya Yakobo. <verse eid="ISA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:22">Isa 49:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:14">60:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:5">61:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abanyamahanga baryabatwara, babahitsye owaabo, ab'enju ya Israeli baryabahakira omu nsi ya MUKAMA, babagire abahuuku n'abazaana; baryatwara omu bukwatwa abo abaabaire babatwaire omu bukwatwa, kandi baryategyeka abaabaire babatwaza eikama.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />MUKAMA ku ariheza kubahuumuza obusaasi n'enaku n'obuhuuku obu mwabaire mwitirwamu kubi nibabakoresa, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:19">Isa 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:13">Yer 51:13</ref>. </char></note> muryateerera omugabe wa Babulooni enaku nimugira muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:4">Manya omurahuzi takiriho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:4">N'ekiniga ky'omunyarubwa kihweireho!<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:4">Isa 9:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ahenzire ekihuuzo ky'ababi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:5">Niyo nkoni y'abategyeki,<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />Abaabaire bateera abantu n'ekiniga batarekire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:6">Bakategyekyesa amahanga ekiniga, bakagahiiga batarikusaasira.<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:12">Isa 55:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu ensi yoona ehuumwire, etuurize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:7">Abantu nibateera akaari nibeeshongora.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 37:24">Isa 37:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:16">Ezk 31:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emiberooshi neekwesiimirana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:8">N'emyereezi ya Lebanooni neegira eti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:8">Okwiha obu waagarurwa ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:8">Tihariho mutemi oragarukire kututema.<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:9, 10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 32:21">Ezk 32:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuzimu owa Nyamuteza neeshutuka kukubugana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">Neimutsya emizimu y'abaabaire bari abategyeki b'ensi kukutangirira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">Boona abaabaire bari abagabe b'amahanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">Neebaiha aha bitebe byabo by'obugabe.<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Abo boona baryagamba nibakugira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:10">Naiwe ohindukire otaine maani nkaitwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:10">Waaba nk'oku turi?<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Ekitiinisa kyawe kishuumiibwe n'amaraka g'enanga zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:11">Bishuumiibwe Okuzimu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:11">Waayeyarira enyogori, kandi waazeeshweka.<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Iwe nyonyoozi y'omu buturuturu 'we, omwana w'omushekye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:12">K'orugire omu iguru okagwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:12">Iwe owaabaire ocwa amahanga busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:12">K'otemirwe, okaza aha itaka!<verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:53">Yer 51:53</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 8:10">Dan 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:23">Mat 11:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okaba ogira omu mutima gwawe oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">Ndyatemba omu iguru ahaiguru y'enyonyoozi za Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">Ekitebe kyangye nkite ahaiguru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">Ndyashutama aha rushozi rw'eiteeraniro okwo hare</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">Aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo.<verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 2:4">2 Tes 2:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyatemba mpikye ahaiguru y'ebicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:14">Nyehindure, mbe nk'Orikukira byona.<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 32:23">Ezk 32:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:23">Mat 11:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu shi ka waashuuma Okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:15">Okahika owa Nyamuteza!<verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Abaraakureebe nibaija kukushamaarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:16">Bakwetegyereze, nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:16">Ogu niwe mushaija owaabaire atengyetsa ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:16">Akatetemya amahanga g'abagabe,<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:33">Yer 50:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akahindura ensi eihamba ry'omusheenyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:17">Akasheenya endembo zaamwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:17">Akanga kureka enkwatwa ze kugaruka owaabo?<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Abagabe b'amahanga boona bagwejegyereire omu kitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:18">Buri muntu omu kituuro kye;<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Kwonka iwe onagirwe aheeru hare n'ekituuro kyawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">nk'eitaagi eryangiirwe kimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">Oshwekirwe emitumbi eitsirwe rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">Ekashuuma omu mabaare g'Okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">Nk'omutumbi oguribatiirirwe n'ebigyere.<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 21:10">Zab 21:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kuziikwa toriteerana nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">Ahabw'okuba okacwekyereza ensi yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">Waita abantu baawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">Oruzaaro rw'enkozi z'ebibi tirurigambwaho ebiro byona!<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:5">Kur 20:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muteguure ah'okwitira abaana be</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:21">Nibaturwa okutahikiirira kw'ishebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:21">Bataimuka bakakubuura ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:21">Bakagibuzya endembo.<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:19">Yob 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:62">Yer 51:62</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Niinyija kwimuka ndwanise aba Babulooni, mbabuze eiziina, habure owaahonokaho, mbamareho abaijukuru n'abaijukuruza; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="ISA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:11">Isa 34:11</ref>. </char></note> Ndyagigira obutuuro bw'ebisegyesi n'ebiyanja by'amaizi. Kandi ndyagyeyerera n'ekyeyerezo ekirikuhwerekyereza; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okuhana Abaasiria n'Abafilistia</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />MUKAMA ow'amahe arahiire naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:24">Nk'oku naateekateekire, nikwo kiriba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:24">Kandi kiryaba nk'oku naamaririire.<verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:27">Isa 10:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyahendagura Omuasiria ori omu nsi yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:25">Mmuribatiiririre aha bibungo byangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:25">Enkomo ye ebone kubarugaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:25">N'emitwaro ye ebarugye aha mabega.<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Egyo niyo naama eyaagiriirwe ensi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:26">Kandi ogwo nigwo mukono ogubangiirwe amahanga goona.<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 19:21">Enf 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:28">Yer 4:28</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:35">Dan 4:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu MUKAMA ow'amahe ku araabe niwe akimaririire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:27">N'oha orikizibira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:27">Omukono gwe ku guraabe gubangire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:27">N'oha origuhinya?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:20">2 Bag 16:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nibyo byahanwirwe omu mwaka ogu omugabe Ahazi yaafeereiremu.<verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />Imwe Bafilistia 'mwe mwena, mutashemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:29">Ngu ahabw'okuba enkoni eyaabateire ehendekire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:29">ahakuba omu kitsintsi ky'enjoka haryarugamu empiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:29">N'ekyana kyayo kibe enjoka y'obushegu erikuguruka.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Emijigaijo y'abooro eryatunga eby'okurya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">N'abakyene baryabyama buhooro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">Kwonka ekitsintsi kyawe ndyakiitsa enjara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">N'abarihonokaho baryaitwa.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 20:1">Isa 20:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe irembo 'we, borooga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">Naiwe rurembo 'we, ocure!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">Abafilistia mwena, muhahaaze emitima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">ahabw'okuba omwika gwareetwa aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">Kandi omu ngabo ze tihaine otsigaire enyima.<verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:12">Zef 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Entumwa z'eihanga baryazigarukamu bata?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:32">Bati: MUKAMA niwe yaataireho Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:32">Kandi omuriyo abantu be abarikwitwa kubi nimwo barihungira.<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ekifubiro kya Moabu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Yer 48:1-47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nabi yaahanwire ahari Moabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Aari orurembo rwa Moabu rucwekyereziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Rwamarwaho omu kiro kimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Na Kiiri eya Moabu ecwekyereziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Yaamarwaho omu kiro kimwe.<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Omwishiki wa Diboni ainamukire omu myanya mikuru kucurirayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:2">Abamoabu nibaboroogyera Neebo na Medeba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:2">Emitwe yaabo yoona n'enkomborora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:2">Kandi boona bamweire ebireju;<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Nibagyenda omu mihanda bajwaire ebiguniya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:3">Aha mitwe y'amaju gaabo n'omu nteeraniro z'emihanda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:3">Buri muntu naaborooga, naacura munonga.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Aba Heshibooni n'aba Eleale nibataka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:4">amaraka gaabo nigahika Yahazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:4">Nikyo engabo za Moabu zirikucurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:4">N'emitima yaabo ekatetema.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Omutima gwangye niguririra Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Abanyiginya baayo nibahungira Zoari</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Na Egelaasi-shelishiya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Aharikwinamuka Luhiisi niho barikwinamukira nibacura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">N'omu muhanda ogurikuza Horonaimu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Nimwo barikutakira okutaka kw'abarikucwekyerera.<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Amaizi ga Nimuriimu goomire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:6">Obunyaatsi buhotokire, obunyaatsi busya bwangire kumera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:6">Tihakiriho kintu kyona ekibisi.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Nikyo barikucwisiza ebi baatungire byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:7">N'ebi baabiikire, bakabyambutsya omugyera gw'emikinga;<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Ahabw'okuba okurira kubugire ensi ya Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:8">N'okuborooga kuhikire Egulaimu na Beereliimu.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Ahakuba amaizi ga Diboni gaijwire eshagama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:9">Kandi niinyija kureetera Diboni ebindi bihikiirizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:9">Niyo ntare erikwija kurya Abamoabu abahonokireho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:9">N'abatsigaire omu nsi yaabo.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 3:4">2 Bag 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutwekyere omutegyeki w'ensi abaana b'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:1">Mubaihe Seela aharikureeba omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:1">Mubahitsye aha rushozi Saayuuni.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Nk'oku enyonyi zitaataana, ekyashuri kisheenyirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:2">Nikwo n'abaishiki ba Moabu bari</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:2">aha nyambukiro za Arunooni,<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />Nibagira bati: Tuhe obwengye, ocwe emanja z'oburyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:3">Omu mushana gw'eihangwe otubeere ekibunda kibe nka nyekiro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:3">Osherekye encuubwa, kandi otareebya abacwire.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:3">1 Sam 22:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Encuubwa za Moabu ozirekye zigume omu nsi yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Ozibeere obuhungiro aha muhwerekyerezi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Orikuhata ku ariba atakiriho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Okucwekyereza kwahweireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Kandi n'orikuribatiirira abantu atakireebwa mu nsi,<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 32:1">Isa 32:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:14">Zab 89:14</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:33">Luk 1:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo ekitebe ky'obugabe kuryahamibwa omu kugirirwa embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:5">Habeho owaakishutamaho omu mazima omu ihema rya Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:5">Omuramuzi orikucwa emanja omu bwinganisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:5">Kandi orikurahuka kukora eby'okuhikiirira.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:29">Yer 48:29</ref>, <ref loc="JER 48:30">30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tukahurira eby'amaryo ga Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:6">Ku arikwekunika munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:6">Emyekuniko ye, amaryo ge, n'orubwa rwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:6">Kwonka okwehimbisa kwe n'okwa busha.<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Nikyo Abamoabu bariboroogyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:7">Buri muntu akacurira Moabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:7">Muryaririra ebiihuro by'emizaabibu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:7">Ya Kiruharaseesi, mushobererwa kimwe.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:8, 9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:32">Yer 48:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba emisiri ya Heshibooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">N'omuzaabibu gwa Sibuma, bihotokire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Abategyeki b'amahanga bacwire amataagi gaagwo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Agaabaire gahikire Yazeri, gakarengyera n'omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Kandi gukagaba agandi mataagi agaabugire hoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Gakambuka n'enyanja.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Nikyo ndikuriririra omuzaabibu gwa Sibuma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Nk'oku aba Yazeri barikuguririra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Iwe Heshibooni na Eleale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Ndyakushukaho amarira gangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Ahabw'okuba ebijuma byawe by'omu kyanda n'eby'omu ishaaruura ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Bibairemu enduuru z'engamba.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:33">Yer 48:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okushemererwa n'okwesiima biihirwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:10">Omu misiri erikwera munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:10">Omu misiri y'emizaabibu tibakyeshongoreramu byeshongoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:10">N'obu kwakuba okuteera akaari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:10">Tihakibamu munyuuki wa viinyo orikunyuukira omubwato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:10">N'akaari k'abanyuuki tikakihurirwa.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo omutima gwangye nigucurira Moabu nk'enanga y'omu rufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:11">Kandi n'omu nda yangye ninsaasibwa Kiriheresi.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 15:2">Isa 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:29">1 Bag 18:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Moabu ku ariija omu mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu kweyoreka, n'obu aryerusya akaza omu mwanya gwe ogurikwera kushaba, taine ki ariihamu. <verse eid="ISA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Ekyo nikyo kigambo eki MUKAMA yaagambire ira ahari Moabu. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Kwonka hati MUKAMA naagira ati: Omu myaka eshatu nk'ey'orikukorera ebihembo, ekitiinisa kya Moabu, n'obu araabe aine eihe rihango munonga, kiryagaywa, kandi abarihonokaho baryaba bakye munonga abataine maani.<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Damasiko</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:9">2 Bag 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Yer 49:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo 1:3-5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nabi yaahanwire ahari Damasiko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:1">Reeba, Damasiko teriba rurembo bundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:1">Kureka eryaba emituumo y'ebisheenyuka.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Endembo za Aroeri ziryaba ebifurukwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:2">Zibe amariisizo g'amasyo agaribyamamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:2">Hatagire kyagakanga.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:16">Isa 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:4">8:4</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:21">1 Sam 4:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri Efuraimu ebigo biryamarwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:3">Na Damasiko terigaruka kuba bugabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:3">N'Abasiria abarihonokaho baryaba nk'ekitiinisa ky'Abaisraeli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:3">Nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'obugabe bw'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:16">Isa 10:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba ekitiinisa kya Yakobo kiryabaganuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:4">N'okugomoka kwe kuryatuuba ahoroote.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:1">Isa 24:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kiryaba nk'omugyesi oku agyesha oburo bwezire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:5">Omukono gwe gukagyesha obushiisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:5">Kandi nk'orikuhumba oburo omu ruhita rwa Reefa.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:13">Isa 24:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka haryatsigaramu eby'okuhumba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:6">Nk'ebitsigara omu mutiini gutengyetsiibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:6">Ebijuma bishatu nari bibiri aha itaagi eririkukira agandi aha mutwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:6">Kandi ebijuma bitaano nari bina aha mataagi ag'omu mbaju zaagwo agarikwana munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:6">Nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 30:11">2 Bus 30:11</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:15">Hos 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:7">Mik 7:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba abantu baryata omutima aha Muhangi waabo, amaisho bagahangye Orikwera wa Israeli; <verse eid="ISA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8, 9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:9">Isa 27:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 27:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:13">Mik 5:13</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 5:14">14</ref>. </char></note> tibarita mutima ha matambiro agaayombekirwe emikono yaabo, kandi amaisho tibarigahanga Ashera nari ebishushani by'eizooba, ebi baakozire n'engaro zaabo. <verse eid="ISA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Eryo izooba endembo zaabo ezigumire ziryaba nk'ebifurukwa by'Abahiivi n'Abaamori, ebi baafurukiremu nibahunga Abaisraeli, haza habe amatongo.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:21">Zab 106:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba mukeebwa Ruhanga ow'okujunwa kwanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:10">Kandi timwaijuka Rukiri obuhungiro bwanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:10">N'ahabw'ekyo n'obu muraabyare emiti y'okweshemeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:10">mukagibyaraho engurukira ezirikuruga ahandi,<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />N'obu mwakugimeza aha izooba eri mwagibyariraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:11">Mukagireetera kurabya omuri ako kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:11">Kwonka eishoroma ryayo riryabura</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:11">aha izooba ry'enaku n'obusaasi obutarikutuuza.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Ai bambe, hurira okuhoorera kw'abantu baingi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:12">Nibahoorera nk'okuhoorera kw'enyanja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:12">Ai bambe okurigita kw'amahanga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:12">Nigarigita nk'okurigita kw'amaizi g'amaani.<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:13, 14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:4">Zab 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:5">9:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:13">83:13</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 22:23">Enf 22:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahanga nigarigira nk'okurigita kw'amaizi maingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">Kwonka We aryagakabukira, gahungire hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">Gabingwe nk'ebishushunga ebirikutwarwa omuyaga aha mutwe gw'ebibungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">Kandi nk'omucuucu ogurikutuumuurwa akasooroora.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Reeba, omu mwabazyo buryaba buri obwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:14">Kandi butakaseesire baryaba batakiriho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:14">Ogwo nigwo mugabo gw'abarikutunyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:14">Kandi ebyo nibyo birihika aha barikutwambura.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ebirikugambwa ahari Esiopia</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Ai bambe, iwe nsi erikuhooreza amapapa 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:1">Eya seeri y'omugyera gwa Esiopia,<verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />Etuma entumwa, zikaraba omu nyanja</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Nizigyendera aha maizi omu bwato bw'ebifunjo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Mwirooko, imwe ntumwa z'amaguru 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Muze omu ihanga ry'abantu baraingwa, ab'omubiri gurikuterera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Eritiinwa aba haihi n'aba hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Eihanga ery'amaani eriribatiirira agandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Eri ensi yaaryo etaanisiibwe emigyera.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Imwe batuuzi b'omu nsi 'mwe mwena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:3">Abatuura omu nsi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:3">Orurango ku ruriimukibwa aha bibungo, mureebe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:3">Kandi n'enzamba ku eriteerwa, muhurire!<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA angambiire naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:4">Ndyayegumira omu mwanya gwangye nindeeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:4">Nk'akashana kaamara embeho ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:4">Nk'orume rw'omu bunaku bw'omushana gw'eishaaruura.<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:5, 6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 31:3">Ezk 31:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 31:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 31:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo eishaaruura ritakahikire, orurabyo rwaragaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:5">Emizaabibu etakahiisize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:5">Amataagi mato aryagashariza oruhabyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:5">N'amataagi gatagwize agatemeho.<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Goona garyatsigarira amahungu g'omu nshozi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:6">N'enyamaishwa z'omu nsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:6">Amahungu garyagaraaramu omu kyanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:6">n'enyamaishwa z'omu nsi zoona zigatuuremu omu itumba.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:13">2 Sam 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:13">Zab 68:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:10">Zef 3:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri obwo bunaku baryareetera MUKAMA ow'amahe emitoijo erikutoijwa abantu baraingwa, kandi ab'emibiri erikuterera, eihanga eririkutiinwa aba haihi n'aba hare, ery'amaani eririkuribatiirira, eri ensi yaaryo etaanisiibwe emigyera, bagireete aha rushozi Saayuuni, omwanya gw'eiziina rya MUKAMA ow'amahe.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Misri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:7">Isa 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:12">Kur 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:13-26">Yer 46:13-26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:1-31:2">Ezk 29:1—31:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:18-32:32">31:18—32:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nabi yaahanwire ahari Misri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Reeba MUKAMA aheekirwe ekicu kirikwiruka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Naaza Misri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Ebishushani bya Misri ebirikuramibwa biryatetemera omu maisho ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">emitima y'Abanyamisri ebahwe omunda.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />Ndyateerana Abanyamisri barwane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:2">Buri muntu arwane na mwene ishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:2">Kandi buri muntu arwane na mutaahi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:2">Orurembo rurwane n'orundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:2">N'obugabe burwane n'obundi.<verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Abanyamisri emitima eryabahwa omunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:3">Naanye nyite enaama zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:3">Baraguze aha bishushani ebirikuramibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:3">Abarogi, abafumu, n'abarikugambisa emizimu;<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4-6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 30:12">Ezk 30:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamisri mbaheyo omu mikono y'omutegyeki w'omwaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:4">Kandi bategyekwe omugabe enshaarizi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:4">Nikwo Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe, arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Amaizi g'enyanja garyayoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:5">N'omugyera gwome, guhweho,<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Emikura yaagwo enuukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:6">N'amaizi g'otugyera twa Misri gaijururukye, goome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:6">Ebifunjo n'emibimbiri bijunde, bihweho.<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Amariisizo ga Nailo ag'aha nkungu zaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:7">N'ebihingirwe byona biryayoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:7">Bihweho, birekye kugaruka kureebwa.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Abategi b'eby'enyanja abarikutegyesa amarobo omuri Nailo boona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:8">Baryacura, baboroogye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:8">N'abarikutegyesa obutimba omu maizi gaayo baryacweka entegye.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Abakozi ba furakisi eshemeziibwe baryashoberwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:9">Hamwe n'abaruki b'emyenda ya pamba erikwera.<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Abaabaire bari enyomyo za Misri baryahendagurika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:10">N'abarikukorera ebihembo boona baryagira obusaasi.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Abanyiginya ba Zoani n'abashema buzima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">N'abahi b'obwengye ba Faraho nibamuha enaama z'obushema.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">Noobaasa ota kugira Faraho oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">Ndi omwana w'omunyabwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">Mwijukuru w'abagabe ba ira?<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:22">Byak 7:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu abanyabwengye baawe barahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:12">Nibakugambire, bakumanyise</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:12">Eki MUKAMA ow'amahe amaririire kukora Misri.<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Abanyiginya ba Zoani bahindukire abashema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:13">N'aba Noofu babeihabeihirwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:13">Kandi nibo bahabize Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:13">Haza kunu bari enyomyo z'enganda zaayo.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:22">1 Bag 22:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ataire omuri Misri omwoyo gw'okurabanamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:14">Baagireetera kugwererana omu bi erikukora byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:14">Nk'oku omusinzi agwererana naatanaka.<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:14">Isa 9:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Misri terigira murimo gwona ogwakorwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:15">Ogwakukozirwe omutwe nari ekibunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:15">Amataagi g'emikindo nari ekibingo.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:15">Isa 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:6">Zab 48:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:30">Yer 51:30</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:13">Nah 3:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba Abanyamisri baryaba nk'abakazi, batetemesibwe obwoba oburikureetwa omukono gwa MUKAMA ow'amahe, ogu ababangiire. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Ensi ya Yuda eryaba ekirikutiinisa Abanyamisri; omuntu weena origigambirwa aryatiina, ahabw'eki MUKAMA ow'amahe amaririire kukora, ngu abarwanise. <verse eid="ISA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Omuri obwo bunaku haryabaho endembo itaano ezirikugamba orurimi rw'Abanyakanaani, zikarahira MUKAMA ow'amahe. Rumwe ahari ezo ruryayetwa Orurembo rw'okuhwerekyerera. <verse eid="ISA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18">Kut 28:18</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 5:17">2 Bag 5:17</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba haryabaho eitambiro eryombekyeirwe MUKAMA ahagati omu nsi ya Misri, kandi n'enyomyo eribyarirwa MUKAMA aha mwatano gwayo. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:26">Yos 24:26</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 24:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:21">Oba 21</ref>. </char></note> Eryaba akamanyiso n'ekirikuhamya MUKAMA ow'amahe omu nsi ya Misri. Ku baritakira MUKAMA ahabw'abarikubahata, aryabooherereza omujuni w'okubarwanirira, abajune. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:16-18">Zek 14:16-18</ref>. </char></note> Obwo aryamanywa omuri Misri, n'Abanyamisri baryamumanya, bamuramye nibamutambira ebitambo, n'okumuhongyera empongano, kandi bamuraganise, bahikiirize ebi baamuraganiise. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:25">Yer 46:25</ref>, <ref loc="JER 46:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA aryarwanisa Misri; omu kubarwanisa abaite kandi abatambire, bwanyima bagarukye ahari MUKAMA; kandi aryahurira okweshengyereza kwabo, abatambire.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:16">Isa 11:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo haryabaho omuhanda rugyendwa okuruga Misri okuhika Asiria; Abaasiria baze Asiria, baramye hamwe nabo. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Kandi obwo Abaisraeli, Abanyamisri na Abaasiria bonshatu baryakwatanisa, bagume nibahaisa ensi omugisha; <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:23">Isa 29:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:9">Bir 32:9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:29">Rom 3:29</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ow'amahe abahaire omugisha naagira ati: Misri abantu bangye, Asiria ei emikono yangye yaahangire, na Israeli obuhunguzi bwangye baheebwe omugisha.<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Misiri na Esiopia okuhanuurwaho eby'okutwarwa omu bukwatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:17">2 Bag 18:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka ogu Tarutaani, owaatumiirwe Sarugooni omugabe wa Asiria, yaiziiremu Ashidoodi, akagirwanisa, akagikwata, <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:24">1 Sam 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 1:8">Mik 1:8</ref>. </char></note> omu bunaku obwo MUKAMA akagambira Isaaya mwene Amozi, ati: Irooko, oyezirikuurure ebiguniya, ojuure enkaito. Nawe nikwo yaakozire, akagyenda ajwaire busha, kandi ataine nkaito. <verse eid="ISA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:18">Isa 8:18</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA akagira ati: Nk'oku omwiru wangye Isaaya amazire emyaka eshatu naagyenda ajwaire busha kandi ataine nkaito, okubeera Misri na Esiopia akamanyiso n'eky'okutangaaza, <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:4">Isa 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 10:4">2 Sam 10:4</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 1:11">Mik 1:11</ref>. </char></note> nikwo n'omugabe wa Asiria aritwara Abanyamisri bari enkwatwa, n'Abaesiopia bari encuubwa, abato n'abakuru, bakagyenda bajwaire busha, bataine nkaito, ebibunu biri aheeru, kuhemura Misri. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:3">Isa 30:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:21">2 Bag 18:21</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abo abaabaire bataire amatsiko ahari Esiopia, nibeehimbisiza ahari Misri, baryahahaaza emitima, bashoberwe. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Eryo izooba abatuuzi b'omuri egi nsi y'aha rubaju rw'enyanja baryagira bati: Mbwenu, abu twabaire tutaireho amatsiko, tukabahungiraho ngu batujune omugabe wa Asiria, ku baraabe babaire batyo, itwe turyakira tuta?<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okugwa kwa Babulooni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:14">Zek 9:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nabi yaahanwire aha ihamba ry'aha rubaju rw'enyanja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:1">Nk'akasooroora k'omuri Negebu oku kagyenda nikasingoorera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:1">Nikwo ebyahanwirwe ebyo biruga omu ihamba, omu nsi erikutiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:17">Isa 13:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:16">24:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:1">33:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyorekirwe okworekwa kw'obusaasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Omunyagi naanyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Omuhwerekyerezi naahwerekyereza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Iwe Elamu, hurura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Naiwe Media, obagote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Amaganya goona agu yaareetsire ngamazireho.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />N'ahabw'ekyo nyine obusaasi bw'okuunyita;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:3">Ninshaasha munonga nk'omukazi orikurumwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:3">Obusaasi nibunzibira kuhurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:3">N'okuhahaaza omutima nikunzibira kureeba.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:67">Bir 28:67</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwengye bwampwamu, ebirikutiinisa byanyitsa obwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:4">Akairima aku nyetengere kandugiramu okutetema.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:39">Yer 51:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu nibatebeekanisa gye emeeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:5">Nibaara emikyeeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:5">Nibarya kandi nibanywa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:5">Mwimukye, imwe banyiginya mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:5">Musiigye amajuta aha ngabo!<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akangira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:6">Irooko, oteho omurinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:6">Agume agambe eki araareebe.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Ku araareebe omutwe gw'abantu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">Abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi babiri-babiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">Abarikugyendera aha ndogoya n'aha ngamira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">Ahurire ataireho omutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">Ataireho omutima munonga.<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:1">Hab 2:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima owaareebire yaagamba munonga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:8">Ai MUKAMA, obutoosha nyomushana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:8">Nyemerera aha munaara gw'abarinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:8">Kandi buri kiro nguma omu mwanya ogu ntairweho.<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:2">Yer 50:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:8">51:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:8">Kush 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">18:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi reeba, nihaija omutwe gw'abantu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Abatembire embaraasi babiri-babiri!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Yaagarukamu ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Babulooni egwire! Babulooni egwire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">N'ebishushani bya baaruhanga baayo byona byahendagurika.<verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:33">Yer 51:33</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3">Amo 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe muntu wangye 'we, ou mpirwe, nkaheheeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:10">Ebi mpuriire MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli nangambira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:10">Nibyo ndikukugambira.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 36:8">Kut 36:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:2">Ezk 35:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nabi yaahanwire ahari Duma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">Hariho orikuunyeta naayema Seiri, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">Iwe murinzi 'we, ekiro kyahika hi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">Iwe murinzi 'we, ekiro kyahika hi?<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Omurinzi nawe yangarukamu ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:12">Nibuza kusheesha, kandi kwira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:12">Ku muraabe nimwenda kwehanuuza, mwehanuuze;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:12">Muhindukye, mwije.<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:25">Kut 37:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nabi yaahanwire ahari Buharabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:13">Imwe emitwe y'Abadedani erikuhingura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:13">Muryaraara omu bishaka bya Buharabu.<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />Imwe abatwire omu nsi ya Teema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:14">Nimureetere abaine eiriho amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:14">Abarikucwa mubabuganise eby'okurya;<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Ahakuba bahungire zaarurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:15">Zaarurara ezisyoirweyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:15">Amata agareegire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:15">N'ahu orugamba ruhamire.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:7">Isa 60:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:21">Ezk 27:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo Mukama arikungambira naagira ati: Omwaka gutakahweireho, nk'emyaka y'orikukorera ebihembo oku eri, ekitiinisa kya Kedari kiryahwaho, <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:20">Isa 1:20</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'abaritsigara aha barasi, abashaija rugambwa aba Kedari, baryaba mbarwa; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli niwe akigambire.<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuteisa Abayuda ahabw'obushema bwabo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Ebi nabi yaahanwire aha ruhanga rw'okworekyerwamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:1">Mbwenu obaire ota, n'abantu baawe boona?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:1">Ka muri aha mitwe y'amaju,<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Iwe rurembo rwijwire oruyombo we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:2">Orujagaraire, orurikwesiima!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:2">Abantu baawe abaitsirwe ka bataitsirwe na rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:2">Kandi ka batagwire ha rugamba!<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Abategyeki baawe boona bahungiire hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:3">Baakwatwa bateerwaineho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:3">Abantu baawe, ahu bashangirwe hoona, baakwatwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:3">N'obu baraabe babaire bahungiire hare.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:1">Yer 9:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ngiriire nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">Muunyiheho amaisho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">Mundekye, ndire munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">Muteerusya kwenda kummara obusaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">Obu nyine ahabw'eihanga ryangye erinyagirwe.<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:12">Isa 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba n'eizooba ery'okujagarara, ery'okuribatiirirwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:5">Ery'okushoberererwaho omu ruhanga rw'okworekyerwamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:5">Erirugire ahari Mukama RUHANGA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:5">Ery'okusheenyeraho engo z'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:5">Kandi n'ery'okuboroogyeraho nibatakira ebibungo.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Aba Elamu bahagatiire emitana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:6">Baija n'ebigaari n'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:6">N'aba Kiiri baashohoza engabo.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Empita zaawe ezirikukira oburungi ziijwire ebigaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:7">N'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi babambiire amarembo.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:2">1 Bag 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 10:17">10:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaihaho ekyabaire kikingiire Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 22:8">Ahari eryo izooba mukata amaisho aha by'okurwanisa by'omu nju y'ekibira, <verse eid="ISA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:5">2 Bus 32:5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 3:16">Neh 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Mwareeba emyanya y'omu rugo rw'orurembo rwa Daudi esheenyukire eri mingi; mwateeranira hamwe amaizi g'omu kiyanja kya ifo, <verse eid="ISA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />mwabara amaju ga Yerusaalemu, mwagasheenya ahabw'okugumya orugo; <verse eid="ISA 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:12">Isa 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 20:20">2 Bag 20:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:4">25:4</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:3">2 Bus 32:3</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 32:4">4</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima amaizi g'omu kiyanja ekya ira mwagatimbira eiziba ahagati y'engo zombi. Kwonka timwaijuka owaakozire ebyo, n'obu kwakuba okweta aha Waateekateekire ira ku bibaho.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />Eryo izooba Mukama RUHANGA ow'amahe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:12">Akeeta abantu ngu barire, baboroogye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:12">Bamwe enkomborora, kandi bajware ebiguniya.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 56:12">Isa 56:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Kor 15:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu reeba, n'okushemererwa, n'okunanuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:13">N'okwita ente n'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:13">N'okurya enyama n'okunywa viinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:13">Nimugira muti: Reka tweriire, twenywere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:13">ahakuba nyencakare turi ab'okufa.<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 3:14">1 Sam 3:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ow'amahe yaanyeyoreka, nangambira omu kutu ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:14">Buzimazima okutahikiirira oku timurikusaasirwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:14">Okuhitsya obu murifa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:14">Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shebuna okubingwa aha murimo, na Eliakimu okuza omu mwanya gwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 36:3">Isa 36:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:18">2 Bag 18:18</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:26">26</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:2">19:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Irooko oze ow'ogwo mubiiki, Shebuna, orikutegyeka eby'omuri nyaruju, omubuuze oti: <verse eid="ISA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:60">Mat 27:60</ref>. </char></note> Nookora ki aha; kandi aha oineho oha, waaza kwetimbira aha ekituuro, iwe orikukyetimbira omu mwanya gw'ahaiguru, okeekorera ah'okutuura omu rukiri? <verse eid="ISA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />Iwe mushaija w'amaani 'we, reeba, MUKAMA aryakujuguta n'amaani; aryakukwata, akuhamye, <verse eid="ISA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 36:9">Isa 36:9</ref>. </char></note> akuzongoze, akurekyere nk'omupiira, akungye omu nsi egarami; okwo niyo origwa, n'ebigaari byawe by'ekitiinisa niyo biriguma, iwe orikuhemura enju ya mukama waawe. <verse eid="ISA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Ndyakubinga omu murimo gwawe, ogarurwe ahansi orugye omu bukuru bwawe. <verse eid="ISA 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:18">2 Bag 18:18</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba ndyayeta omwiru wangye Eliakimu mwene Hilukia, <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />mmujwekye ekanzu yaawe, mmuzirikye orukoba rwawe, n'obushoboorozi bwawe mbumuhe; kandi aryaba ishe w'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, n'ab'enju ya Yuda. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:7">Kush 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Ekishumuruzo ky'enju ya Daudi ndyakita aha ibega rye. Niwe ariigura, hatagire waakinga, kandi arikinga, hatagire waigura. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:8">Ezr 9:8</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 12:11">Mub 12:11</ref>. </char></note> Ndyamuteererera omu mwanya guhamire nk'enkondo, abeere enju ya ishe ekitebe ky'ekitiinisa, <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />bamuhanikyeho oburemeezi bwona obw'enju ya ishe, ab'enda ye n'oruzaaro rwe, ebintu byona ebikye, okwiha aha bikopo okuhika aha nnywero zoona. <verse eid="ISA 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />Kandi MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Eryo izooba egyo nkondo, eyaateerereirwe omu mwanya oguhamire, eryakuuka, etemwe, egwe; n'ebibaire bigihanikirweho biihweho; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA niwe akigambire.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Okucwekyerezibwa kwa Tuuro</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:2-28:24">Ezk 26:2—28:24</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Yoel 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amo 1:9</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zek 9:2-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nabi yaahanwire ahari Tuuro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Imwe meeri za Tarushiishi 'mwe, nimuboroogye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Ahabw'okuba Tuuro ecwekyereziibwe, tihaatsigara nju nari nyambukiro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Ebyo biboorekirwe nibiruga omu nsi ya Kitimu.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Imwe abatwire aha mbaju z'enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:2">Abaabaire batungisibwa abashuubuzi ba Sidoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:2">Abarikuraba omu nyanja, nimuhuname!<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:18">Yer 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:3-23">Ezk 27:3-23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eby'okurya bya Shihoori, n'ebishaaruurwa bya Nailo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:3">Nibyo byabaire bibareetera amagoba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:3">Okwo niyo akatare k'amahanga kaabaire kari.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Iwe Sidoni, gira enshoni; ahabw'okuba enyanja yaagamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">Nikyo kigo kyayo, neegira eti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">Tinkarumwaga, tinkazaaraga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">Tinkontsyaga baana b'aboojo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">N'obu kwakuba okworora abaishiki.<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Enkuru ya Tuuro ku erihika Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:5">Baryagigirira obusaasi.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Imwe abatwire aha mbaju z'enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:6">Nimwambukye, muze Tarushiishi, mucure!<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Beitu shi, oru nirwo rurembo rwanyu ruri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:7">Orwabaire rwesiima orwa ira ryona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:7">Oru abantu baamwo baabaire bakunda kuza hare kutuurayo?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:12">Isa 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha owaamaririire kukora eki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:8">Kurwanisa Tuuro, haza ruri orurembo orwabaire rwemeka abagabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:8">N'abatuuzi baarwo bari ab'ekitiinisa omu nsi?<verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />MUKAMA ow'amahe niwe akimaririire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:9">Ngu abone kugayisa amaryo g'ekitiinisa kyona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:9">N'okukwatsa enshoni abanyakitiinisa boona ab'omu nsi.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Iwe Tarushiishi 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:10">Shandaara omu nsi yaawe nk'omugyera Nailo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:10">Ahabw'okuba tokiine kirikukuzibira.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />MUKAMA agoroire omukono gwe aha nyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:11">Yaatengyetsa amahanga g'abagabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:11">Yaagamba aha bya Kanaani naaragiira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:11">Ngu bacwekyereze ebigo byayo eby'amaani.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:12">Iwe Sidoni 'we, omwishiki oshugaine orikuhatwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:12">Tokigaruka kushemererwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:12">Imuka, oyambukye Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:12">Kandi nayo, torigirirayo buhuumure.<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Mureebe ensi y'Abakaludaaya! Tekiri ihanga. Abaasiria bakagihindura ey'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba. Bakagota Tuuro, baagyombekaho eminaara, baasheenya zaanyaruju zaayo, baagigira amatongo.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1">Isa 23:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe meeri za Tarushiishi 'mwe, mucure ahabw'okuba ekigo kyanyu kicwekyereziibwe. <verse eid="ISA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Yer 25:11</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo Tuuro eryayeba okumara emyaka makumi mushanju, nk'emyaka ei omugabe amara aha ngoma. Egyo myaka makumi mushanju ku erihwa, ebirihika ahari Tuuro biryaba nk'ebiri omu kyeshongoro kya maraaya, ekirikugira kiti:<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />Iwe maraaya waayebire 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">Twara enanga, ogyendagyende omu rurembo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">Ogiteere, ogijumeeze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">Oyeshongore ebyeshongoro bingi, obone kwijukwa.<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 17:1">Kush 17:1</ref>, <ref loc="REV 17:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'egyo myaka makumi mushanju MUKAMA aryataayaayira Tuuro, eryagaruka aha bushuubuzi bwayo, eshambane n'amahanga g'abagabe b'omu nsi zoona. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Obutungi n'obushuubuzi bwayo buryayerezibwa MUKAMA; tiburibiikwa, tiburiteebwa hangahari nk'obw'engumya, kureka buryaheebwa abatuura omu maisho ga MUKAMA, ngu babone kurya n'okuhaaga, kandi babone ebijwaro ebirikuterera.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarihika aha nsi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Reeba, MUKAMA aryahwerekyereza ensi, agihindure amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:1">Agijuumikye, ataataanise abagitwiremu.<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 7:12">Ezk 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:9">Hos 4:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ebirihika aha bantu b'obutoosha, nibyo birihika n'aha banyamurwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">Ebirihika aha muhuuku, nibyo birihika ahari mukama we;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">Ebirihika aha muzaana, nibyo birihika ahari mugore we;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">Ebirihika aha muguzi, nibyo birihika aha mutunzi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">Ebirihika aha muntu orikukuguza abandi, nibyo birihika aha muntu orikweguza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">Ebirihika aha muntu orikwihuza, nibyo birihika n'aha muntu orikwihuzibwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:20">Isa 1:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ensi eryacwekyerezibwa, enyagirwe kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:3">Ahakuba MUKAMA niwe agambire ekigambo eki.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 4:3">Hos 4:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ensi neeganya, neehotoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:4">Ensi yoona ehweire amaani, neehotoka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:4">Abeekuniki b'omu nsi bahweire amaani.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:6">Isa 2:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 35:33">Kub 35:33</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:15">Lev 26:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ensi esiisirwe abagitwiremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:5">Ahabw'okuba basiisire ekiragiro, baihireho ebyatairweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:5">Baita endagaano etahwaho.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:11">Dan 9:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 5:3">Zek 5:3</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 5:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:2">Mal 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo omukyeeno guhereizeho ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:6">N'abatuuzi baamwo bakasingwa orubanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:6">N'ahabw'ekyo abagitwiremu bookiibwe, baatsigara mbarwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Viinyo neeganya, omuzaabibu guruhire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:7">Ab'emitima eshemereirwe nibatsinda.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:34">Yer 7:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okusheka kw'abarikuteera enjogyera kucecekire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:8">Akaari k'abarikushemererwa kahunamire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:8">N'okushemererwa okurikureetwa enanga kuhweireho.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Tibarigauka kunywa viinyo nibeeshongora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:9">Ebirikusinza biryashaarira abarikubinywa.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Orurembo orubaire rujagaraire rusheenyukire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:10">Amaju goona gakingire, ngu hatagira owaataahamu.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 1:5">Yoel 1:5</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 1:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibaboroogyera omu nguuto ahabw'okubura viinyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:11">Ahu okushemererwa kubaire kuri, mbwenu n'ekizima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:11">Okwesiima kw'omu nsi kuhweireho.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Orurembo tirutsigairwemu kindi kureka amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:12">amarembo gaarwo gasheenyirwe, gaacwekyerezibwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:6">Isa 17:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo okwo nikwo biriba aha mahanga g'omu nsi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:13">Garyaba nk'omutiini ogurikutengyetsibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:13">Nari nk'oku bahumba emizaabibu, eishaaruura rihweire.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Baryaimutsya amaraka gaabo, beeshongore ahabw'okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:14">Ab'oburengyerwa-izooba bateere akaari ahabw'ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:6">Isa 45:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo imwe ab'oburugwa-izooba, muhimbise MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:15">Naimwe abatwire aha mbaju z'enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:15">Musiime eiziina rya MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:2">Isa 21:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:2">26:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naitwe nituhurira ebyeshongoro by'okuhimbisa, nibiruga aha muheru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Nibasiima Ogwo orikwera munonga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Kwonka nyowe ningira nti: Ai bambe, ka naareeba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Mpweire aha magufa! Mpweire aha magufa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Ahabw'okuba abarikureebya bareebize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Buzimazima abarikureebya bareebize munonga.<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17, 18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 7:11">Kut 7:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:7">Zab 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:43">Yer 48:43</ref>, <ref loc="JER 48:44">44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe otwire omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:17">Obwoba, ekiina n'omutego bikuriho!<verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Orikuhunga orwari rw'ebirikutiinisa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Naija kugwa omu kiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Kandi orikutemba kuruga omu kiina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Naija kukwatwa omutego,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Ahabw'okuba amadirisa g'eiguru gaigwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">n'emisingi y'ensi neetetema.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Ensi eyatikire kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:19">Ensi eyabiire kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:19">Ensi etengyetsiibwe munonga.<verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:5">Isa 24:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 24:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:9">29:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ensi neegwererana nk'omusinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:20">Neezonga nk'akaju;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:20">Okushiisha kwayo kugihingamiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:20">Neija kugwa, kandi teriimuka bundi.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:12">Isa 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 76:12">Zab 76:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba MUKAMA aryafubira amahe g'ahaiguru omu iguru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:21">N'abagabe b'ahansi omu nsi;<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 4:11">Mik 4:11</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 4:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryateeranirwa hamwe nk'oku embohe ziteeranirwa omu kiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:22">Baryakingiranwa omu nju y'ekihome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:22">Kandi ku aharihinguraho ebiro bingi, baryafubirwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:7">Mik 4:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo okwezi kuryashoberwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">N'eizooba riryakwatwa enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ow'amahe aryategyekyera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">Aha rushozi Saayuuni n'omuri Yerusaalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">Kandi aryayoreka ekitiinisa kye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">Omu maisho g'abantu be abakuru.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhimbisa Ruhanga ahabw'eby'oburyo bye n'okujuna kwe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:2">Kur 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:31">Zab 107:31</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 107:32">32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, niwe Ruhanga wangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">Ndyakuhimbisa, nsingize eiziina ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">ahabw'okuba okozire eby'okutangaaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">Ebi waateekateekire ira kukora omu bwesigwa n'amazima.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:1">Isa 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:37">Yer 51:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba orurembo oruhindwire orubungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">Orurembo orwehinguririziibwe orugo rw'amabaare oruhindwire amatongo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">Ekikaari ky'abanyamahanga tikikiba rurembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">Kandi tikirigaruka kwombekwa bundi.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Nikyo eihanga ry'amaani ririkuheera ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:3">Endembo z'amahanga agataine saasi zikakutiina.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 4:6">Isa 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 32:2">32:2</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:7">Nah 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omworo n'omukyene okababeera ekigo kigumire omu kushoberwa kwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">Waababeera obwegamo bw'eihunga n'ekicuucu ky'okubatambira omushana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">ahabw'okuba abataine saasi babateera, nk'oku eihunga riteera orugo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">Nari nk'omushana gw'amaani omu nsi eyomire.<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />Niiwe ocureeza enduuru z'abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">Okahunamya ebyevugo by'abataine saasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">Nk'oku omushana gwikaikanisibwa ekibunda ky'ekicu.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:2">Isa 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 63:5">Zab 63:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ow'amahe aryateekyera amahanga goona obugyenyi bw'eby'ebishaju ahari oru rushozi, na viinyo y'omurera, eby'ebishaju ebirimu omushokooro, na viinyo y'omurera egyegyeinwe gye. <verse eid="ISA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:8">Isa 22:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:15">2 Kor 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ahari oru rushozi aryamariraho kimwe ekirikushweka ekishwekire enganda zoona, n'eky'okwetwekyerera ekisangiire amahanga goona. <verse eid="ISA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:20">Isa 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:19">30:19</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hos 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:54">1 Kor 15:54</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:17">Kush 7:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Mukama RUHANGA aryamirira kimwe rufu, aragaze amarira aha maisho goona, n'ekijumo eki barikujuma abantu be akiihe aha nsi yoona; ahakuba MUKAMA niwe akigambire.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:18">Kut 49:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:14">Zab 9:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba baryagira bati: Reeba, Ogu niwe Ruhanga waitu, tutuura tumutegyereize, ngu atujune; Ogu niwe MUKAMA tutuura tumutegyereize; ka tushemererwe, twesiimire okujuna kwe; <verse eid="ISA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:1">Isa 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 40:12">Yob 40:12</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omukono gwa MUKAMA guryaguma ahari oru rushozi, kandi Moabu eryaribatiiririrwa omu mwanya gwayo, nk'oku baribatiirira embuba omu kiina ky'amasha. <verse eid="ISA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Kandi Moabu eryanagiramu emikono, nk'oku orikuziha anaga emikono naaziha; kwonka MUKAMA aryamucwa amaryo, amumaremu obuhangu bw'engaro ze, <verse eid="ISA 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:5">Isa 26:5</ref>. </char></note> kandi ebigo bye by'eminaara ebyombekirwe aha ngo z'amabaare ez'endembo ze, aryabisheenya, abihigure, abikumbagaze ahansi, bihikire kimwe omu mucuucu.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Obusingye bw'abarikwesiga Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:18">Isa 60:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba ekyeshongoro eki kiryayeshongorerwa omu nsi ya Yuda, nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">Twine orurembo rugumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">Ruhanga naataho okujunwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">Kuba orugo rwarwo orw'okurukingira.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:19">Zab 118:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimwigure amarembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:2">Eihanga erihikiriire, kandi eririkwesigwa, ribone kutaahamu.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Omuntu orikukwegyekyerera omutima gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:3">Oryamurindira omu busingye buzima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:3">Ahabw'okuba naakwesiga.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Mwesigye MUKAMA ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:4">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Yehova n'orukiri rutahwaho.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 25:12">Isa 25:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe agarwire ahansi abatuura omu rurembo orurikwetunguura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:5">Yaarugarura ahansi, yaaruhitsya aha itaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:5">Yaarunaga omu mucuucu.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Ebigyere biryaruribatiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:6">Eby'abooro n'eby'abakyene.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Omuhanda gw'abahikiriire gutebeekaine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:7">Kandi Iwe ohikiriire, niiwe ohabura abahikiriire omuhanda.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:15">Kur 3:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, tutuura tukutegyereize</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:8">Omu muhanda gw'ebiragiro byawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:8">Emitima yaitu neeyetenga eiziina ryawe n'okukwijuka.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 33:11">2 Bus 33:11</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 33:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 63:6">Zab 63:6</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 3:1">Kyesh 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutima gwangye nigukugirira orushusho nyekiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">Omwoyo oguri omuriinye nigwezirika kukusherura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">Ahabw'okuba ebiragiro byawe ku biba biri omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">Abagitwiremu beega eby'okuhikiirira.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:3-11">Zab 73:3-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omubi n'obu akorerwa eby'embabazi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">Tayega by'okuhikiirira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">N'omu nsi y'okuhikiirira akoreramu kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">Kandi tareeba bukuru bwa MUKAMA.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:12">Isa 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 21:9">Zab 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:9">Mik 5:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, omukono gwawe gubangire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Kwonka tibarikugureeba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Ka bareebe obweziriki obu oiniire abantu baawe, baitwe enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Abazigu baawe omuriro gubamareho.<verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />MUKAMA, niiwe orituteeraho obusingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:12">Ahabw'okuba emirimo yaitu yoona, niiwe ogitukorera.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:8">Isa 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:4-6">2 Bag 18:4-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:13">Abandi bagabe abatari Iwe nabo bakatutegyeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:13">Kwonka eiziina ryawe ryonka niryo turikumanya.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Abo bakafa, tibarigaruka kubaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">Bakaba emizimu, tibarizooka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">Nikyo waabateereire okabacwekyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">Okatsibyatsibya okwijukwa kwabo kwona.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:3">Isa 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:2">54:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 54:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, okanyiise eihanga ryaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:15">Okanyiise eihanga, waaheebwa ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:15">Kandi wairizayo emyatano yaaryo yoona.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:15">Hos 5:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, ku baabaire bari omu busaasi noobahana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:16">Bakakusherura, baakushaba n'emitima yaabo yoona.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:17, 18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:8">Isa 13:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'omukazi oine enda, ou obunaku bwe buhikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:17">Oku arumwa, akaamuza omu kushaasha kwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:17">MUKAMA, naitwe nikwo twabaire turi omu maisho gaawe.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Tukaba twine enda, twarumwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">Twaba nk'abazaire omuyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">Titwareetera nsi yaitu kujunwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">Kandi abatuuzi b'omu nsi tibakagwaga.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 37:12">Ezk 37:12</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hos 13:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu baawe abaafiire baryaba abahuriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Emitumbi yaabo ezookye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Imwe abatuura omu mucuucu, musisiimukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Mweshongore ahabw'okushemererwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Ahakuba orume rwawe ni nk'orume rw'aha bunyaatsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Kandi omu nsi y'emizimu nimwo orirureka rukatonda.<verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:25">Isa 10:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe bantu bangye 'mwe, nimwije mutaahe omu bishengye byanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">Mube mwekingirainemu akaanya kakye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">Okuhitsya ahu ekiniga kiraahwere;<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 1:3">Mik 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA naija kuruga ah'atuura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">Kuhana ab'omu nsi naabatura okutahikiirira kwabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">Kandi ensi aryayoreka eshagama eyaagiseesirweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">Kandi terigaruka kushweka bantu baayo abaitsirwe.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhana kwa Mukama n'okujuna kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:9">Isa 51:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:13">Zab 74:13</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 74:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:3">Ezk 29:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba MUKAMA aryahana Leviasaani, egyo njoka erikuhunga, kandi enjoka erikwenyogoora, agihanise rurara ye mpango kandi ey'amaani eine obwogi; kandi aryaita ekijoka ky'omu nyanja.<verse eid="ISA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:7">Isa 5:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba baryagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:2">Reeba, omusiri gw'emizaabibu ya viinyo! Mugweshongore.<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />Nyowe, MUKAMA, niinye murinzi waagwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:3">Ndyaguma ngushukyeere amaizi buri mwanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:3">Kandi ngurinde nyomushana na nyekiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:3">Ngu hatagira owaagushiisha.<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:17">Isa 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 23:6">2 Sam 23:6</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 23:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tiinyine kiniga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:4">Kwonka emikwatangwe n'amahwa ku byakwija kundwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:4">Nkaabirwanisa, mbyotsya hamwe byona.<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Nari bankwate amaguru ngu mbarinde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:5">Babone kugira obusingye naanye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:5">Kandi baryabugira.<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 37:31">Isa 37:31</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:5">Hos 14:5</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 14:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiro ebiriija Yakobo aryatsimba emizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:6">Israeli aryatooka, arabye ebirabyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:6">Kandi baryabuzya ensi yoona ebijuma.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 37:18">Isa 37:18</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 37:36-38">36-38</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hos 6:1</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 6:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu abateire nk'oku yaateire abo abaabateire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:7">Nari shi baitsirwe, nk'oku abaabaitsire baitsirwe?<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 18:17">Yer 18:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kubacwa omu nsi yaabo, okabahana noobabarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:8">Aha izooba ry'omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba yaayemereza omuyaga gw'eihunga.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:21">Bir 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:4">2 Bag 18:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo ebyo nibyo birireetera Yakobo kwihwaho okutahikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">Kandi ebyo nibyo byana byona ebiriruga omu kumwihaho ekibi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">Ku ariheza kuhindura amabaare goona ag'eitambiro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">Nk'amabaare g'ebisooni agahondagwirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">Tiharitsigaraho Ashera nari ekishushani ky'eizooba kyona ekirikuramibwa kyemereire.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:2">Isa 17:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 17:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba orurembo rw'orugo rw'amabaare n'ekifurukwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:10">amaju gaarwo gatsigirweho garimu busha nk'eihamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:10">Okwo niyo enyana ziriira, zikazaagira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:10">Zikakonkobora amataagi gaayo.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:28">Bir 32:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amataagi gaayo ku garyoma, garyahendwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">Abakazi baije, bagahembe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">Ahakuba eihanga eri n'eihanga eritarikwetegyereza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">Nikyo Ogwo owaabahangire ataribagiririra saasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">Owaababumbire ataribagiririra mbabazi.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:18">Kut 15:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba MUKAMA aryahuura embibo okuruga aha mugyera Furaati okuhika aha kagyera ka Misri; naimwe Baisraeli 'mwe, muryatorotoorwa omwe omwe. <verse eid="ISA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:2">Isa 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:11">11:11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:9">Lev 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:31">Mat 24:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:15">Kush 11:15</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba enzamba mpango eryateerwa, abaabaire nibenda kucwekyererera omu nsi ya Asiria, n'ababingiirwe omu nsi ya Misri, baryaija, baramize MUKAMA aha rushozi orurikwera Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Okuteisa Efuraimu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Ekirunga ky'amaryo g'abasinzi ba Efuraimu kiryareeba enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:1">Hamwe n'orurabyo rw'oburungi bw'ekitiinisa kye orurikuhonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:1">Oruri aha mutwe gw'oruhanga rurikweza munonga rw'abamazirweho viinyo!<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:7">Isa 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:30">30:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:11">Ezk 13:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, MUKAMA aine omuntu w'amaani emanzi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:2">Aryabateera ahansi n'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:2">Nkeihunga ry'orubaare eririkucwekyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:2">Nk'omwegyemure gw'amaizi maingi agashandaire munonga.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Ekirunga ky'amaryo g'abasinzi ba Efuraimu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:3">Kiryaribatiirirwa;<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Kandi orurabyo rw'oburungi bw'ekitiinisa kye orurikuhonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">Oruri aha mutwe gw'oruhanga orurikweza munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">Ruryaba nk'ekijuma ky'omutiini ekirikubanza kwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">Ekyanda kitakataahire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">Omuntu ku akireeba, yaakihitsya ati omu ngaro, akirya.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Eryo izooba MUKAMA ow'amahe aryabeera abantu be abahonokireho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:5">Ekirunga ky'ekitiinisa, n'eihunde;<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:28">1 Bag 3:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'orikucwa emanja ashutami aha kitebe ky'eiramuriro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:6">Amubeere omwoyo gw'okucwa emanja z'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:6">Kandi abantu abarikugarurayo abazigu bahikire omu marembo, ababeere amaani.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 20:1">Enf 20:1</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:11">Hos 4:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Abayuda nabo nibahabisibwa viinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Ebirikusinza nibibagwereranisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Omunyamurwa na nabi nibagwereranisibwa ebirikusinza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Viinyo ebamaziremu obwengye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Nibahabisibwa ebirikusinza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Nibahaba omu kworekwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Bateera entsibo omu kucwa emanja.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Emeeza zoona ziijwire entanaki n'oburofa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:8">Tihariho hashemeire hoona.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:10">Yer 6:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Abayuda nibatsyorera nabi bati:)</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:9">Mbwenu shi, n'oha ou aryegyesa obwengye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:9">Kandi n'oha ou arishobororera obutumwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:9">Noogira ngu n'encuukye ezirugire aha mabeere?<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Ahakuba ebye n'okwongyera ekiragiro aha kiragiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:10">Ekiragiro aha kindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:10">Omushorongo aha mushorongo, n'omushorongo aha gundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:10">Aha kakye, hariya kakye.<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:11, 12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 14:21">1 Kor 14:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tikwo; kureka abantu b'eminwa y'endugamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:11">Abarikugamba orundi rurimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:11">Nibo MUKAMA arigambirira mu aba bantu,<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:15">Isa 30:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abu yaagizire ati: Okwo nikwo kuhuumura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:12">Murekye oruhire ahuumure;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:12">Kandi oku nikwo kuruhuuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:12">Kwonka baayanga kuhurira.<verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:15">Isa 8:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo ekigambo kya MUKAMA kiryababeera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">Ekiragiro aha kiragiro, ekiragiro aha kindi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">Omushorongo aha mushorongo, n'omushorongo aha gundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">Aha kakye, hariya kakye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">Babone kugyenda, bagwe bagarami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">Bahendekye, bagwe omu mutego, bakwatwe.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo, imwe bagayi 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:14">Abarikutegyeka aba bantu abatwire Yerusaalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:14">Muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA!<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Mugizire muti: Turagaine endagaano na rufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Kandi twikirizaine n'Okuzimu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Ekibonaboneso ekirikumaraho ku kiriraba omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Tikirituhikaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Ahabw'okuba tweboneire obuhungiro omu bishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Twayegama omu bugobya;<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:24">Kut 49:24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Rom 9:33</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6">1 Pet 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo Mukama Yehova arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">Reeba, ninta omuri Saayuuni eibaare kuba omusingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">Eibaare ry'obuhamizo bw'enju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">Ery'obuguzi bwingi, kandi erihamire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">Orikwikiriza tarirahukiiriza.<verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Eby'oburyo ndyabigira omugoye gw'okugyeresa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:17">N'okuhikiirira nkugire kariisho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:17">Orubaare ruryatwarira kimwe obwo buhungiro bw'ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:17">N'amaizi gamareho obwo bwegamo.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Obwo endagaano ei mwaragaine na rufu eryafa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:18">Kandi n'ebi mwaikirizaine n'Okuzimu tibirigumaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:18">Kureka ekibonaboneso ekirikumaraho, ku kiriraba omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:18">Kiryabaribatiirira.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Buri kaanya ku kiriba nikirabamu, kiryabakwata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:19">Ahakuba kiryaguma nikirabamu buri kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:19">Kirabemu nyomushana na nyekiro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:19">Kandi okushoborokyerwa obutumwa kuryaba okwitsa obwoba kwonka.<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Ahakuba ekitanda ni kigufu, omuntu tarikubaasa kukirambikiririzaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:20">N'eky'okweshweka n'enkyetero etarikumuhika;<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 10:10-14">Yos 10:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:20">2 Sam 5:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aryaimuka nk'oku yaimukire aha rushozi Peraziimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:21">Aryagira ekiniga, nk'eki yagiriire omu ruhanga rwa Gibeoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:21">Abone kukora omurimo gwe, omurimo ogutari gw'obutoosha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:21">N'okuhikiiriza ebi ashangwa atakora.<verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:23">Isa 10:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati murekye kugaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:22">Ebibakomire bitakaabariitira kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:22">Ahabw'okuba mpuriire ekiragiro ky'okucwekyereza ensi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:22">Ekirugire ahari Mukama RUHANGA ow'amahe.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Mutegye okutu, muhurire eiraka ryangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:23">Muhuguukye, muhurire ebi ndikugamba!<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Ohingira okubiba, ahinga obutoosha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:24">Atuura naateera amatsinde?<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Ku aheza kwanjara eitaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:25">Tabibamu oburo, n'eshogye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:25">Akabiba engano omu mishorongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:25">Na sayiri akagibiba ahagishemereire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:25">N'ebicoori aha mbibi?<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Ahabw'okuba ayorekyererwa gye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:26">Ruhanga we niwe amwegyesa.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Oburo tibuhuuzibwa kihuuzo ky'obwogi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:27">N'ebicoori tibihuruburwa nziga z'ekigaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:27">Kureka oburo buhuurwa enkoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:27">N'ebicoori bihuurwa ekihuuzo.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Nimugira ngu engano z'emigaati bazisa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:28">Ngaaha! Tibazisa, bazihuura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:28">N'obu azirabyaho enziga z'ekigaari kye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:28">N'ebyara by'embaraasi, hoona nabwo tazisa.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:19">Yer 32:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo nakyo kiruga ahari MUKAMA ow'amahe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:29">Niwe muhanuuzi orikutangaaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:29">Kandi orikukiza abantu boona obwengye.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Okucwekyerezibwa kw'orurembo Arieli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 5:9">2 Sam 5:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yeiwe, Arieli, Arieli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:1">Orurembo oru Daudi yaateiremu orusiisira!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:1">Mwongyere omwaka aha mwaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:1">Amagyenyi gabeho omu bunaku bwago;<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Kwonka hoona ndyabonabonesa Arieli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:2">Habeho okucura n'amaganya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:2">Kandi Arieli haryambeera nk'amahega ga Ruhanga.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:1">2 Bag 25:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakuteeraho ensiisira embaju zoona kukurwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:3">Nkugotese eminaara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:3">Nkutuumeho eby'okukurwanisizaho.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:13">Isa 17:13</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 17:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima oryagarurwa ahansi, ogambire omu itaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:4">Ebigambo byawe birugye ahansi omu mucuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:4">Eiraka ryawe rirugye okuzimu nk'ery'omuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:4">Rigambire mpora omu mucuucu.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Kwonka omutwe gw'abazigu baawe guryaba guri nk'omucuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:5">N'omutwe gw'abataine saasi nk'ebishushunga birikutuntumuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:5">Nikwo biriba omuri ako kaanya.<verse eid="ISA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />MUKAMA ow'amahe aryabateeza okuhinda kw'enkuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:6">N'omutsitsa, n'endigito mpango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:6">N'akasooroora, n'eihunga, n'ebirimi by'omuriro gurikurya busha.<verse eid="ISA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:7, 8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:8">Yob 20:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:9">Zek 12:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutwe gw'amahanga goona agarikurwanisa Arieli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:7">Boona abarikumurwanisa n'ekigo kye, bakamubonabonesa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:7">Baryaba nk'ekirooto, nari okworekwa kwa nyekiro.<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Nk'oku omujara aroota naarya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Akasisiimuka aine enjara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Nari nk'oine eiriho oku aroota naanywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Akasisiimuka n'ekyaka akiriine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Okwo nikwo omutwe gw'amahanga goona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Agarikurwanisa Saayuuni gariba.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Mwegire ebifa-mutima, mube byo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:9">Mwehumye, mube empumi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:9">Mwesinze, mutanyweire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:9">Mugwererane mutanyweire birikusinza!<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:8">Rom 11:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA abashukireho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:10">Omwoyo gw'oturo twingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:10">Yaahumya amaisho gaanyu, nibo baanabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:10">Yaatwekyerera emitwe yaanyu, nibo bahanuuzi.<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Okworekwa kwona kubahindukiire nk'ebigambo by'omu kitabo ekikwatanisiibwe akamanyiso. Abantu ku bakiha omuntu orikumanya kushoma, baamugira bati, Kishome, abagarukamu ati: Tindikubaasa kukishoma, ahabw'okuba kikwatanisiibwe akamanyiso. <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Kandi ku bakiha otarikumanya kushoma, baamugira bati, Kishome, abagarukamu ati: Tindikumanya kushoma.<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:2">Isa 58:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:2">Yer 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:31">Ezk 33:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:8">Mat 15:8</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 15:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:6">Mak 7:6</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 7:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:22">Kol 2:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukama yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">Abantu aba nibaanyirira haihi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">Bampa ekitiinisa n'akanwa kaabo n'eminwa yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">Kwonka emitima yaabo endi hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">Kandi okuntiina kwabo n'ekiragiro eki baayegyesiibwe abantu.<verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:7">Yer 49:7</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:19">1 Kor 1:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo reeba, niinyija kukora omurimo gw'okutangaaza omuri aba bantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:14">Omurimo gw'eihano kandi ogurikutangaariza kimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:14">Obwengye bw'abanyabwengye baabo buryahwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:14">N'okwetegyereza kw'abantu baabo abarikwetegyereza kuryasherekwa.<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:1">Isa 30:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 22:13">Yob 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:12">Ezk 8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryareeba enaku, abarikusherura munonga ah'okushereka MUKAMA enaama zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:15">Abu emirimo yaabo eri omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:15">Abarikugira bati: N'oha orikutureeba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:15">Kandi bati: Orikutumanya n'oha?<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:15">Isa 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:20">Rom 9:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ka nimumanya kucurika ebintu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Omubumbi ashemereire kwinganisibwa n'eibumba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Kikaareetera ekibumbirwe kugamba aha mubumbi kiti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Tiwe yambumbire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Nari shi ekyahangirwe kugamba ahari Ogwo owaakihangire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Kiti: Tarikwetegyereza.<verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Timurikumanya ku hatsigaire akaanya kakye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:17">Lebanooni kuhinduka omusiri gurikweza munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:17">N'omusiri gurikweza munonga kuba nk'ekibira?<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mat 11:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba ebifa-matu biryahurira ebigambo by'omu kitabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:18">N'empumi ziryahumuuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:18">Zikire obuhumi n'omwirima;<verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEP 3:12">Zef 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:3">Mat 5:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'abacureezi baryayeyongyera kushemerererwa omuri MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:19">N'abooro b'omu bantu baryayesiimira Orikwera wa Israeli,<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:22">Isa 28:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba abataine saasi baryaba busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:20">N'abagayi baryahwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:20">Kandi abarikusherura oburyo bw'okukora eby'okutahikiirira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:20">Baryamarwaho,<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:10">Amo 5:10</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 5:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aboomesereza omuntu ekigambo nibamubeiherera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:21">Orikuhanira abantu omu marembo bakamutega omutego,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:21">Kandi ohikiriire bakamwimisa ekimushemereire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:21">Nibamutura busha.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:1-3">Kut 12:1-3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA owaacungwire Abrahamu arikugirira eby'enju ya Yakobo ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:22">Yakobo tarigaruka kukwatwa nshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:22">N'aha maisho ge tiharihinduka kundi.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:13">Isa 8:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:21">60:21</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:10">Efe 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba ku arireeba abaana be abu naahangire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:23">Bari omu nsi ye ahagati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:23">Baryahaisa eiziina ryangye ekitiinisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:23">Kandi baryaha Orikwera wa Yakobo ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:23">Batiine Ruhanga wa Israeli.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Abarikuhaba omu mitima baryahinduka abarikwetegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:24">N'abarikwetomboita baikirize kwegyesibwa.<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuteisa abarikukwatanisa na Misri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:2">Isa 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:7">25:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:15">29:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Abaana abagomi baryareeba enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">Abeehanuuza aha bandi, bataanyehanuuzeho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">Abaragaana endagaano, kwonka etari y'Omwoyo gwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">Ngu babone kwongyera ekibi aha kindi;<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 31:1">Isa 31:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:7">1 Bag 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:5">Yer 37:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarikwimuka kushuuma Misri, bataanyehanwizeho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:2">Ngu beesigye amaani ga Faraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:2">Basherure obwegamo omu kicuucu kya Misri!<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 20:5">Isa 20:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ago maani ga Faraho garibakwatsiza enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:3">N'okwesiga ekicuucu kya Misri kukaba okuhemuka kwanyu.<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Ahabw'okuba abanyiginya be n'obu baraabe bari Zoani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:4">N'entumwa ze zihikire Hanesi,<verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:36">Yer 2:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryahemuka, ahabw'okuba baryashanga bari abantu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:5">Abatarikubaasa kubagasira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:5">Kandi abatarikubaha buhwezi n'obu gaakuba amagoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:5">Kureka ab'okubahemura n'okubajumisa.<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Eki nabi yaahanwire aha nyamaishwa z'omuri Negebu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Nibaraba omu nsi y'akabi n'obusaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Erikurugwamu entare y'enkazi n'enshija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Erimu encwera n'enjoka z'obushegu oburikubabiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Baheekyeise endogoya eby'obutungi byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Bataire ebintu byabo aha mabango g'engamira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Nibaza omu ihanga ry'abantu abataribagasira.<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 36:6">Isa 36:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba obuhwezi bwa Misri tibwine mutambo kandi ni busha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:7">Nikyo ndikugyetera eiziina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:7">Rahabu oshutami kwonka.<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:2">Hab 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hati gyenda, okihandiikye aha kishate ky'eibumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:8">Okihandiiye n'omu kitabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:8">Kibe eky'obunaku oburiija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:8">Kigume kiboomesereze ebiro byona;<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Ahabw'okuba n'eihanga eririkugoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:9">Abaana abarikubeiha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:9">Aboojo abarikwanga kuhurira ebiragiro bya MUKAMA,<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:13">1 Bag 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 11:21">Yer 11:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 28:1-11">28:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:12">Amo 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarikugambira abahanuuzi bati: Mutareeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Bakagira baanabi bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Mutatuhanuurira ebihikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Kureka mugume mutugambire ebyorobi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Muhanuure eby'obugobya.<verse eid="ISA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Mutuhigize, muturugye omu maisho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:11">Titurikwenda kugaruka kuhurira eby'Orikwera wa Israeli.<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Nikyo Orikwera wa Israeli arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:12">Ahabw'okugaya ekigambo eki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:12">Mukeesiga okuhata n'okwehabagiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:12">Mukaba nibyo mwayegamira,<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />Okwo kutahikiirira kuryababeera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:13">Nk'ekisiika kiraingwa ekishatukire, ekirikugogoma, ekiri haihi kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:13">Eki okugwa kwakyo kubaho ahonaaho omu kaanya kakye;<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:9">Zab 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi kiryayatika nk'enyungu y'omubumbi oku eyatika</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:14">Akagyata atarikugibariirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:14">N'aha ngusyo zaayo hatatsigareho rwa kuguhisa omuriro omu mahega,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:14">Nari orw'okutahisa amaizi omu iziba.<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:14">Kur 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 81:11">Zab 81:11</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:1">Hos 14:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA Orikwera wa Israeli yaagizire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:15">Omu kugaruka n'omu kuhuumura nimwo murijunirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:15">Omu kutuuza n'omu kwesiga nimwo amaani gaanyu gariruga.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 31:1">Isa 31:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 31:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:3">Hos 14:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ngaaha! Nitwija kuhungira aha mbaraasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">Kwokwo muryahunga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">Muti: Nitwija kuhungira aha mbaraasi ezirikwiruka munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">N'ahabw'ekyo abaribakurata nabo baryaba abarikwiruka munonga.<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:17">Lev 26:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:25">Bir 28:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:30">32:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu rukumi baryahunga okukangisa kw'omuntu omwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">Abantu bataano ku baribakangisa, muryahunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">Okuhitsya obu muritsigara muri nk'ekiti kitsimbirwe aha mutwe gw'orushozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">Nari nk'ekiti ky'orurango kitsimbirwe omu kibungo.<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:16">Isa 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:17">8:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:12">Zab 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:9">2 Pet 3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA aritegyerereza, ngu abagirire embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:18">Kandi nikyo ariheerwa ekitiinisa, ngu abagirire esaasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:18">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ni Ruhanga ocwa emanja z'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:18">Abarikumutegyereza boona baine omugisha.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emigisha y'Abaisraeli ey'omu biro ebiriija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Iwe ihanga rya Saayuuni 'we, eritwire Yerusaalemu, torigaruka kurira. Ku arihurira eiraka ry'okutaka kwawe, taribura kukugirira mbabazi. Ku arikuhurira aryakugarukamu. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:27">1 Bag 22:27</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Mukama n'obu arikuha eby'okurya by'obusaasi n'amaizi g'okubonabonesibwa, Orikukwegyesa tarigaruka kweshereka, kureka amaisho gaawe garyaguma gamureebe. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:32">Bir 5:32</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku muritoora aha mukono gwa buryo nari aha gwa bumosho, amatu gaanyu garyaguma nigahurira ekigambo nikibareetwa enyima nikigira kiti: Ogu nigwo muhanda, mube nigwo mwahamya. <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:20">Isa 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:7">31:7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:8">Hos 14:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi muryashiisha ebishushani byanyu ebibaizirwe ebishwekirwe efeeza, n'ebiheesirwe ebishwekirwe ezaabu. Muryabinagira kimwe nk'ebintu ebisiisikaire, mubigire muti: Murugyeho!<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 65:13">Zab 65:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:24">Yer 5:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Embibo ei muribiba aryagigwisiza enjura, kandi ebi murihinga omu itaka biryayera, bibe bingi. Omu biro ebyo amasyo gaanyu garyariira omu mariisizo mahango, <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />ente n'endogoya ezirikuhinga ziryarya eby'okurya ebirimu omwonyo, ebiheheziibwe engari n'entaara. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Aha izooba ry'okwitirwaho baingi, eminaara ku eriba neesheenywa, orushozi rwona oruraingwa n'ekibungo kyona ekiraingwa, biryahimintikamu emigyera n'enshuro z'amaizi. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:5">Isa 1:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:19">60:19</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hos 6:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aha izooba eri MUKAMA arishemberaho obuhuta bw'abantu be, akabakiza ebihonoka by'enkoni ze, okwaka kw'okwezi kuryaba nk'okujwa kw'eizooba, n'omushana gwaryo guryayeyongyera emirundi mushanju, gube nk'omushana gw'ebiro mushanju.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucwekyerezibwa kwa Asiria</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Reeba, eiziina rya MUKAMA niriruga hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:27">Niryaka n'ekiniga kye, omu mwika mwingi ogurikucumbuuka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:27">Eminwa ye eijwire okuguubwa kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:27">N'orurimi rwe ruri nk'omuriro gurikurya busha.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:8">Isa 8:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">11:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:29">37:29</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:8">Nah 1:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orwoya rwe ruri nk'omugyera gushandaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:28">Ogurikuhika omuntu omu bitsya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:28">Kushungura amahanga n'orugari orurikucwekyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:28">N'okuta omu nshaya z'amahanga orukoba orurikuhabya.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:8">Isa 44:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muryayeshongora ekyeshongoro nk'eki beeshongora nyekiro aha kiro ky'obugyenyi oburikwera; muryagira omuhimbo omu mutima nk'ogw'omuntu oine omukuri, orikuza aha rushozi rwa MUKAMA ahari Rukiri wa israeli. <verse eid="ISA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:2">Isa 28:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:6">29:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA aryahuriza eiraka rye ry'ekitiinisa, ayorekyere okuteera kw'omukono gwe omu kiniga kye kingi n'omu kirimi ky'omuriro gurikurya busha, n'eshato, n'eihunga, n'orubaare. <verse eid="ISA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Abaasiria emitima eryabahwa omunda ahabw'okutiina eiraka rya MUKAMA, ku aribateera n'enkoni ye. <verse eid="ISA 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:16">Isa 19:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku bariba nibabateera enkoni ezi MUKAMA ariragiira kubateera, haryabaho okuteera amataari n'enanga; aryabarwanisa naatigita omukono gwe. <verse eid="ISA 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:10">2 Bag 23:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:48">Ezk 20:48</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:9">24:9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 24:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Tofeti ekateekateekwa okuruga ira, yaateekateekyerwa omugabe. Mbwenu MUKAMA agigizire mpango kandi ndaingwa, yaaba ekikoomi ky'omuriro gw'enku nyingi, kandi omwitsyo gwe, oguri nk'omugyera gw'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti, nigwo guhatweka.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Obushema bw'abarikwesiga Misri na Asiria okukira okwesiga Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:4">Isa 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:2">30:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:9">36:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 20:7">Zab 20:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryareeba enaku abarikushuuma Misri kusherura obuhwezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Abarikwesiga embaraasi, bakata amatsiko aha bigaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Ahabw'okuba bingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Kandi bakeesiga abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Ahabw'okuba ab'amaani maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Bakanga kuta amaisho ahari</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Orikwera wa Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">N'okwehanuuza ahari MUKAMA!<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Haza kunu niwe aine obwengye, kandi niwe areeta akabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:2">Atahindure bi agambire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:2">Kureka aryaimuka arwanise enju y'enkozi z'ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:2">N'abarikuhwera abakora ebitari by'okuhikiirira.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:5">Yer 17:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manya, Abanyamisri baba abantu, tibaba Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">N'embaraasi zaabo ti myoyo, ziine emibiri kwonka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA ku aribanga omukono gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">Ogwo orikuhwera aryateera entsibo, n'orikuhwerwa aryagwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">Boona bahwerekyerere hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />Ahakuba MUKAMA angizire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">Nk'oku entare entsigazi etontomera aha ki yaita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">Abariisa bahuruziibwe kurwana nayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">Etatiine rwari rwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">N'obu kwakuba okwehiga ahabw'enduuru zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">Nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arishuuma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">Kurwanira aha rushozi Saayuuni n'aha kabungo kaayo.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:4">Zab 91:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku amahungu gazeereera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:5">Nikwo na MUKAMA ow'amahe aririnda Yerusaalemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:5">Aryagirinda, agijune;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:5">Aryagisaasira, agikize abazigu.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:5">Isa 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:15">30:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, mugarukire Ogwo ou mwagomeire mukarengyesereza;<verse eid="ISA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:22">Isa 30:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> ahakuba eryo izooba ebishushani bye by'efeeza n'eby'ezaabu, ebyakozirwe engaro zaanyu, bikabarugiramu ekibi.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:35">2 Bag 19:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo Abaasira baryaitwa rurara etari y'omuntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:8">Kandi rurara etari y'abantu ebamareho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:8">Baryagihunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:8">N'abatsigazi baabo babe ab'okukoresibwa n'amaani.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:33">30:33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:31">Bir 32:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orukiri rwabo ruryaihwaho ahabw'obwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:9">N'abakuru baabo baryayehwa amatsiko ahabw'orurango;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:9">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba ou omuriro gwe guri omuri Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:9">N'ekikoomi kye omuri Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhiirwa okuriba omu bukama bwa Kristo oburiija</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:1-4">Isa 11:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, haryayema omugabe oritegyekyera omu kuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:1">N'abanyiginya baryategyekyera omu buryo.<verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 4:6">Isa 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:4">25:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omuntu aryaba nk'omwanya ogw'okwekingaho omuyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:2">N'obwegamo bw'eihunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:2">Kandi abe nk'emigyera y'amaizi aha itaka ryomire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:2">N'ekicuucu ky'eibaare rihango omu nsi erikurusya.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:18">Isa 29:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo amaisho g'abarikuhweza tigarigiibwaho ruho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:3">N'amatu g'abarikuhurira garyahurira.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Omutima gw'omuntu embakuki guryagira okwetegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:4">N'orurimi rw'orikuhebebera ruryagamba gye.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Omushema tarigaruka kwetwa ow'ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:5">N'obu yaakuba engumya kwetwa efura;<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Ahabw'okuba omushema aryaguma agambe eby'obushema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">N'omutima gwe gugire enaama z'okutahikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">Akore eby'okutatiina Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">Agambe eby'okuhabisa ahari MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">Abajara abatsigye n'enjara yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">N'abaine eiriho abaime eky'okunywa.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Eby'okurwanisa by'engumya biba bibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:7">Acwa obwengye bubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:7">Ngu acwekyereze omworo n'ebigambo by'ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:7">N'obu omukyene aba naagamba ebihikire.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Kwonka efura ecwa obwengye bw'okukora eby'obufura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:8">Kandi obwo bufura nibwo bumubaisaho.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuteisa abakazi n'abaishiki abataine ki beetaireho</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 6:1">Amo 6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe bakazi bajarami 'mwe, nimwimukye mumpurire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:9">Naimwe baishiki bataine ki mwetaireho 'mwe, mutegye amatu eki ndikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Imwe abakazi abataine ki mwetaireho, muryamara ebiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:10">Ebirikweshumba aha mwaka, mwemereize omutima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:10">Ahabw'okuba eibiika rya viinyo riryabura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:10">N'eishaaruura tiriribaho.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Imwe bakazi bajarami 'mwe, muteteme!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:11">Imwe abataine ki mwetaireho, muhahaaze emitima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:11">Mujuure ebi mujwaire, mujware busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:11">Mwezirikye ebiguniya.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Baryayemaamaata nibasaasibwa emisiri yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:12">Emisiri eyaabaire ebashemeza, n'emizaabibu eyaabaire eyera munonga,<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:13, 14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:25">Isa 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:11">24:11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 24:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:24">Yer 2:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'emisiri y'abantu bangye emezirwemu amahwa n'emikwatangwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:13">N'amaju goona agarikushemeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:13">Ag'omu rurembo orurikushemererwa;<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Ahabw'okuba ekikaari ky'omugabe kiryatsigwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:14">Orurembo orutwirwemu abantu baingi ruhindukye amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:14">Ekibungo n'omunaara gw'abarinzi bihindukye amaaya ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:14">Amakiniro g'enturegye n'amariisizo g'amasyo,<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:17">Isa 29:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:1">35:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:28">Yoel 2:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuhitsya obu Omwoyo aritushukwaho naaruga omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:15">Amahamba gakabona kuba emisiri erikweza munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:15">N'omusiri ogurikweza munonga bakagweta ekibira.<verse eid="ISA 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Obwo eby'oburyo biryashangwa omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:16">N'okuhikiirira kushangwe omu misiri erikweza munonga.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:3">Zab 72:3</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 3:18">Yak 3:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki okuhikiirira kurireeta kiryaba obusingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:17">Kandi ekiriruga omuri okwo kuhikiirira kibe okutuuza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:17">N'amatsiko agatarikubanganisibwa ebiro byona.<verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Abantu bangye baryatuura omu nsi baine obusingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:18">Bagume omu maju gaabo agahamire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:18">N'omu myanya y'okuhuumuriramu etuurize.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:5">Isa 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 11:2">Zek 11:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ekibira ku kiriba nikigwa, orubaare ruryagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:19">N'orurembo rusheenyerwe kimwe.<verse eid="ISA 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:23">Isa 30:23</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:24">24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhiiriirwe, imwe ababiba aha mbaju z'amaizi goona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:20">Mukanagurayo ente n'endogoya.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Oku Ruhanga arikurwansa engobya n'abanyagi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:2">Isa 21:2</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:8">Hab 2:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryakareeba, iwe orikunyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Haza otakanyagwaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Iwe orikugobya otakagobezibwaga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Ku oriheza kunyaga, naiwe oryanyagwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Kandi ku oriheza kugobya, naiwe oryagobezibwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Ai MUKAMA, otugirire embabazi, tukutegyereize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:2">Otubeere amaani buri kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:2">Kandi otubeere okujunwa omu biro by'enaku.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Amahanga gabingirwe enduuru z'okwimukirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:3">Kandi oimukire, amahanga gaataataana.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Baryateerana eminyago, nk'oku kanyananga eshanguruza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:4">Bagyeshukyemu nk'enzigye.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 97:9">Zab 97:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naahimbisibwa, ahabw'okuba atuura ahaiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:5">Aryaijuza Saayuuni eby'oburyo n'okuhikiirira.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 39:8">Isa 39:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:7">Enf 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro byawe aryaba okuhama kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:6">Okujunwa kwawe kwingi, obwengye n'okumanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:6">Okutiina MUKAMA niryo itungo rya Saayuuni.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:37">2 Bag 18:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, amamanzi gaabo nigaboroogyera aheeru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:7">Entumwa z'okushaba obusingye nizirira munonga,<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 5:6">Bar 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:14-17">2 Bag 18:14-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emihanda rugyendwa erimu busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:8">Omugyenzi takigirabamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:8">Endagaano ziriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:8">Baakareebi nibagaywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:8">Omuntu takyetwaho.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Ensi neecura, neehwerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:9">Lebanooni eshobeirwe, ehotokire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:9">Sharooni ni nk'eihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:9">Bashani na Karumeeli nizikunkumuka amababi.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 12:5">Zab 12:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Hati naimuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:10">Naaza kweta ahaiguru, nsingizibwe hati hati.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Muryatwara enda y'ebishushunga, muzaare ebitsintsi by'embuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:11">Omwitsyo gwanyu gube omuriro oguribootsya.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Amahanga garyayokibwa, gacwekye einoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:12">Gabe nk'oku amahwa gatemwa, gakookibwa omu muriro.<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku Mukama arijuna abantu be</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Imwe abari hare munonga, muhurire eki nkozire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:13">Naimwe abari haihi, mwikirize amaani gangye.<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:15">Isa 66:15</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:29">Heb 12:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abasiisi b'omuri Saayuuni nibatiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:14">Abatarikutiina Ruhanga bakwatsirwe orutetema.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:14">N'oha omuriitwe owaakubaasa kutuura n'omuriro gurikurya busha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:14">N'oha omuriitwe owaakubaasa kutuura n'omuriro gurikwotsya ebiro byona?<verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 24:4">Zab 24:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:27">119:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikugyendera omu kuhikiirira, akagamba ebihikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">Orikwanga amagoba g'okuhata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">Orikukunkumura engaro ze, ngu zitakaakwata enguzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">Orikwekwata aha matu, ngu atahurira eby'okusheesha eshagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">Orikuhumiza amaisho ngu atareeba ekibi.<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:23">Isa 30:23</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:25">25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo niwe arituura omu myanya y'ahaiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:16">Omwanya gwe gw'okwerindiramu guryaba oguzitiirwe amabaare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:16">Aryaguma agaburirwe eby'okurya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:16">N'amaizi g'okunywa tigarimuburira.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:5">Isa 6:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaisho gaawe garyareeba omugabe aine oburungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:17">Gareebe n'ensi eyaaririkire okuhika hare.<verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:14">2 Bag 18:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutima gwawe guryateekateeka aha birikutiinisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:18">Ogire oti: Owaabazire emitoijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:18">Akagipima, arahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:18">Owaabazire eminaara, we arahi?<verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:1">Isa 28:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:15">Yer 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:49">Bir 28:49</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:50">50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Torigaruka kureeba ihanga eririkushaarira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:19">Ery'engambo etarikwetegyerezibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:19">Ei otarikubaasa kumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:19">Ery'orurimi rw'enduga-mahanga oru otarikubaasa kuhurira.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Yetegyereze Saayuuni, orurembo oru twabaire tukoreramu amagyenyi agaatairweho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">Amaisho gaawe garyareeba Yerusaalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">Oshangye eri obutuuro bucureire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">Eihema ryayo tiririfururwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">Enkondo zaaryo tizirikuurwa ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">N'omurunga gwaryo na gumwe tiguricweka;<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 46:4">Zab 46:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 46:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kureka okwo niyo MUKAMA ariguma naitwe aine ekititiinsia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:21">Omwanya gw'emigyera mihango n'emikye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:21">Etarirabwamu maato agarikuvugisibwa engahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:21">N'obu yaakuba emeeri y'ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 12:12">1 Sam 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zek 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:12">Yak 4:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba MUKAMA niwe muramuzi waitu, kandi omutegyeki waitu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:22">MUKAMA niwe Mugabe waitu: aryatujuna.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Emigoye yaawe eyugire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:23">Tekibaasa kuhamya murongooti omu mwanya gwagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:23">N'obu kwakuba okureega amatanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:23">N'ahabw'ekyo eminyago n'ebinyagirwe bingi biryabaganwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:23">Nangwa n'ebirema nabyo biryatwara eminyago.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:5">Isa 1:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:20">Yer 50:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi tihaine mutuuzi waayo origira ati: Ndwaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:24">Abantu abatwireyo baryasaasirwa okutahikiirira kwabo.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Ebifubiro ebi Ruhanga arita aha mahanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Imwe mahanga 'mwe, mwirire haihi, muhurire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:1">Naimwe abantu, mutegye amatu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:1">Ensi ehurie, n'ebigirimu byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:1">Kandi n'ebigirugamu byona.<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA agwereirwe kubi amahanga goona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:2">Agiriire eihe ryago ryona ekiniga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:2">Abacwereire orubanja kubasinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:2">Yaabahayo kwitwa.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:20">Yoel 2:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu baabo abaitsirwe baryanagwa aheeru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:3">Ekinuuko ky'emitumbi yaabo kiimukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:3">N'enshozi ziryatengurwa eshagama yaabo.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Yoel 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Kush 6:13</ref>, <ref loc="REV 6:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eihe ryona ery'omu iguru riryahwerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">Eiguru riryazingwa nk'omuzingo gw'empapura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">N'amahe gaaryo goona garyahotoka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">Nk'amababi g'omuzaabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">Nari ag'omutiini oku gahotoka, gakaragarika.<verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">Isa 63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Yer 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-4">Mal 1:2-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba rurara yangye enywereire munonga omu iguru, yaiguta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:5">Mbwenu yaaza kushuuma Edomu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:5">N'omu bantu abu naakyeenire, ebahane.<verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEP 1:7">Zef 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rurara ya MUKAMA enyweire eshagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">Yaagomorwa ebishaju</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">N'eshagama y'entaama n'embuzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">N'ebishaju by'aha ntsigo z'empaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA yaaza kwetambirira ebitambo Bozira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">N'okwita baingi omu nsi ya Edomu.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Embogo ziryagwa ahamwe nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:7">N'ebimasha hamwe n'enimi z'ebigundu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:7">Ensi yaabo ejengibwe eshagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:7">N'eitaka ryayo rigomorwe ebishaju.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:2">Isa 61:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba eryo izooba n'eri MUKAMA arihooreraho enzigu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:8">N'omwaka gw'okubazimuurira ebi bakoreire Saayuuni.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Emigyera ya Edomu eryahinduka koroto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:9">N'eitaka ryayo riryaba nk'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:9">Ensi yaayo ehindukye koroto erikubira.<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:24">Isa 66:24</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:11">Kush 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:3">19:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Teriraazibwa nyekiro na nyomushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:10">Omwika gwayo guryacumbuuka ebiro byona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:10">Okuruga aha busingye okuhika aha bundi eryaguma eri amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:10">Tihaine origirabamu okuhitsya ryari na ryari,<verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Kureka empungu n'ebinyogote nibyo birigikubuura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:11">Ebihihizi n'ebikoona bikagituuramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:11">Aryahagyeresa omugoye, nikwo kujagarara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:11">Na kariisho, nikwo kutsigarwamu busha.<verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Baryayeta abakungu baayo kwihamu omwe ow'okwemeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:12">Kwonka tihaine oribayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:12">N'abanyiginya baayo boona baryaba busha.<verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:13, 14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:21">Isa 13:21</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 13:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 32:13">32:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Zaanyaruju zaayo ziryamerwamu amahwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:13">N'ebigo byayo bimerwemu ebicuragyenyi n'amatojo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:13">Haryaba eikoobaaniro rya zaamuha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:13">N'obutaaho bwa zaamaaya.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa ziryabugaabugana n'emishega,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:14">N'empaya y'obwoshe eryayetana na ngyenzi yaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:14">Kandi orukooko rwa nyekiro ruryateekama okwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:14">Rwebonere ah'okuhuumurira.<verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Okwo niyo ekihihizi kiryarika, kikateera amahuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:15">Kikagaatira, kikabumbatira abaana baakyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:15">Kandi okwo niyo zaamareere ziriteeranira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:15">Buri emwe n'enkazi yaayo.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Musherure omu kitabo kya MUKAMA, mushomemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Omuri ebyo tiharigira na kimwe ekiriburayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Tiharigira na kimwe ekiribura ekikazi kyakyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Ahabw'okuba akanwa ka MUKAMA niko kakiragiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Kandi Omwoyo we niwe abiteeraine.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:55">Zab 78:55</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abiteereire enteenyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:17">N'omukono gwe gwagibibaganisiza n'omugoye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:17">Eryaba eyaabyo ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:17">Bigituuremu nk'oku obusingye burigyenda nibwihaihana.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Omuhanda gw'abacungwirwe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Eihamba n'ensi eyomire biryashemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:1">Eihamba ry'omusheenyi riryashemererwa, rirabye ebirabyo nk'esheko y'ensi.<verse eid="ISA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Riryarabya ebirabyo bingi munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Ryesiime, rishemererwe, ryeshongore.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Riryaheebwa ekitiinisa kya Lebanooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">N'oburungi bwa Karumeeli na Sharooni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Baryareeba ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Oburungi bwa Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:3">Yob 4:3</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 4:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:12">Heb 12:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mugumye emikono etaine maani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:3">Muhamye amaju agatahamire,<verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Mugambire ab'omutima gw'obwoba muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Mugume, murekye kutiina!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Reeba Ruhanga waanyu naija kuhoora enzigu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Nikwo kuzimuura kwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Aryaija, abajune.<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:5, 6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 32:3">Isa 32:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 32:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:21">48:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mat 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:8">Yoh 5:8</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 5:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:6">9:6</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 9:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo amaisho g'empumi garyahumuurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:5">N'amatu g'ebifa-matu garyaigurwa;<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Ekirema kiryaguruka nk'empara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">N'orurimi rw'ekiteta rweshongore ahabw'okushemererwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">Ahabw'okuba amaizi garyafumuka omu ihamba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">N'emigyera omu ihamba ry'omusheenyi;<verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Omusheenyi gurikwotsya guryahinduka ekiyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">N'ensi ekarangataine ehindukye ey'enshuro z'amaizi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">Eikobezo rya zaamuha riryaba ekisharara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">N'obunyaatsi bwaho buhindukye ekibingo n'omubimbiri.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:1">52:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi haryabaho omuhanda rugyendwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Gwetwe Omuhanda ogurikwera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Abatashemeire tibarigurabamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Kureka guryaba ogw'abagyenzi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">N'obu bariba bari abashema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Tibariguhabiramu.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:6">Lev 26:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tiharibayo ntare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">Kandi enyamaishwa yoona enshaarizi teriguzamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">Tizirishangwayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">Kureka abacungwirwe nibo barigugyenderamu.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:11">Isa 51:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:19">65:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'abacungwirwe MUKAMA baryagaruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Baije Saayuuni nibeeshongora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Okushemererwa okutahwaho kuri aha maisho gaabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Baryagira okushemererwa n'okunanuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Kandi obusaasi n'okutsinda biryakwata akakiro.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria okuteera Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:1-22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:13">2 Bag 18:13</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:17-37">17-37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'ena gw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Hezekia, Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria akainamuka, yaateera endembo zoona eza Yuda, ezaabaire zeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare, yaazikwata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:1">2 Bus 32:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:3">Isa 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:9">2 Bus 32:9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe wa Asiria, ku yaabaire akiri Lakishi, yaatuma omutware Rabushaake n'eihe rihango aha mugabe Hezekia omuri Yerusaalemu. Rabushaake ku yaahikireyo, yaayemerera aha mukura gw'ekiyanja kya ruguru, ekiri aha muhanda rugyendwa ogurikuza aha kibanja ky'omwozi. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:15-20">Isa 22:15-20</ref>. </char></note> Okwo yaashangwayo Eliakimu mwene Hilukia, owaabaire ari omukuru w'ekikaari, Shebuna omuhandiiki na Yoa mwene Asafu omuhandiiki w'ebirikubaho. <verse eid="ISA 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Omutware Rabushaake yaabagira ati: Mugambire Hezekia muti: oku nikwo omugabe rugambwa, omugabe wa Asira, arikugamba naagira ati: Mbwenu ou orikwesiga n'oha? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />Noogira ngu ebigambo bugambo nibyo naama n'amaani by'okurwanisa? Hari ou oyegamiire hati n'oha, waaza kungomera? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:6">Ezk 29:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 29:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, hati oyegamiire Misri, orubango oruri nk'ekibingo ekihendekire, ekirikwija kucumita ekiganja ky'omuntu weena orikukihimbagiriraho. Okwo nikwo na Faraho omugabe wa Misri ari ahari boona abarikumwesiga. <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">2 Bag 18:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku murangire muti: Nitwesiga MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, tiwe Ogwo ou Hezekia yaihireho emyanya ye mikuru ey'okuramizamu, n'amatambiro ge, naagira Abayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu ati: Mushemereire kuramiza omu maisho g'eri eitambiro eriri Yerusaalemu? <verse eid="ISA 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />Mbwenu, ija okwatirizane na mukama wangye omugabe wa Asiria, nkuhe embaraasi enkumi ibiri; ku oraabone ab'okuzitemba, ongire kwo!<verse eid="ISA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 31:1">Isa 31:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noija kubaasa ota kubinga omwe aha bakuru bangye b'engabo ab'amaani makye okukira abandi, ku oraabe oyesigire Misri kuba nibo baakuha ebigaari n'ab'aha mbaraasi? <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:5">Isa 10:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 10:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi noogira ngu nyizire kuteera ensi egi n'okugicwekyereza, ntaragiirwe MUKAMA? Omanye ngu MUKAMA niwe angizire ati: Inamuka oteere egyo nsi, ogicwekyereze.<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:7">Ezr 4:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Eliakimu, Shebuna na Yoa baagira omutware Rabushaake bati: Twakweshengyereza, gamba n'abairu baawe omu rurimi rw'Abasiria; ahakuba itwe niturumanya; reka kugamba omu rurimi rw'Abayuda, abantu abari aha rugo rw'amabaare bakabihurira. <verse eid="ISA 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Kwonka omutware Rabushaake yaabagarukamu ati: Nimugira ngu mukama wangye antumire ahari mukama waanyu naimwe, kuba niimwe naagambira ebigambo ebi mwenka? Tantumire kubigambira n'abashaija bariya abashutami aha rugo, abarikwija kurya naimwe amazi gaabo n'okunywa naimwe enkari yaabo?<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Ahonaaho omutware Rabushaake yaayemerera, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango omu rurimi rw'Abayuda, naagira ati: Muhurire obutumwa bw'omugabe rugambwa, omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:14, 15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:10">Isa 37:10</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo omugabe arikugamba naagira ati: Mutaikiriza Hezekia kubabeihabeiha; ahabw'okuba tarikwija kubaasa kubajuna. <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Mutaikiriza Hezekia kubeesigisa MUKAMA naabagira ati: Buzimazima MUKAMA naija kutujuna, kandi orurembo oru tirurikwija kuheebwayo mu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="ISA 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />Kandi mutahurira Hezekia; ahakuba oku nikwo omugabe wa Asiria arikugamba naagira ati: Mugarukane naanye, mwije munshangye aha; obwo buri omwe omuriimwe nibwo araarye omuzaabibu gwe n'omutiini gwe, kandi akanywa amaizi g'omu iziba rye, <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:11">2 Bag 18:11</ref>. </char></note> okuhitsya obu ndiija nkabatwara omu nsi erikushushana n'eyaanyu, ensi y'engano na viinyo, n'ey'emigaati n'emizaabibu. <verse eid="ISA 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:18, 19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:12">Isa 37:12</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 37:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Mwerinde, Hezekia atakaababeihabeiha naagira ati: MUKAMA naija kutujuna. Nimugira ngu hariho ruhanga omuri baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga orajunire ensi ye omu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Mbwenu baaruhanga ba Hamasi na Arupaadi barahi? Na baaruhanga ba Sefavaimu barahi? Barajunire Samaria omu mikono yangye? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:15">2 Bus 32:15</ref>. </char></note> Nibaahi omuri baaruhanga boona ab'ezo nsi abarajunire ensi yaabo omu mikono yangye, mukabona kwesiga ku MUKAMA arikwija kwiha Yerusaalemu omu mikono yangye?<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Kwonka abantu boona baahunama, tibaagira ki baamugarukamu, ahabw'okuba ekiragiro ky'omugabe kikaba nikigira kiti: Mutamugarukamu. <verse eid="ISA 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 33:7">Isa 33:7</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Eliakimu mwene Hilukia, owaabaire ari mukuru w'ekikaari, Shebuna omuhandiiki, na Yoa mwene Asafu, omuhandiiki w'ebirikubaho, baija ahari Hezekia, bataagwire ebijwaro byabo, baamuteekyerereza ebigambo by'omutware Rabushaake.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Okushaba kwa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:1-38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:1-37">2 Bag 19:1-37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe Hezekia ku yaakihuriire, yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaayefubika ekiguniya, yaaza omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Yaatuma Eliakimi omukuru w'ekikaari, Shebuna omuhandiiki n'abanyamurwa abakuru ahari nabi Isaaya mwene Amozi, bajwaire ebiguniya. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:5">Isa 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:13">Hos 13:13</ref>. </char></note> Baamugira bati: Oku nikwo Hezekia arikugamba naagira ati: Eri izooba n'eizooba ry'obusaasi n'okuhanwa n'okuteererwa enaku; ahakuba abaana bahikire kuzaarwa, kwona amaani g'okubazaara tigariho. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa 1:9</ref>. </char></note> Shana MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ahuriire ebigambo byona ebigambirwe omutware Rabushaake, ou mukama we omugabe wa Asiria atumire kugaya Ruhanga otahwaho; obundi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akaamuhana ahabw'ebyo bigambo ebi ahuriire. N'ahabw'ekyo imutsya eiraka ryawe, oshabire abantu abakiriho abahonokire.<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Abaheereza b'omugabe Hezekia ku baahikire owa Isaaya, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />yaabagira ati: Mugambire mukama waanyu muti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Otatiina ebyo bigambo ebi ohuriire, ebi abaheereza b'omugabe wa Asiria banjumire. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:14">Isa 19:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:38">37:38</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, niinyija kumutamu ogundi mutima, ahurire orukuru, agarukye omu nsi ye; kandi ku araahikyeyo, mmwitse rurara.<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Bwanyima omutware Rabushaake yaagarukayo, yaashanga omugabe wa Asiria naarwanisa Libuna; ahabw'okuba akaba ahuriire ku arugire Lakishi. <verse eid="ISA 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:5">Isa 20:5</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaahurira ebya Tiruhaaka omugabe wa Esiopia, nibagira bari, Reeba, aizire kukuteera. Ku yaakihuriire, yaagaruka yaatuma ahari Hezekia naagira ati: <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 36:15">Isa 36:15</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo muraagire Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda muti: Otaikiriza Ruhanga waawe ogwo, ou orikwesiga, kukubeiha naakuraganisa ati: Yerusaalemu teriheebwayo mu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Ohuriire oku abagabe ba Asiria baagizire ensi zoona, bakazicwekyerereza kimwe. Noogira ngu niiwe orikwija kukira? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:12, 13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 36:18">Isa 36:18</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 36:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Amahanga aga, Gozani, Harani, Rezefu, n'ab'omuri Edeni abaabaire batwire Telasaari, agu baatatenkuru baacwekyereize, noogira ngu baaruhanga baago bakagajuna? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Nyoreka omugabe wa Hamasi, owa Arupaadi, ow'orurembo rwa Sefavaimu, owa Hena, n'owa Iiva!<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Hezekia yaayakiira ebaruha eyaareetsirwe ezo ntumwa, yaagishoma; bwanyima yainamuka, yaaza omu nju ya MUKAMA, yaagimushashaanurira omu maisho. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Hezekia yaashabira omu maisho ga MUKAMA naagira ati: <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Kur 25:22</ref>. </char></note> Ai MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, otuura aha kitebe ky'obukama ahagati ya baakerubi, iwe wenka niiwe Ruhanga w'obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi; niiwe waahangire eiguru n'ensi. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:18">Dan 9:18</ref>. </char></note> Ai MUKAMA, tega okutu kwawe; igura amaisho gaawe, MUKAMA, oreebe, ohurire ebigambo ebi Senakeribu atumire kurogota ahari Ruhanga otahwaho. <verse eid="ISA 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:13">Isa 10:13</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 10:14">14</ref>. </char></note> N'ekya buzima, ai MUKAMA, abagabe ba Asiria bakacwekyereza abantu b'ago mahanga n'ensi zaabo, <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />baanaga baaruhanga baabo omu muriro, ahabw'okuba bakaba batari baaruhanga nyamuhanga, kureka bakaba bakozirwe engaro z'abantu, omu biti n'omu mabaare; nikyo baacwekyerereziibwe. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />N'ahabw'ekyo hati, MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, ninkweshengyereza otujune, otwihe omu mikono ye, obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi bumanye ku niiwe wenka oba MUKAMA.<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isaaya okuragura ebiriba aha mugabe wa Asiria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Bwanyima Isaaya mwene Amozi yaatuma ahari Hezeki naagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okunshaba kukuhwera aha bya Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria, <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />eki nikyo kigambo eki MUKAMA amugambireho naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">Saayuuni oshugaine naakugaya, naakushekyerera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">Na Yerusaalemu naakuzongoreza omutwe.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />N'oha ou ojumire, okarogotaho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:23">Kandi ou okabukiire, okateera ekitsyori n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:23">N'Orikwera wa Israeli<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:7">Isa 8:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 8:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:8">14:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ojumiise MUKAMA entumwa zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Noogira oti: Nyinamukire n'ebigaari byangye bingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Aha mitwe y'enshozi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Hare munonga ahagati ya Lebanooni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Niinyija kutema emyereezi yaayo emiraingwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">N'emiberooshi yaayo emirungi munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Niinyija kuhika omu bweshereko bwayo hare munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Omu kibira kyayo ekikwataine.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Nkatimba amaziba, naanywa amaizi gaago;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:25">Naaribatiirira emigyera ya Misri yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:25">Naagyomya.<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />Torahuriire ku naamaririire ira kukikora?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Omu biro bya ira nkacuma enaama y'okukora</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Ebi ndikuhikiiriza omu biro ebi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Ngu ocwekyereze endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Ozihindure amatongo.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Nikyo kyareeteire abazitwiremu kucweka entegye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Bakahahaaza emitima, bakarimbagirirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Bakaba nk'obunyaatsi bw'omu ishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Nk'obunyaatsi buto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Bakahotoka nk'obunyaatsi obumezire aha mutwe gw'enju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Nk'omusiri gw'engano ezitakakuzire.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />Kwonka nimmanya emishutamire yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:28">Emihururire yaawe n'emitabaarukire yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:28">Kandi n'ekiniga eki wangiriire.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:28">Isa 30:28</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 4:2">Amo 4:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okungirira ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Kandi nkahurira eby'amaryo gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Niinyija kukuta eirobo ryangye omu nyindo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">N'ekyoma kyangye omu kanwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Nkugarure omuhanda gwakureetsire.<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />Kandi aka karyakubeera akamanyiso; omu mwaka ogu nimwija kurya ebyemerize, omu gwa kabiri murye ebyemerize eby'emiragarika y'ebyo; bwanyima omu mwaka gwa kashatu muryabiba mugyeshe, mubyare emizaabibu, murye ebijuma byayo. <verse eid="ISA 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:6">Isa 27:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abaatsigaire aha b'enju ya Yuda abaahonokireho, baryagaruka batsimbe emizi okuzimu, n'ahaiguru baane ebyana; <verse eid="ISA 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba omuri Yerusaalemu haryarugamu ekicweka, ekiriba kitsigaireho, n'aha rushozi Saayuuni harugyeho omutwe gw'abaahonokireho. Obweziriki bwa MUKAMA buryakihikiiriza.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />Nikyo MUKAMA arikugambira aha mugabe wa Asiria, ati: Tarihika muri oru rurembo, nari okururashamu omwambi, nari okurwemurikira omu maisho aine engabo ye, n'obu kwakuba okurutuumaho omutuumo gw'eitaka. <verse eid="ISA 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Omuhanda ogwamureetsire nigwo gurimugarurayo, kandi taritaaha muri oru rurembo, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. <verse eid="ISA 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 31:5">Isa 31:5</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 20:6">2 Bag 20:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ndyarinda oru rurembo, ndujune ahabwangye n'ahabw'omwiru wangye Daudi.<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucwekyerera kw'engabo za Senakeribu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:25">Isa 14:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:8">31:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo kiro maraika wa MUKAMA yaija, yaateera orusiisira rw'Abaasiria, yaitamu engabo zaabo akasiriira n'obukumi munaana n'enkumi itaano. Abantu ku baimukire omu kasheeshe, baashanga ezo ngabo zoona ziri emitumbi. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Bwanyima Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria yaarugayo, yaagaruka Nineeve, yaatuurayo. <verse eid="ISA 37:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Ku yaabaire ari omuri nyaruju ya ruhanga we Nisirooki naamuramya, Adurameleki na Sharezeeri abatabani baija, baamwitsa rurara, baacwa, baahungira omu nsi ya Araraati. Esari-hadooni omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekia okwongyerwaho emyaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:1-8, 21, 22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">2 Bag 20:1-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Hezekia akarwara, yaahika aha ncwamba za rufu. Nabi Isaaya mwene Amozi yaija ah'ari, yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Tebeekanisa eka yaawe; ahabw'okuba noija kufa, tori w'okukira.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:24">2 Bus 32:24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ISA 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Ahonaaho Hezekia yaahinduka, yaareeba ekisiika, yaashaba MUKAMA naagira ati: <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:5">2 Bag 18:5</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Ai MUKAMA, ninkweshengyereza ijuka hati oku ngyendeire omu maisho gaawe omu bwesigwa n'omutima oguhikire, ninkora ebi orikusiima. Yaarira munonga. <verse eid="ISA 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Isaaya nikigira kiti: <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />Garukayo ogambire Hezekia oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Daudi shwenkuru, arikugamba naagira ati: Naahurira okushaba kwawe, kandi naareeba n'amarira gaawe; reeba, niinyija kukwongyeraho emyaka ikumi n'etaano. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:35">Isa 37:35</ref>. </char></note> Ndyakujuna, iwe n'orurembo oru, omu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria, kandi ndyarurinda.<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:7, 8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 20:9-11">2 Bag 20:9-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aka niko kamanyiso aku MUKAMA akuhaire, akarikuhamya ku arikwija kuhikiiriza eki agambire. <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Reeba, ekicuucu eky'aha ky'okugyeresa kya Ahazi, ekirikureetwa eizooba eririkurenga, niinyija kukigarura enyima entambwe ikumi. Rityo eizooba ryaiha ahi ryaba ryahika nirirenga, ryagaruka enyima entambwe ikumi ez'aha ky'okugyeresa ekyo.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Ebi Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda yaahandiikire, obu yaarwara, akakira, nibyo ebi.<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:24">Zab 102:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbaire ningira nti: Nshemereire kurugaho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:10">Nkiri ahagati y'emyaka yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:10">Naaza kuraba omu marembo g'okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:10">Ncwirweho emyaka yangye.<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:13">Zab 27:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:22">31:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naagira nti: Tindireeba MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">Omu nsi y'abahuriire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">Tindigaruka kucwa muntu riisho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">Omu bantu abatwire omu nsi.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:20">Yob 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 6:9">6:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:1">2 Kor 5:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eka yangye ehurutwirwe, yaanyihwaho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Nk'eihema ry'omuriisa w'entaama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Nzingire amagara gangye nk'omuruki w'emyenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Naija kuncwa aha biti by'okurukiraho emyenda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Okwiha omu kasheeshe okuhitsya nyekiro, ommariramu kimwe amaani.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Nindaara nintaka ngu mpwerwe okuhitsya omu kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:13">Kwonka noohenda amagufa gangye goona nk'entare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:13">Okwiha omu kasheeshe okuhitsya nyekiro, ommariramu kimwe amaani.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:11">Isa 59:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:3">Zab 69:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nintaka nk'entaratambi nari nk'entuuha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">Ninganya nk'enkombe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">amaisho gangye garuhire ahabw'okugwa ahaiguru gategyereize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">Ai MUKAMA, niinyitwa kubi, onyemererere.<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Mbwenu ngambe ki? Ahabw'okuba niwe anyegambiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">Kandi niwe akikozire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">Oturo tungurukire ahabw'obushaarizi bw'omu mutima.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Ai Mukama, ebyo nibyo bibaisaho abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">Kandi omuri ebyo byona nimwo amagara g'omwoyo gwangye gari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">Naakweshengyereza ngaruramu amagara, ombaiseho!<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:12">Zab 103:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:75">119:75</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, onyikiriize kugira obusaasi bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">Ngu bundugiremu obusingye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">Kwonka ahabw'okunkunda waazibira amagara gangye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">Kugwa omu kiina ky'okuhwerekyerereramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">Ahabw'okuba ebibi byangye byona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">Obyenagire enyima.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 6:5">Zab 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:10">88:10</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:10">Mub 9:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manya Okuzimu terikubaasa kukusiima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">Rufu terikubaasa kukuhimbisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">Abo abashuuma okuzimu tibarikubaasa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">Kuta amatsiko aha bwesigwa bwawe.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:9">Bir 4:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:3">Zab 78:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ohuriire, ohuriire, niwe akusiima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:19">Nk'oku ndikukusiima eri izooba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:19">Omuzaire w'abaana abamanyisa obwesigwa bwawe.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />MUKAMA naija kunjuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">N'ahabw'ekyo nitwija kuguma nitweshongorera omu nju ya MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">Ebyeshongoro ebi naagunzire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">Nitubyeshongorera aha nanga z'emirya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">Ebiro byona eby'amagara gaitu.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Obwo Isaaya akaba agizire ngu, Bareete ekitongye ky'emitiini, bakibatikye aha kizimba, akire. <verse eid="ISA 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Na Hezekia akaba agizire ati: Ni kamanyiso ki akarikummanyisa ku ndaije kwinamuka omu nju ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekia okworeka entumwa za Babulooni obutungi bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:1-8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">2 Bag 20:12-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Merodaaki-baladaani mwene Baladaani omugabe wa Babulooni, akatuma ahari Hezekia entumwa, zaamutwarira ebaruha n'ekiconco, ahabw'okuba akaba ahuriire ngu arwaire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:31">2 Bus 32:31</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:15">2 Bag 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Hezekia yaazaakiira n'okushemererwa, yaazooreka enju ye yoona omu abiika ebintu bye eby'obuguzi bwingi, efeeza, ezaabu emigaju, amajuta g'obuguzi bwingi, n'ahu abiika eby'okurwanisa bye, n'ebyashangirwe omu mabiikiro ge byona. Tihariho kintu na kimwe omu nju ye nari omu bugabe bwe bwona, eki atarazoorekire. <verse eid="ISA 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Bwanyima nabi Isaaya yaija aha mugabe Hezekia yaagira ati: Barugahi? Hezekia yaagira ati: Barugire omu nsi ya hare Babulooni. <verse eid="ISA 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Onu ati: Bareebire ki omwawe? Hezekia yaagarukamu ati: Byona ebiri omwangye babireebire; tihariho kintu kyona omu mabiikiro gangye eki ntaboorekire.<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Isaaya yaagira Hezekia ati: Mbwenu hurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA ow'amahe. <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">2 Bag 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:18">2 Bus 36:18</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, obunaku buryahika, ebintu by'omu nju yaawe byona, n'ebi baashwenkuru baabiikire okuhitsya hati, bitwarwe Babulooni, harekye kugira ekyatsigaraho, nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:3">Dan 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bamwe ahari batabani baawe, abu oriba oyezaariire, baryatwarwa, bahindukye abakonwa omu kikaari ky'omugabe wa Babulooni. <verse eid="ISA 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:18">1 Sam 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:26">2 Bus 32:26</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Hezekia yaagira Isaaya ati: Ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki waagamba ni kirungi. Ahakuba Hezekia ogwo akagira ati: Niho harikwija kubaho obusingye n'obuhooro omu biro byangye.<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhanuura kwa nabi aha bya Yohaana Omubatizi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Muhuumurize abantu bangye, mubahuumurize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:1">Nikwo Ruhanga waanyu arikugira.<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 68:4">Zab 68:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:3">Mak 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:23">Yoh 1:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mugambire Yerusaalemu n'embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">Mugirangire n'eiraka rihango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">Ku engamba zaayo zihweire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">Ku okutahikiirira kwayo kusaasirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">Kandi ku MUKAMA agihaire kabiri ekifubiro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">Neeturwa ebibi byayo byona.<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:24">Isa 5:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhurire eiraka ry'orikuranga naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">Mushemeze omuhanda gwa MUKAMA omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">Mugororere MUKAMA omuhanda rugyendwa omu ihamba ry'omusheenyi.<verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:4, 5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:5">Luk 3:5</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Empanga zoona ziryatunguurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:4">N'enshozi zoona n'ebibungo biryabandikwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:4">Ebitegami biryagororwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:4">N'emyanya etaringaniire eryaringanizibwa,<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Kandi ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kiryashuuruurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:5">Abantu boona bakireebere hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:5">Ahakuba akanwa ka MUKAMA niko kaakigamba.<verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:6-8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:2">Yob 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:15">Zab 103:15</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:24">1 Pet 1:24</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 1:25">25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eiraka nirigira riti: Ranga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">Naanye naagira ati: Ndangye ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">Emibiri yoona eba nk'obunyaatsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">N'oburungi bwayo bwona buba nk'orurabyo rw'obunyaatsi.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Obunyaatsi buhonga, n'orurabyo ruhunduura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:7">Ahakuba MUKAMA arwikiza omwitsyo gwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:7">Buzimazima abantu n'obunyaatsi.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 1:10">Yak 1:10</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 1:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obunyaatsi buhonga, orurabyo ruhunduura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:8">Kwonka ekigambo kya Ruhanga waitu kiryagumaho ebiro byona.<verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Saayuuni, orikuranga amakuru marungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Irooko otembe orushozi ruraingwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Iwe Yerusaalemu, orikuranga amakuru marungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Imutsya eiraka ryawe n'amaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Riimutsye, orekye kutiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Ogambire endembo za Yuda oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Reeba Ruhanga waanyu!<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:11">Isa 62:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">Kush 22:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, Mukama RUHANGA naija n'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">Naategyekyesa omukono gwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">Reeba, naija aine ebihembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">N'enzimuurano ye emwebembeire.<verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:12">Mat 18:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:5">Luk 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:3">Yoh 10:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:15">21:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryariisa obusyo bwe nk'omuriisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">Aryakiikira abaana b'entaama ze omu mikono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">Abatwarire omu kifuba kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">N'ezirikuhaka azishotoore.<verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'obukuru bwa Mukama</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 30:4">Enf 30:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha orarengire amaizi g'omu nsi yoona omu ngaro ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">Akateera eiguru ekita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">Akata omucuucu gw'ensi yoona omu ndengo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">Akapima enshozi n'ebibungo aha minzaani?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 11:34">Rom 11:34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:16">1 Kor 2:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha orahabwire Omwoyo wa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:13">Akamwegyesa nk'omuhi w'obwengye we?<verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:22">Yob 21:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha ou areebuurizeho obwengye kumuhabura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">Kandi n'oha oramwegyeise emihanda y'eby'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">Akamwegyesa okumanya n'okwetegyereza?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:5">Isa 29:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, amahanga ni nk'eitondo ry'omu ndobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:15">Kandi nigagyeranisibwa n'omucuucu gw'aha minzaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:15">Reeba, akiriza ebirwa nk'orikukiriza akantu kakye munonga.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:10">Zab 50:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Lebanooni tekaarugwamu nku zirikumara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:16">Kandi n'enyamaishwa zaayo tizikaamara kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:9">Zab 62:9</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:35">Dan 4:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahanga goona ni busha omu maisho ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:17">Ahariwe ni busha, nangwa nigabarwa nk'agarikukirwa busha.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 46:5">Isa 46:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:29">Byak 17:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu n'oha ou waakushushanisa na Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:18">Nari mukaamushushanisa na kintu ki?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:2">Hos 13:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba ekishushani ekiheesire! Omukozi akiheesha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:19">Omuheesi w'ezaabu akishweka ezaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:19">Kandi akiheeshera emikuufu y'efeeza.<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:3-5">Yer 10:3-5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omworo otarikubona ky'okuhonga nk'ekyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">Asherura ekiti ekitarikujunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">Bwanyima ayesherurira omukozi omunyamwoga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">Kutaho ekishushani ekibaizirwe ekitarikubaasa kugwa.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 14:17">Byak 14:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:19">Rom 1:19</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 1:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Timukamanyaga? Timukahuriraga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Timukakigambirwaga okuruga iranaira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Timukeetegyerezaga okuruga aha kuhangwa kw'ensi?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 13:33">Kub 13:33</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:8">Yob 9:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe Ogwo oshutama ahaiguru y'ensi eyebumburikire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">N'abagituuramu bakaba nk'eseenene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">Niwe abamba eiguru nk'omukingo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">Akariteera nk'eihema ry'okuraaramu,<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:21">Yob 12:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ocwa busha abanyiginya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:23">Akahindura abategyeki b'omu nsi busha.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 83:13">Zab 83:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baba nibakibyarwa bati, nibakibibwa bati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">Ekitsintsi kyabo nikikitsimba emizi omu itaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">Ruhanga akibahuuha, bahotoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">Akasooroora kabatwara nk'ekumbwe.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />N'oha ou mwakungyeranisa nawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:25">Tukaingana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:25">Nikwo Orikwera arikubuuza.<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Mwimutsye amaisho gaanyu ahaiguru, mureebe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">N'oha owaahangire biriya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Niwe Ogwo oshohoza amahe gaabyo omu mitwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Byona akabyeta omu maziina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Ahabw'obukuru bw'amaani ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Kandi ahabw'okuba ow'amaani omu bushoboorozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Tihariho na kimwe ekibuzireho.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Iwe Yakobo, ningira Israeli, ahabw'enki nooyesaasira noogira oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:27">Omuhanda gwangye gusherekirwe MUKAMA, tarikugureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:27">Kandi n'ebyangye Ruhanga wangye tarikubyetaho?<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:7">Yob 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 121:4">Zab 121:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tokamanyaga? Tokahuriraga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">MUKAMA ni Ruhanga otahwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Owaahangire emperu z'ensi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Tagwa nshazi, n'obu kwakuba okuruha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Okucondooza obwengye bwe tikurikubaasika.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />Abarikugwa enshazi abaha amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:29">Kandi n'otarikwebaasa, amwongyeraho amaani.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Abarikunyeeta baryagwa enshazi, baruhe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:30">N'abatsigazi baryahweramu kimwe amaani,<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:5">Zab 103:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka abategyereza MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">Baryagarukwamu amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">Batumbiikye ahaiguru n'amapapa nk'amashamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">Baryairuka, tibariruha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">Baryagyenda, tibarigwa nshazi.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhuumuriza kwa Ruhanga aha barikumwesiga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:20">Hab 2:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe birwa 'mwe, nimuhuname mumpurire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">K'amahanga gagarukwemu amaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">Gairire haihi, gagambe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">Twena tuteeranire hamwe, tushoboororane.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:1">Isa 45:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:11">46:11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:23">2 Bus 36:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha owaimukize ow'oburugwa-izooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Otuura naasingura ahi aza hoona?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Ahayo amahanga omu maisho ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Ngu abone kuribatiirira abagabe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Abahindura omucuucu na rurara ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Abagira ebishushunga ebirikutwarwa omuyaga n'obuta bwe.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />Ababinga, arabaho n'obusingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:3">Naaraba omu mihanda ei atakaribatamuga.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:10">Isa 43:10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Kush 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Owaakozire ekyo, akakihitsya, n'oha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Akeeta abantu, nk'oku obusingye bwabo bwabaire nibukuratana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Okwiha aha kutandika?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Nyowe MUKAMA, ow'okubanza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Kandi ow'aha muheru. Niinye naakikozire.<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Ebirwa bikareeba, byatiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">Emperu z'ensi zaatetema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">Byairira haihi, byaija.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Buri muntu naahwera mutaahi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:6">Naagira mwene ishe ati: Guma!<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:19">Isa 40:19</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omunyamyoga naagumya omuheesi w'ezaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">N'orikuteteza ekyoma n'enyondo agumya orikuheesha, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">Ebyoma twabiteerana gye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">Bwanyima babihamya n'emisomaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">Ngu birekye kujegajega.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:1">Isa 44:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 44:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">Bir 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:7">2 Bus 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:4">Zab 135:4</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yak 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka iwe, Israeli omwiru wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:8">Yakobo ou naatooraine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:8">Oruzaaro rwa Abrahamu munywani wangye;<verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />Iwe ou naayetsire nkaiha aha muheru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">Kandi nkakwiha aha nshonda zaayo za hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">Ninkugira nti: Ori omwiru wangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">Nkakutorana, tindakucwire.<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 48:10">Zab 48:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otatiina, ahabw'okuba nkwine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">Otahahaaza omutima, ahabw'okuba ndi Ruhanga waawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">Ndyakuha amaani, ndyakuhwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">Nkuramire n'omukono gwangye gwa buryo ogw'obusinguzi.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />Reeba, abakwiniire ekiniga boona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:11">Baryakwatwa enshoni, bashoberwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:11">Abo abarikukurwanisa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:11">Baryacweka busha, bahwerekyerere.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:10">Zab 37:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryasherura abarikukuhakanisa, bakuburire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:12">Kandi abarikukurwanisa baryacweka busha, babe nk'ebitariho.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Ahabw'okuba nyowe, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">Ndyakukwata omukono gwa buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">Nkugire nti: Otatiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">Naija kukuhwera.<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:14">Isa 43:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:5">54:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe munyongororwa 'we Yakobo, otatiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">Naimwe bantu ba Israeli 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">Ndyabahwera, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">Omucunguzi waanyu niwe Orikwera wa Israeli.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 4:13">Mik 4:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ndyakugira ekihuuzo kisya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">Ky'obwogi, kandi eky'amaino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">Oryahuura enshozi, ozaatagure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">Kandi ebibungo obihindure ebishushunga.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:2">Yer 51:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryabiheheeza, omuyaga gubitware,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">N'eihunga ribitaatanise;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">Oryayesiimira omuri MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">Oyeraatire omuri Orikwera wa Israeli<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:17, 18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:6">Isa 35:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 35:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:3">44:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:35">Zab 107:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abooro n'abakyene ku barisherura amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">Gaababurira, orurimi rwabakarangatana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">Nyowe, MUKAMA, ndyabagarukamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">Nyowe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, tindibahemukaho.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Ndyaigura emigyera aha bibungo by'emparamaata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">N'enshuro ahagati y'empanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">Mpindure eihanga ekiyanja ky'amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">N'ensi ekarangataine ngihindure enshuro z'amaizi,<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:1">Isa 35:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 35:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:12">55:12</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 55:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:13">60:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu ihamba ndyabyaramu emyereezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">Eminyinya, emikadasi, n'emizeituuni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">Kandi n'omu ihamba ry'omusheenyi ndyabyaramu emiberooshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">Emikadasi n'emiteyashuuri, bikurire hamwe,<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:9">Yob 12:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu babone kureeba, bamanye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">Bateekateekye, beetegyereze hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">Ku omukono gwa MUKAMA nigwo gukikozire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">Kandi Orikwera wa Israeli ku niwe yaakihangire.<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugyeragyeranisa Ruhanga na baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />Nimutongane orubanja rwanyu, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:21">Mureete ebi murikuhamizaho, nikwo Mukama wa Yakobo arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:7">Isa 44:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:21">45:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:10">46:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bareete ebishushani byabo, batuhanuurire ebiribaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Mutugambire ebyabaireho, nk'oku byabaire biri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Tubiteekateekyeho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Tumanye obugarukiro bwabyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Nari mutugambire ebirikwenda kubaho,<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:7">Isa 45:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutuhanuurire ebiribaho bwanyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">Tumanye ku muri baaruhanga buzima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">Mukore kurungi, nari kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">Tubireebe, emitima etuhwe omunda, tutiine.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:8">Zab 115:8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:4">1 Kor 8:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, timuri kintu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:24">Kandi timwine ki mwakukora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:24">Owaakuba niimwe yaihamu, akaaba ekihagaro.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:5">Zab 44:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:3">Yer 50:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyine ou nyimukize nkaiha aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Mbwenu yaija.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Yaaruga oburugwa-izooba, omuntu orikurahira eiziina ryangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Aryaribatiirira abategyeki, nk'orikukaata obudongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Kandi nk'omubumbi oku akaata eibumba.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Owaakirangire okwiha aha kutandika, ngu tukimanye, n'oha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Akakihanuuraho ira, tukabona kugira ngu ahikire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Tihariho owaakirangire, tihariho owaakigambire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">N'obu yaakuba owaahuriire ebigambo byanyu.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:9">Isa 40:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye naabandize kukigambira Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:27">Nkatuma Yerusaalemu entumwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:27">Y'okubagambira ebigambo birungi.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Kwonka ku ndikureebayo, nshanga hatariyo muntu n'omwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:28">Nangwa n'omuri baaruhanga abo, ku ndikubuuza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:28">Nshanga hatarimu muhi w'obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:28">Orikubaasa kungarukamu.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Reeba, boona n'entakimazire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:29">Emirimo yaabo ni busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:29">N'ebishushani byabo ebiyagiibwe, n'omuyaga musha.<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Kristo omuheereza wa Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:4">Isa 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:2">11:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:8">41:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:19">42:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:13">52:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18-21">12:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 3:26">Byak 3:26</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:27">4:27</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:7">Fil 2:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba omuheereza wangye, ou ndamira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">Ou naatooraine, ou omutima gwangye gushemerererwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">Mmutaireho Omwoyo wangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">Aryareetera amahanga eby'oburyo.<verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Taritongana, tariyomba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:2">N'eiraka rye tiririhurirwa mu mihanda.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:15">Isa 57:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orubingo orushatukire tariruhenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:3">N'orurimi orurikwaka kubi tariruraaza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:3">Aryayoreka eby'oburyo omu mazima.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:3">Isa 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:9">60:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tariremwa n'obu kwakuba okucuubwa omuhimbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">Okuhitsya obu ariteeraho kimwe eby'oburyo omu nsi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">N'ebirwa biryategyereza ebiragiro bye.<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:24">Isa 44:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:12">45:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:25">Byak 17:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Ruhanga MUKAMA arikugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">Owaahangire eiguru, akaribamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">Owaashashaanwire ensi, akagibuzya ebigirugamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">Abantu baamwo akabaha omwitsyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">N'abarikugigyendamu akabaha omwoyo.<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:6">Isa 49:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:8">8</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:32">Luk 2:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe MUKAMA, nkakwetera omu kuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">Ndyakukwata omukono, ndyakurinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">Nkuhe okuba endagaano y'abantu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">N'omushana gw'okumurikira amahanga,<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:79">Luk 1:79</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:14">Heb 2:14</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 2:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuhumuura amaisho g'empumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:7">Okwiha embohe omu kihome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:7">N'abashutami omu mwirima, okubaiha omu nju y'embohe.<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:11">Isa 48:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndi MUKAMA; eryo niryo iziina ryangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:8">Ekitiinisa kyangye tindikiha ondiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:8">N'obu kwakuba okuha ebishushani ebibaizirwe okuhimbisibwa kwangye.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:19">Isa 43:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ebyahanwirwe ira, mbwenu bihikiriziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">Hati nimbarangira ebisya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">Nimbibagambira bitakabaireho.<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:3">Zab 33:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:23">107:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mweshongorere MUKAMA ekyeshongoro kisya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">Naimwe abari aha muheru gw'ensi, mweshongore eby'okumusingiza!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">Reka enyanja ehinde n'ebigirimu byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">N'ebirwa n'ababitwiremu.<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Ka eihamba n'endembo zaamwo biimutsye amaraka gaabyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">N'ebirwa ebitwirwemu Abakedari;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">Abatuuzi ba Seela beeshongore ahabw'okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">Bateerere akaari aha mitwe y'ebibungo.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Bahe MUKAMA ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:12">Barangye okuhimbisibwa kwe omu birwa.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:65">Zab 78:65</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA aryahurura nk'omushaija emanzi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">Aryaimutsya ekiniga kye, nk'omushaija omanyiire engamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">Ahigye, agambe n'eiraka rihango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">Ayeyorekye abazigu be ku ari emanzi.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />Mmazire omwanya muhango mpunami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">Ntarikuteeza, kandi nyegumize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">Hati naaza kutaka nk'omukazi orikurumwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">Mpeere, nsheemeekye.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:2">Isa 50:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyacwekyereza enshozi n'ebibungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">Nyomye obunyaatsi bwabyo bwona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">Kandi emigyera ndyagihindura ebirwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">N'ebiyanja mbyomye.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 35:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:4">40:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Empumi ndyazikwatira oruhimbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Nzitooze omuhanda ogu zitarikamanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Nzirabye omu tuhanda otu zitakumanyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Ndyahindura omwirima omushana omu maisho gaazo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">N'emyanya etaringaniire ngiringaanize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Ebyo ndyabikora, tindibahemukaho.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:29">Isa 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:16">45:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:7">Zab 97:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka abarikwesiga ebishushani ebibaizirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:17">Bakagira ebishushani ebiyagiibwe bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:17">Niimwe baaruhanga baitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:17">Baryagarurwa enyima, bahemurirwe kimwe.<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />Imwe bifa-matu 'mwe, muhurire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:18">Naimwe empumi, mubuuruure mubone kuhweza!<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />N'oha ori empumi okwihaho omuheereza wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">Nari ekifa-matu nk'entumwa ei ndikutuma?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">N'oha ohumire nk'owangye owaayehaireyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">Nari empumi nk'omuheereza wa MUKAMA?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:10">Yer 6:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Areeba bingi, kwonka tabyetegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:20">Amatu ge gaigwire, kwonka tarikuhurira.<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />MUKAMA ahabw'okuhikiirira kwe akasiima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:21">Kukuza ebiragiro bye n'okubiha ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:17">Isa 14:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka eri n'eihanga eryakirwe ebyaryo, rikagaruka rikanyagwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Abantu baamwo boona bagwire omu busya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Kandi basherekirwe omu bihome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Bahindukire enkwatwa, baabura kijuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Baaba eminyago, baabura owaagira ati: Mubibagarurire.<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:9">Mat 13:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo omuriimwe hariho otegire amatu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:23">Akataho omutima kuhurira eby'obunaku oburiija?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />N'oha owaahaireyo Yakobo kunyagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Kandi akahayo Israeli omu bambuzi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Ti MUKAMA ou twacumwireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Kandi ou bataraikiriize kugyendera mu mihanda ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">N'okworobera ebiragiro bye?<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 7:9">Hos 7:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo yaamushukiireho ekiniga kye ekirikwaka nk'omuriro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">N'engamba z'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">Kikamwotsya embaju zoona, kwonka atakimanye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">Kikamubabura, kwonka atakyeteho.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s1">Okucungurwa kw'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:14">Isa 41:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:3">45:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 45:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:28">Kut 32:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka hati MUKAMA owaakuhangire, iwe Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">Kandi akakubumba, iwe Israeli, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">Otatiina, ahabw'okuba nkakucungura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">Naakweta omu iziina, ori owangye.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 66:12">Zab 66:12</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 3:25">Dan 3:25</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 3:27">27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oriraba omu maizi, ndyaba nkwine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">Ku oriraba omu migyera, terikutwara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">Ku origyendera omu muriro, torisya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">N'ebirimi byagwo tibirikubabura.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:14">Isa 45:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">Orikwera wa Israeli, kandi Omujuni waawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">Nkahayo Misri kuba eky'okukucungura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">Esiopia na Seeba nkazihayo ahabwawe.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Ahabw'okuba okambeera enkora-mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">Waaba ow'okuheebwa ekitiinisa, naanye naakukunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">Nikyo ndiheerayo abantu ahabwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">N'amahanga ahabw'amagara gaawe.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:12">Isa 49:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:8">60:8</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:3">Zab 107:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:10">Yer 30:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 30:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otatiina, ahabw'okuba nkwine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:5">Ndyareeta oruzaaro rwawe, ndwihe oburugwa-izooba.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Ndyagambira obukiizi-bwa-bumosho nti: Barekure!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">N'obukiizi-bwa-buryo nti: Otabaanyima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">Ndeetera batabani bangye barugye hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">Na bahara bangye barugye aha muheru gw'ensi,<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />Buri muntu weena orikwetererwa eiziina ryangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:7">Ou naahangire kumpaisa ekitiinisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:7">Eego niinye naamuhangire, kandi niinye naamubumbire.<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:19">Isa 42:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Shohoza abantu abaine amaisho, kwonka bahumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:8">Kandi abaine amatu, kwonka gafiire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:8">K'amahanga goona gateeranire hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:8">Enganda zoona ziteerane.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:21">Isa 41:21</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 41:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho omuribo abaakubaasa kugamba eki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Bakatworeka ebyabaireho ira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Ka bareete baakareebi, basingye orubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Babone kuhurira, bagire bati: N'eky'amazima.<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:4">Isa 41:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:8">44:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Imwe n'omuheereza wangye ou naatooraine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Muri baakareebi b'okuhamya ebyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Ngu mubone kummanya, muunyikirize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Mwetegyereze ku ndi We.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Ntakabaireho, tihariho ruhanga orabaireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Kandi tihariho oribaho akankurata.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:21">Isa 45:21</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:4">Hos 13:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe nyenka, niinye MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:11">Kandi tihariho ondiijo mujuni kureka nyowe.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Niinye naarangire eby'okujunwa, nkabyoreka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Obwo hatariho ruhanga w'enduga-mahanga omuriimwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Nikyo mubeereire baakareebi bangye b'okukihamya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:27">Isa 14:27</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:12">Yob 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:2">Zab 90:2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:58">Yoh 8:58</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye MUKAMA, kandi okuruga hati</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:13">Niinyija kuguma ndi We.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:13">Kandi tihariho orikubaasa kwiha ekintu kyona omu mikono yangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:13">Niinyija kukora; n'oha orikubaasa kukizibira?<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:4">Isa 43:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:1">47:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA omucunguzi waanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">Orikwera wa Israeli naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">Ahabwanyu ndyatuma Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">Nshuumye abaayo boona bari empungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">Nibo Bakaludaaya, bahungye n'emeeri zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">Ezi baabaire nibeesiimira.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Ndi MUKAMA, Orikwera waanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:15">Omuhangi wa Israeli, kandi Mukama waanyu.<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:1-31">Kur 14:1-31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:19">Zab 77:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:10">Isa 51:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:16">Orabya omuhanda omu nyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:16">N'akahanda omu maizi maingi,<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:31">Isa 1:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 76:5">Zab 76:5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 76:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akashohoza ebigaari n'embaraasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:17">N'eihe ry'engabo, n'abarwani b'engamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:17">Babyama hamwe, tibabaasa kwimuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:17">Baraazibwa nk'oku baraaza orumuri;<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 16:14">Yer 16:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naagira ati: Ebya ira murekye kubiijuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:18">N'ebyahingwire, murekye kubyetaho.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:8">Isa 35:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:18">41:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:21">48:21</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:5">Kush 21:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, naaza kukora ekintu kisya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Hati kyaza kwatuka; timurikukireeba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Ndyarabya omuhanda omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">N'emigyera omu ihamba ry'omusheenyi.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa 49:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa, zaamuha na zaamaaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">Ziryampa ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">Ahabw'okuba nindeeta amaizi omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">N'emigyera omu ihamba ry'omusheenyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">Kunywaisa abantu bangye abatoorainwe,<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 79:13">Zab 79:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:1">105:1</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abu naayehangiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:21">Ngu bamanyise eby'okuhimbisibwa kwangye.<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />Kwonka, iwe Yakobo torantakiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:22">Iwe Israeli, okantamwa!<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:25">Amo 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:3">Mik 6:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Torandeeteire ntaama zaawe kuba empongano z'okwotsya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">Kandi tompaisize kitiinisa bitambo byawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">Tinkuhenzire n'emitoijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">N'obu kwakuba okukurusya n'obubaane bw'okuunyokyeza.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:20">Yer 6:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tonguriire bikoijo n'empiiha zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">Kandi tonyigutsize bishaju by'ebitambo byawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">Kureka ompenzire n'ebibi byawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">Wandusya n'eby'okutahikiirira byawe.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:22">Isa 44:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezk 36:25</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 36:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe, nyowe nyenka, niinye orikuragaza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:25">Ebicumuro byawe, nkakwesaasirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:25">Kandi ebibi byawe tindibiijuka.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:18">Isa 1:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyijutsya, tutongane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:26">Tongana ebyawe, obone kusinga.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:31">Yer 5:31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:3">Ezk 16:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Shwenkuru ow'okubanza akashiisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:27">N'abatonganizi baawe bancumuraho,<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 24:9">Yer 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:2">Tonz 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo naagayisiize abakuru b'Omwanya Ogurikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:28">Nkagira Yakobo ekijumo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:28">Na Israeli eky'okukyeenwa.<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Okuragaanisa Omwoyo Orikwera</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:1">Isa 49:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka hati mbwenu, Yakobo omwiru wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:1">Iwe Israeli ou naatooraine, hurira!<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:15">Bir 32:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 1:5">Yer 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:15">Gal 1:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA owaakuhangire, akakworora okwiha obu waazarwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:2">Kandi origuma naakuhwera, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:2">Otatiina, iwe Yakobo omwiru wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:2">Yeshuruuni ou naatooraine,<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:6">Isa 35:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:28">Yoel 2:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ndyashuka amaizi aha nsi ekarangataine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">N'emigyera aha itaka ryomire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">Ndyashuka Omwoyo wangye aha ruzaaro rwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">Na baijukuru baawe mbahe omugisha.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:3">Zab 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryamera nk'emikinga y'aha mugyera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:4">Oku emera omu bunyaatsi.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:1">Isa 14:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwe aryagira ati: Ndi owa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">Ondi ayeyeterere Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">N'ondiijo ayehandiikire n'omukono gwe ku ari owa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">Ayekubye Israeli.<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />MUKAMA, Mukama wa Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">MUKAMA ow'amahe omucunguzi we, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">Ndi ow'okubanza kandi ow'aha muheru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">Tihariho Ruhanga ondiijo kureka nyowe.<verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:4">Isa 41:4</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 41:26">26</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 41:27">27</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha orikushushana naanye? Naakigambe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">Akirangye, akyorekye omu maisho gangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">Abaarangire ira ebirikwenda kwija nibaahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">Nibatugambire ebirikwija kubaho.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:35">Bir 4:35</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 4:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:39">32:39</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:27">Yoel 2:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutatiina, kandi mutahahaaza omutima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Tiinye naabagambiire okuruga ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Nkabibamanyisa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Naimwe muri baakareebi bangye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Hariho Ruhanga ondiijo okwihaho nyowe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Tihariho Rukiri ondiijo; tiinyine ondiijo weena ou ndikumanya.<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku ebishushani ebirikuramibwa bitaine mugasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:29">Isa 30:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:24">41:24</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 41:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abakora ebishushani ebirikuramibwa boona ni busha; n'ebintu ebi barikwesiimira tibiine mugasho; abarikubiramya tibarikureeba, tibaine ki barikumanya, kandi aha muheru baryaitwa enshoni. <verse eid="ISA 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:18">Hab 2:18</ref>. </char></note> N'oha orabaizire ekishushani kya ruhanga, nari oraheesire ekishushani ekiyagiibwe ekitaine mugasho? <verse eid="ISA 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:5-8">Zab 115:5-8</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, bagyenzi be boona baryakwatwa enshoni, ahabw'okuba abanyamyoga baabyo n'abantu-buntu; ka boona bateeranire hamwe, beemerere; haza oreebe ku baitwa obwoba, enshoni zikababumbira hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Omuheesi akijugutirira omu makara, bwanyima akiteeza enyondo, akiheeshesa omukono gwe gw'amaani; kwonka ku agira enjara, ahwamu amaani; ku abura amaizi, agwa enshazi. <verse eid="ISA 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Omubaizi areega omugoye, aharaatuzaho ekaraamu akibaija n'embaijo, akigyeresamu ekyoma ekirikugyera, akishushanisa n'omuntu, kigira oburungi nk'obw'omuntu, kiguma omu nju. <verse eid="ISA 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />Atema emyereezi, nari atooranamu omuzo nari omwela, agureka gukurira omu miti y'omu kibira; kandi abyara omuberooshi, enjura egwitirira. <verse eid="ISA 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Bwanyima gurugamu enku z'abantu; omuntu aihaho omuganda, agwota; ahemba omuriro, ateeka eby'okurya; kandi agubaijamu ekishushani kya ruhanga, akiramya, akihindura ekishushani ekirikuramibwa, akijuumara omu maisho. <verse eid="ISA 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Empimbi yaagwo agihemba; endiijo agyokyesa enyama, agirya, ahaaga; kandi ogwo muriro agaruka agwota, agira ati: Ayaayaaya, eshi naabona akariro, naahwa embeho! <verse eid="ISA 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Bwanyima empimbi eyatsigaraho agibaijamu ruhanga we, nikyo kishushani kye ekibaizirwe, akijuumara omu maisho, akiramya, akishaba ati: Nkiza; ahabw'okuba ori ruhanga wangye.<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Tibaine ki barikumanya; kandi tibagira ki bateekateeka; ahakuba akabahumya amaisho, tibarikubaasa kureeba, yaabaita omutima, tibarikubaasa kwetegyereza. <verse eid="ISA 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:15">Bir 27:15</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho orikuteekateeka, tihariho orikumanya nari orikwetegyereza, akagira ati: Ekicweka kyagwo nkihembire, amakara gaakyo naagateekyesa omugaati, naayootsyaho enyama, naagirya; mbwenu ekitsigaireho nkihindure ekirikuzira, njuumare omu maisho g'empimbi y'ekiti, ngiramye? <verse eid="ISA 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:12">Yob 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 144:8">Zab 144:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:25">Rom 1:25</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ogwo arya eiju, ahabisiibwe omutima ogurikwebeiha; tarikubaasa kwejuna nari okugira ati: Eki nyine omu mukono gwangye gwa buryo, ti ky'ebishuba?<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okushemererwa kw'abasaasiirwe ebibi byabo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:25">Isa 43:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Yakobo, kandi Israeli, ijuka ebyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">Ahabw'okuba ori omwiru wangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">Niinye naakuhangire; ori omwiru wangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">Buzimazima Israeli, tindikwebwa.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Nkwerwireho ebicumuro byawe nk'ekicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">N'ebibi byawe nk'oruho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">Ngarukira, ahabw'okuba nkakucungura.<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:13">Isa 49:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:12">55:12</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:21">Hos 2:21</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 2:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe iguru 'we, yeshongore;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA niwe yaakikozire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Iwe Okuzimu, gamba munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Imwe enshozi, muteere akaari, mweshongore;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Naiwe Kibira 'we, n'emiti yoona erimu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Ahakuba MUKAMA acungwire Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Kandi aryaheebwa ekitiinisa omuri Israeli.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />MUKAMA Omucunguzi waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Owaakworoire okwiha obu waazaarwa, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Niinye MUKAMA, owaahangire ebintu byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Nkabamba eiguru nyenka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Nkashashaanura ensi. N'oha ou naabaire nyine?<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:3">Isa 19:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye ohindura busha okuragura kw'abanyabishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">N'abafumu nkabahindura abashema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">Nkagarura enyima abanyabwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">Okumanya kwabo nkakuhindura obushema.<verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:22">2 Bus 36:22</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:15">Yer 32:15</ref>, <ref loc="JER 32:44">44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye ohamya ekigambo ky'omuheereza wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">Nkahikiiriza enaama y'entumwa zangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">Nkagamba ahari Yerusaalemu nti: Eryatuurwamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">N'endembo z'omuri Yuda nti: Ziryayombekwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">Kandi ndyagaruraho emyanya yaamwo eyaahindukire amatongo.<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:10">Isa 51:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye ogambira amaizi maingi nti: Yoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:27">Kandi ndyayomya emigyera yaawe;<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 5:2">2 Sam 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:1-3">Ezr 1:1-3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikugamba ahari Kuuro nti: N'omuriisa wangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">Aryahikiiriza ebi ndikwenda byona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">N'ahari Yerusaalemu nti: Eryayombekwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">N'ahari hekalu nti: Omusingi gwawe guryateebwaho.<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Kuuro n'okugaruka kw'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:13">Isa 41:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:5">45:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:21">Yob 12:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo nyowe, MUKAMA, ndikugambira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Ou naashukireho amajuta, Kuuro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Ou naakwatsire omukono gwa buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Ngu mmugomoorere amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Nzirikuurure abagabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Mmwigurire enyigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">Amarembo garekye kukingwa;<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:4">Isa 40:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:16">Zab 107:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ningira nti: Ndyakwebembera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">Ahataringaniire mparingaanize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">Ndyahendagura enyigi z'emiringa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">N'empimbi z'ebyoma nzihirimburemu kabiri.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:13">Yer 51:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakuha obutungi oburi omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">N'ebintu ebibiikirwe omu myanya y'omu mubonano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">Obone kumanya ku niinye MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">Ruhanga wa Israeli, okwetsire omu iziina.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:1">Isa 43:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">62:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'omwiru wangye Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">Israeli ou naatooraine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">Nkwetsire omu iziina, naakukubya ekikubyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">N'obu oraabe otakammanyaga.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />Niinye MUKAMA, tihariho ondiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:5">Kandi tihariho Ruhanga ondiijo, kureka nyowe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:5">Ndyaguma nkuzirikye, n'obu oraabe otakammanyaga,<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 37:20">Isa 37:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:11">Mal 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu b'oburugwa-izooba n'oburengyerwa-izooba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:6">Babone kumanya ku hatariho ondiijo, okwihaho nyowe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:6">Niinye MUKAMA, tihariho ondiijo.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:23">Isa 41:23</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:6">Amo 3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye ntaho omushana, nkahanga omwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:7">Nkareeta obusingye n'enaku;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:7">Niinye MUKAMA okora ebyo byona.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 85:11">Zab 85:11</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:12">Hos 10:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe iguru 'we, toonyerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">N'akaabunga kashukye okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">Ensi eigukye, okujunwa kushohore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">Kandi kumeremu okuhikiirira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">Nyowe MUKAMA, niinye owaabihangire.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:15">Isa 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 64:8">64:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:20">Rom 9:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikuhakanisa Omuhangi we aryakareeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Haza nawe ari orugusyo omu zindi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Nimugira ngu eibumba rikaabuuza orikuribumba riti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Nombumbamu ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Nari eki arikukora kimugira kiti: Toine ngaro?<verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Aryakareeba orikubuuza ishe ati: Noozaara ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:10">Akagaruka akabuuza nyina ati: Noorumwa ki?<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:23">Isa 41:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 64:8">64:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Orikwera wa Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">Kandi Omuhangi we arikugira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">Mukambuurize eby'abaana bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">Nari mundagiira oku ndatwaze ebi ndikukora n'emikono yangye?<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:2">Kut 41:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:5">Yer 27:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkakora ensi, naagihangamu omuntu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:12">Emikono yangye niyo yaabambire eiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:12">N'amahe gaaryo goona nkagategyeka.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Nyimukize Kuuro omu kuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Kandi ndyagorora emihanda ye yoona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Aryayombeka orurembo rwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Arekure abantu bangye abaanyagirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Ataguririirwe, n'obu kwakuba okuheebwa ebihembo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:2">Isa 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:3">43:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Abatungi ba Misri n'abashuubuzi ba Esiopia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">N'aba Seeba, abashaija baraingwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Baryaija ahariiwe, babe abaawe, bakukuratire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Baryaija omu njegyere, bakwinamire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Bakweshengyereze nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Ruhanga ari hamwe naiwe wenka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Tihariho Ruhanga ondiijo kureka We.<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Ai Ruhanga wa Israeli, Omujuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:15">Buzimazima ori Ruhanga orikweshereka.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Abarikukora ebishushani boona baryaitwa enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:16">Bashoberwe, baburaburirirwe hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:4">Isa 54:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Abaisraeli baryajunwa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:17">Batungye okujunwa okutahwaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:17">Timuriitwa nshoni, kandi timurishoberwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:17">Okuhitsya ryari na ryari.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:2">Kut 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:16">Zab 115:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Owaahangire eiguru, (niwe Ruhanga)</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Akahanga ensi, akagibumburika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Kandi akagihamya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">(Taragihangire etari mu buteeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Kureka akagihanga kutuurwamu.)</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Naagira ati: Niinye MUKAMA; tihariho ondiijo.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:16">Isa 48:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:11">Bir 30:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tinkagambiraga mu mubonano</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Omu nsi y'omwirima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Tinkagiraga ruzaaro rwa Yakobo nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Munsherurire busha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Nyowe MUKAMA ngamba amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Ndanga ebihikire.<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:1">Isa 41:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:17">44:17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 44:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:1-7">46:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:5">Yer 10:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe ab'amahanga abahonokireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Mweteerane, mwije,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Mwirire haihi hamwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Abagyenda n'ebishushani byabo by'ebiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Bakaguma nibashaba ruhanga otarikubaasa kujuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Tibaine bwengye.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:22">Isa 41:22</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 41:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:9">43:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mureete ebyanyu, mubitongane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Ka bahanuure hamwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">N'oha owaakyorekire obutakimanywa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">N'oha owaakirangire omu biro bya ira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Tiinye MUKAMA?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Kandi tihariho ruhanga ondiijo kureka nyowe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Ruhanga ohikiriire, kandi Omujuni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Tihariho ondiijo weena, kureka nyowe.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:12">Isa 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:5">43:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe mwena abari aha mperu z'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:22">Mundeebe, mujunwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:22">Ahakuba niinye Ruhanga, tihariho ondiijo.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:16">Kut 22:16</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 14:11">Rom 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:10">Fil 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinyerahira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">Ekigambo kirugire omu kanwa kangye omu kuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">Kandi tikirifa busha; nindahira nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">Abantu boona baryantsimbira amaju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">Na buri rurimi rube niinye rwarahira.<verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:4">Isa 26:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:11">41:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:8">44:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryangambaho bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Omuri MUKAMA wenka nimwo okuhikiirira n'amaani biri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Abaamugiriire ekiniga boona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Baryaija ah'ari, bakwatwe enshoni.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Omuri MUKAMA nimwo oruzaaro rwa Israeli rwona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:25">Rurisingurira, rukeesiima.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s1">Okugyeragyeranisa Ruhanga na baaruhanga ba Babulooni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isa 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:2">Yer 50:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beeli nainama, Neebo naabandama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">Ebishushani byabo byekoreirwe enyamaishwa n'amatungo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">Ebintu ebi mwekorera bihindukire emitwaro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">Erikwekorezibwa enyamaishwa eziruhire.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Nibainama, nibabandamira hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:2">Tibarikubaasa kwihaho egyo mitwaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:2">Kureka nayo yaatwarwa omu bukwatwa.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 1:35">Bir 1:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe nju ya Yakobo 'we, ntega okutu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">Naimwe ab'enju ya Israeli abaahonokireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">Abu ntuura mpeekire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">Okwiha obu mwaruga omunda mukazaarwa,<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 71:18">Zab 71:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukahika n'omu bugurusi, nkiba We;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">Kandi muryarugaho mumere enju nkibaheekire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">Niinye naahangire, kandi niinye ndiheeka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">Ndyaheeka, kandi njune.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />Mukaanshushanisa n'oha, ou mwakuunyinganisa nawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:5">Mukangyeragyeranisa nawe, tukashushana?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Abafukunkura ezaabu omu nshaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">Bakapima efeeza aha minzaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">Baguriirira omuheesi w'ezaabu, aziheeshamu ruhanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">Batyo bajuumara omu maisho g'ekyo kishushani, bakiramya!<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:7">Zab 115:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bakita aha mabega, bakiheeka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Bakita omu mwanya gwakyo, kyemereramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Tikibaasa kugurugamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Omuntu ku akitakira, tikimugarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">N'obu kwakuba okumujuna omu kabi.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />Imwe abarikucumura, mwijukye ebyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:8">Mweyorekye ku muri abashaija; mugarukye mubiteekateekyeho.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Mwijukye ebyabandize kubaho ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:9">Ahakuba niinye Ruhanga, tihariho ondiijo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:9">Niinye Ruhanga; tihariho orikushushana naanye,<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:11">Zab 33:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 6:17">Heb 6:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwiha aha kutandika nkaranga eby'emperu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Naiha omu biro bya ira, nindanga ebitakabaireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Ningira nti: Enaama yangye eryahama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Mpikiirize ebi naamaririire kukora byona.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:2">Isa 41:2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 23:19">Kub 23:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyayeta empungu, erugye oburugwa-izooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">Omushaija oine enaama zangye arugye omu nsi ya hare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">Nkakigamba, kandi ndyakihikiiriza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">Nkakimariirira, kandi ndyakukora.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Mumpurire, imwe abaine emitima egangaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:12">Abari hare n'okuhikiirira;<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 56:1">Isa 56:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 85:9">Zab 85:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:32">Yoel 2:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nairiza haihi okuhikiirira kwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">Tikuri hare munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">N'okujuna kwangye tikurituurayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">Ndyakuta omuri Saayuuni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">Ahabwa Israeli ekitiinisa kyangye.<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Ebifubiro bya Babulooni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 3:26">Isa 3:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:14">48:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 137:8">Zab 137:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Babulooni oshugaine, Shuuma, oshutame omu mucuucu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Iwe Bukaludaaya 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Shutama ahansi, otakiri ha kitebe ky'obugabe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Ahabw'okuba torigaruka kwetwa ojarami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Nari ogwirwe gye.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 20:4">Isa 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 16:21">Bar 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:41">Mat 24:41</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwata eseiso, ose;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">Oyeshuuruure ahamaisho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">Hinyirira ekiteetei kyawe, oyeshuuruure amaguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">Orabe omu migyera, oyambukye.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Enjuuro yaawe eryareebwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">N'enshoni zaawe ziryareebwa butunu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">Ndyahoora enzigu, tindisaasira muntu n'omwe.<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Omucunguzi waitu, eiziina rye ni MUKAMA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:4">Orikwera wa Israeli.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:14">Yer 8:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Bukaludaaya 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">Shutama ohuname, oze omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">Ahabw'okuba torigaruka kwetwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">Omugabekazi w'ensi z'abagabe.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:17">Isa 14:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:23">51:23</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:15">Zek 1:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkagwerwa kubi abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">Naagayisa obuhunguzi bwangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">Naabahayo omu mikono yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">Tiwaabasaasira na kakye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">Abagurusi waabakorera omutwaro guremeire munonga;<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Waagira oti: Ndyaba omugabekazi ebiro byona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:7">Ebyo tiwaabyetaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:7">Kandi tiwaijuka bugarukiro bwabyo.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:19">Isa 51:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:29">Yer 50:29</ref>, <ref loc="JER 50:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:1">Tonz 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:15">Zef 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:7">Kush 18:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo hurira ebi, iwe oyehaireyo kukora eby'okweshemeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">Okashutama otaine ki oyetaireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">Okagira omu mutima gwawe oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">Niinye ndiho, tihariho ondiijo okwihaho nyowe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">Tindiba mufaakazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">Kadi tindifiisa baana.<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NAM 3:4">Nah 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka eizooba rimwe ebyo byombi biryakuhikaho kitaraariire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">Okufiisa abaana n'obufaakazi biryakugwaho bitatuubiibweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">N'obu oburogi bwawe buraabe buri bwingi buta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">N'okubandwa kwawe kurengyesereize munonga.<verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />Ahabw'okuba oyesigire obugomi bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">Waagira oti: Tihariho ori kundeeba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">Obwengye bwawe n'okumanya kwawe nibyo bikuhabize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">Okagira omu mutima gwawe oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">Niinye ndiho; tihariho ondiijo okwihaho nyowe.<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:41">Yer 51:41</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka oryahikwaho akabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">Aku otarikubaasa kuzibira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">Oryagwerwa akagwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">Aku otaribaasa kweihaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">N'okucwekyerera oku otakamanyaga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">Kuryakuhikaho kitaraariire.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />Mbwenu gumira aha kubandwa kwawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">N'oburogo bwawe oburengyesereize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">Ebi waafeereire kubi okwiha omu buto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">Obundi nyentsya biryagira eki byakugasira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">Oitse abantu obwoba.<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:25">Isa 44:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 2:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enaama zaawe nyingi zikuruhize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">K'abantu abaragura eby'eiguru n'enyonyoozi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">N'eby'okuboneka kw'ameezi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">Baimukye, bakujune ebirikubaho.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:17">Isa 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:1">Mal 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, baryaba nk'ebitsintsi by'embuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Omuriro guryabootsya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Tibaryeiha mu maani g'okubuguma kwagwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Ogwo muriro tiguriba makara g'okwota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">N'obu kwakuba okushutamwaho!<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Okwo nikwo abo abu waabaire ofa kubi nabo barikubeera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">Abaabaire baashuubura naiwe okwiha omu butsigazi bwawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">Baryayegyendera, buri omwe atoore omuhanda gwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">Obure ow'okukujuna.<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okwendeza Abaisraeli okujunwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:9">Yer 7:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhurire ebi, imwe ab'enju ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Imwe abarikwetererwa eiziina rya Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Abaakomookire omunda ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Abarahira eiziina rya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Bakagamba ku bari aba Ruhanga wa Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">Kwonka batarikukikora mu mazima nari omu buryo.<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 3:11">Mik 3:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo bwona nibeeyeterera orurembo orurikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:2">Nibeegamira Ruhanga wa Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:2">Ou eiziina rye riri MUKAMA ow'amahe.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />Ebya ira nkabiranga obutakimanywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:3">Byaruga omu kanwa kangye, naabimanyisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:3">Naabikora ahonaaho, byabaho.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:9">Kur 32:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaba nimmanya ku ori engangaazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:4">N'ebitsya byawe ku biri nk'omutsi gw'ekyoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:4">N'aha buso bwawe ku hari nk'omuringa.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 44:15-17">Yer 44:15-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkabikurangira ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">Naabikumanyisa bitakabaireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">Ngu otakaagira oti: Ekishushani kyangye ekirikuramibwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">Nikyo kibikozire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">Ekishushani kyangye ekibaizire kandi n'ekiheesire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">Nibyo bibiragiire.<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />Okakihurira; mbwenu reeba ebi byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">Torikwija kubimanyisa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">Okwiha hati niinyija kukuhuriza ebigambo bisya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">Ebisherekirwe, ebi otakamanyaga.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Byahangwa hati, ti bya ira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">Okuhitsya eri izooba tokabihurirahoga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">Ngu otakaagira oti: Nkaba nimbimanya.<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Tokahuriraga, tokamanyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Okwiha ira okutu kwawe kukaba kutakaigukaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Ahabw'okuba nkamanya ngu noija kuba endeebya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Kandi okwiha obu waazaarwa okeetwa omugomi.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:6">Mal 3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'eiziina ryangye naaza kuba ndekire kukugirira ekiniga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:9">Ahabw'okuhimbisibwa kwangye naaza kukugumisiririza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:9">Ndekye kukwihiraho kimwe.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Bir 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:18">Ezk 22:18</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 22:20">20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 22:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:7">1 Pet 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nkushemeize, kwonka ti nk'efeeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:10">Nkugyereize omu iziiko ry'okubonabonesibwa.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:25">Isa 43:25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:9">Ezk 20:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe ahabwangye, nyowe nyenka ndyakikora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:11">Mbwenu eiziina ryangye rijumirwe ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:11">Ekitiinisa kyangye tindikiha ondiijo.<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />Mpurira, iwe Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:12">Kandi Israeli, ou naayetsire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:12">Niinye We; ndi ow'okubanza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:12">Kandi ow'aha muheru.<verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:26">Isa 40:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:25">Zab 102:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omukono gwangye nigwo gwataireho omusingi gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">Omukono gwangye gwa buryo nigwo gwabambire eiguru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">Ku mbyeta, byemerera hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />Imwe mwena, muteeranire hamwe, muhurire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">N'oha omuribo orarangire ebyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">Ogwo muntu MUKAMA naamukunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">Kandi aryagira Babulooni nk'oku MUKAMA arikwenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">N'omukono gwe guryarwanisa Abakaludaaya.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:1-3">Isa 45:1-3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe ahabwangye nkakigamba, naamweta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:15">Kandi mmureetsire; aryaba gye omu rugyendo rwe.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:19">Isa 45:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mumpikye haihi, muhurire ebi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Okuruga aha kutandika tinkagambaga mu mubonano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Okwiha byaba kubaho ntuurayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Mbwenu hati Mukama RUHANGA antumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Yantuma n'Omwoyo we.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA Omucunguzi waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">Orikwera wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">Orikukwegyesa eby'okukugasira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">Nkakwebembera omu muhanda ogu oshemereire kutoora.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:12">Isa 66:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:29">Bir 32:29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 81:13">Zab 81:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:42">Luk 19:42</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nangwa kuri waayorobeire ebiragiro byangye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:18">Obwo obusingye bwawe bukaabaire nk'omugyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:18">N'okuhikiirira kwawe kuba nk'ebingonzi by'enyanja;<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:17">Kut 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oruzaaro rwawe rukaabaire nk'omusheenyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">Na baijukuru baawe baba nk'omucuucu gwagwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">Eiziina ryabo tiryakwihirweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">N'obu kwakuba okumarwaho omu maisho gangye.<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:10">Isa 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:9">52:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 52:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:8">Yer 50:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:6">51:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:45">45</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mushohore, murugye Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Muhungye, murugye omu Bakaludaaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Mukirangye, nimuteera akaari k'okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Mukimanyise, mukibuzye, kihikye aha muheru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Nimugira muti: MUKAMA acungwire omwiru we Yakobo!<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:6">Kur 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:15">Bir 8:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabeebembeire naabarabya omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">Tibaragizire iriho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">Akabaihira amaizi omu rukiri, gaahimintika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">Yaayata orwo rukiri, amaizi gaayerekyera.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />Aha mubi tihabaho busingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:22">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo Omucunguzi w'Abaisraeli n'agandi mahanga goona</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:2">Isa 44:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe birwa 'mwe, mumpurire, Naimwe amahanga agarugire hare, mutegye amatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">MUKAMA akaanyeta ntakazairwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">Yaanyeta eiziina nkiri omunda ya maawe.<verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:16">51:16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:4">Heb 12:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:16">Kush 1:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akanwa kangye yaakagira nka rurara y'obwogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">Yanshereka omu kicuucu ky'omukono gwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">Yambiika omu mutana gwe;<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:23">Isa 44:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yangira ati: Ori omwiru wangye, Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:3">Omuriiwe nimwo ndiheerwa ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:4-8">Isa 50:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:23">65:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka naagira nti: Nkahendekyera busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">Amaani gangye gaafa busha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">Kwonka ebyangye MUKAMA niwe arikubimanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">Kandi Ruhanga wangye niwe arinzimuurira.<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:13">Isa 52:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi hati, oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Owampindwire omuheereza we, ninkiruga omunda ya maawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Ngu mmugarurire Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Abaisraeli babone kumuteeraniraho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Ahabw'okuba ndi ow'ekitiinisa omu maisho ga MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Kandi Ruhanga wangye ahindukire amaani gangye<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:3">Zab 98:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:47">Byak 13:47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">Okuba omuheereza wangye ow'okwimutsya enganda za Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">N'okugarura Abaisraeli abaahonokireho, n'ekintu kikye munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">Kureka ndyakugira omu shana gw'okujwera amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">Okujuna kwangye kubone kuhika aha muheru gw'ensi.<verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:6">Isa 50:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 50:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:3">53:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Omucunguzi wa Israeli kandi Orikwera we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Ou amahanga garikugaya, gakatamirwa kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Omuheereza w'abategyeki, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Abagabe baryakureeba, baimukye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Hamwe n'abanyiginya, baramye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Ahabwa MUKAMA orikwesigwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Orikwera wa Israeli owaakutooraine.<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 42:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:4">61:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:13">Zab 69:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:2">2 Kor 6:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">Omu bunaku bw'okwikiririzibwamu nkakugarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">N'aha izooba ry'okujunirwaho naakuhwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">Ndyakurinda, nkuteho kuba endagaano y'abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">Obone kuhamya ensi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">N'okubaganisa obuhunguzi obwatsigirweho,<verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />Okugambira embohe oti: Mushohore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">N'abari omu mwirima oti: Mweyorekye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">Baryariira omu mihanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">N'aha mitwe y'enshozi zoona ez'emparamaata</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">Habe amariisizo gaabo;<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:4">Isa 40:4</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:16">Kush 7:16</ref>, <ref loc="REV 7:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tibarigira njara nari eiriho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">N'obu kwakuba okwokibwa ekibabo ky'eizooba nari omushana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">Ahabw'okuba Ogwo obainiire esaasi aryabeebembera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">Abahitsye aha nshuro z'amaizi.<verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Kandi enshozi zangye zoona ndyazigira omuhanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:11">N'emihanda yaangye rugyendwa eryatunguurwa.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:3">Zab 107:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, aba baryaruga hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:12">Bariya barugye aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:12">N'obw'oburengyerwa-izooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:12">N'abandi barugye omu nsi ya Sinimu.<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:1">Isa 40:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe iguru we, yeshongore; naiwe nsi 'we, yesiime;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Naimwe nshozi mwe, muteere akaari, mweshongore!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ahuumuriize abantu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Kandi abantu be abarikubonabonesibwa aryabagirira esaasi.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:27">Isa 40:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:6">54:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Saayuuni agizire ati: MUKAMA antsigireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:14">Mukama wangye anyebirwe.<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:10">Zab 27:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omukazi naabaasa kwebwa omwana we ou arikwontsya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">Abure kugirira esaasi omwana orugire omunda ye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">Nangwa bo bakaabaasa kwebwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">Kwonka nyowe tindikwebwa.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="SNG 8:6">Kyesh 8:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nkusharwire aha biganja by'engaro zangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:16">Orugo rwawe ruryaguma omu maisho gangye obutoosha.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Abombeki baawe nibarahutsya kukwombeka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:17">Kandi abacwekyerezi baawe n'abaakugizire amatongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:17">Nibaija kukurugamu.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:4">Isa 60:4</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:21">Kub 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:12">Yer 43:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imutsya amaisho gaawe, oreebe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Bariya boona nibeeteerana kwija ahariiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Niinyerahira, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Boona oryabajwara nk'eihunde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Obeezirikye, obe nk'omugore.<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 10:10">Zek 10:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima emyanya yaawe ey'amatongo n'eyaatsigirweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">N'ensi yaawe eyaacwekyereziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">Eryafundira abatuuzi baawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">Kandi abaakumizire baryaba hare.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa 54:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaana abaazairwe omu biro by'okufiisa kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">Baryakugambira omu kutu nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">Omwanya ogu gutufundiire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">Tubonere omwanya gw'okutuuramu.<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Obwo oryagira omu mutima gwawe oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Aba baana, n'oha owaabanzaariire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Ka naafiisize abangye, nkaba engumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Encuubwa kandi ekizengyerezi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Mbwenu owaayoroire aba n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Ka naatsigaire nyenka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Mbwenu aba barugire hi?<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:12">Isa 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:2">14:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">Reeba, ndyaimukiza amahanga omukono gwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">N'enganda nzeetese orurango rwangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">Obwo baryareeta batabani baawe, babaine omu kifuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">Na bahara baawe babaheekire aha mabega.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:31">Isa 40:31</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:3">60:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:14">14</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:3">Zab 25:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:9">72:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abagabe baryaba baasho bakworore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">N'abaigarire babe baanyoko bakwontsye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Baryakwinamira, bajuumare ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Barigatse omucuucu gw'aha bigyere byawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Obwo nibwo orimanya ku ndi MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Kandi abarikuntegyereza tibarikwatwa nshoni.<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Ab'amaani nibabaasa kwakwa eminyago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:24">Nari enkwatwa z'abarikuhatwa kwihwa omu mikono yaabo?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 11:21">Luk 11:21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">Buzimazima enkwatwa z'ab'amaani ziryaihwayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">N'eminyago y'abarikuhata eryagarurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">Ahabw'okuba niinye ndikurwanira n'abarikukurwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">Nkajuna n'abaana baawe.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 16:6">Kush 16:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarikukuhata ndyabagyema kurya enyama yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Kandi baryasinda eshagama yaabo nk'oku basinda viinyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Batyo abantu boona baryamanya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Ku ndi MUKAMA omujuni waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Kandi Omucunguzi waawe, Ow'amaani wa Yakobo.<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'obusaasi bwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:4">Bir 21:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:1">2 Bag 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:8">Yer 3:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:2">Hos 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:25">Mat 18:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Ebaruha ei naashendeise nyokoimwe erahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Nari shi n'oha omu barikuunyihuza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Ou naabagurize?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Reeba, mukagurwa ahabw'ebibi byanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">N'ebicumuro byanyu nibyo byashendeise nyokoimwe.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:1">Isa 59:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:18">Kur 7:18</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 7:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 11:23">Kub 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:16">Yos 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:7">Zab 104:7</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:4">Nah 1:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki, obu naija, ntarashangireyo muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Ku naayetsire, hataragizire owaanyetaba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Nimugira ngu omukono gwangye gubaire mugufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Tigurikubaasa kucungura?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Tiinyine maani g'okujuna?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Reeba, ahabw'okukabuka kwangye, nyomya enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Mpindura emigyera eihamba ry'omusheenyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Eby'enyanja binuuka ahabw'okubura amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Kandi bifa ahabw'eiriho.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 6:12">Kush 6:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eiguru ndijweka okwiragura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:3">Ndishweka ebiguniya.<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 4:11">Kur 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:23">Enf 15:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:28">Mat 11:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukama RUHANGA ampaire orurimi rw'abeegyesiibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">Ngu mbone kumanya ekigambo eki ndaahangaanise oruhire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">Buri kasheeshe ansisiimura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">Asisiimura okutu kwangye kuhurira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">Nk'abarikwegyesibwa.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Zab 40:6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:31">Yoh 14:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukama RUHANGA aigwire okutu kwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:5">Tinaagoma, kandi tinaagaruka nyima.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mat 26:67</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:26">27:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amabega gangye ngateegyeize abateezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:6">N'amatama gangye naagaha abarikumaanyura ebireju;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:6">Tindasherekire maisho gangye enshoni n'okucwerwa amacwante.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 3:8">Ezk 3:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 3:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba Mukama RUHANGA ampwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">Nikyo ntarikushobererwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">N'ahabw'ekyo ngumize aha maisho gangye nk'eibaare ry'enkangabuye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">Kandi nimmanya ngu tindikwatwa nshoni.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:33">Rom 8:33</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 8:34">34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikuunyihaho orubanja ari haihi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">N'oha orintonganisa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Ka twemerere, tutongane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Omuzigu wangye n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Naanyirire haihi.<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Reeba, Mukama RUHANGA nampwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">N'oha oricwa orubanja kunsinga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">Reeba, boona baryakura nk'ekijwaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">Ebiyenje bibariire kimwe.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:16">Isa 42:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:2">49:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:8">Mik 7:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha omuriimwe orikutiina MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Akoorobera eiraka ry'omuheereza we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Orikugyendera omu mwirima, ataine mushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Kwonka akeesiga eiziina rya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Akeegamira Ruhanga we?<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Reeba, imwe mwena abarikuhemba omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Mukeekiikiza emuri embaju zoona!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Mugyende nimumurikirwa omuriro gwanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">N'ogw'emuri zi mukongyerize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Ebi nibyo mbacumiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Muryabyama n'obusaasi.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okuhuumuriza Saayuuni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />Mumpurire, imwe abarikukuratira okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">Imwe abarikusherura MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">Mureebe orukiri oru mwashatwirweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">N'ekiina ky'amabaare eki mwatimbirwemu.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 33:24">Ezk 33:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mureebe Abrahamu shoimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">Na Saara owaabazaire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">Ahakuba, ku yaabaire akiri omwe wenka, nkamweta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">Naamuha omugisha, naamukanyisa.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:10">Isa 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:8">Kut 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:10">13:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aryahuumuriza Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">N'emyanya yaayo yoona eyaatsigirweho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">Eihamba ryayo aryarihindura nka Edeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">N'eihamba ryayo ry'omusheenyi arigire nk'omusiri gwa MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">Haryabamu okushemererwa n'okunanuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">Okusiima n'amaraka g'okweshongora.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:3">Isa 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:1">Zab 78:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe bantu bangye 'mwe, nimumpurire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">Naiwe ihanga ryangye 'we, ntega okutu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">Ahakuba ndyashohoza ekiragiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">N'eby'oburyo byangye biryaba omushana gw'okujwera amahanga.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 46:13">Isa 46:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuhikiirira kwangye kuri haihi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">N'okujuna kwangye kushohoire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">Emikono yangye eryategyeka amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">Ebirwa biryantegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">Kandi omukono gwangye nigwo baryesiga.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:35">Mat 24:35</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2 Pet 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Kush 21:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwimutsye amaisho ahaiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Mureebe ensi ahansi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Ahabw'okuba iguru riryahwaho nk'omwika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">N'ensi eryakura nk'ekijwaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">N'abagitwiremu bafe nka mukwikwi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Kwonka okujuna kwangye kuryagumaho ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">N'okuhikiirira kwangye tikurihwaho.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:31">Zab 37:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:28">Mat 10:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mumpurire, imwe abarikumanya okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">Abantu abu ebiragiro byangye biri omu mitima yaanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">Murekye kutiina okujuma kw'abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">Kandi mutahahaaza emitima ahabw'okukyeena kwabo.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Ahabw'okuba ebiyenje biryabarya nk'ekijwaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">Na kooya ebarye nk'ebyoya by'entaama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">Kwonka okuhikiirira kwangye kuryagumaho ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">N'okujuna kwangye obusingye bwona.<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 27:1">Isa 27:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:7">30:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:1">52:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:1">Zab 44:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:10">89:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 93:1">93:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:3">Ezk 29:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:51">Luk 1:51</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sisiimuka, sisiimuka, ojware amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Iwe omukono gwa MUKAMA!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Sisiimuka nk'omu biro bya ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Omu busingye obwa iranaira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Tiiwe waatemagwire Rahabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Okacumita ekijoka kiri?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21">Kur 14:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tiiwe waayomize enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:10">Amaizi maingi ag'ahagati yaayo gakarugaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:10">Okagicwamu omuhanda, ngu abacungwirwe barabemu?<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Kandi abu MUKAMA yaacungwire baryagaruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">Baije Saayuuni nibeeshongora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">Okushemererwa okutahwaho kuri aha maisho gaabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">Baryagira okushemererwa n'okunanuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">Kandi obusaasi n'okutsinda biryakwata akakiro.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:1">Isa 40:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:13">66:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:6">Zab 118:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe, niinye orikubahuumuriza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:12">Obaire ota, iwe orikutiina omuntu orikufa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:12">Omwana w'omuntu owaahangirwe nk'obunyaatsi,<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Haza okeebwa MUKAMA Omuhangi waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Owabambire eiguru, akataho emisingi y'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Okaguma noorenzya eizooba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Nootiinisibwa ekiniga ky'orikuhata, yaaba amaririire kucwekyereza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Mbwenu ekiniga kye kirahi?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:13">Isa 45:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enkwatwa eyaanyagirwe eryarekurwa juba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:14">Terifa, ekaza omu kiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:14">N'eby'oburyo byayo tibiribura,<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:35">Yer 31:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:15">Oimutsya enyanja, ebingonzi byayo bikahoorera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:15">MUKAMA ow'amahe niryo iziina ryangye<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:21">Isa 59:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ntaire ebigambo byangye omu kanwa kaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">Naakushereka omu kicuucu ky'omukono gwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">Naabamba eiguru, naataho emisingi y'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">Naagira Saayuuni nti: Muri abantu bangye.<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa 52:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:15">Yer 25:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:2">Zek 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:22">Mat 20:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sisiimuka, sisiimuka, oyemerere, iwe Yerusaalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">Iwe onywereire omu mukono gwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">Ekikopo ky'ekiniga kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">Okanywa ekikopo ky'okugwererana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">Okakyeranguuza.<verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 74:9">Zab 74:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu boojo abu yaazaire boona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:18">Tiharimu n'omwe ow'okumwebembera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:18">Kandi n'omu bu yaayoroire boona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:18">Tiharimu w'okumukwata omukono.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Ebyo byombi bikuhikireho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">N'oha oraakuyaagire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">Kandi n'okuba amatongo n'okucwekyerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">N'enjara na rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">N'oha oraakuhuumurize?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LAM 2:11">Tonz 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 2:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batabani baawe bagwire enshazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">Babyami omu nteeraniro z'enguuto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">Nk'empara ekwatsirwe ekigoye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">Bajuumikiirwe ekiniga kya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">Okuhana kwa Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:11">Isa 54:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo muhurire ebi, imwe abarikubonabonesibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:21">Abasinzire, kwonka mutasinzire viinyo.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:34">Yer 50:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama, MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">Orikutonganira abantu be, arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">Reeba, nyihire omu ngaro zaawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">Ekikopo ky'okugwererana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">N'orushare rw'ekiniga kyangye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">Torigaruka kurunywaho;<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 47:6">Isa 47:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:2">52:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:17">Yer 25:17</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:26">26</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:28">28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kureka ndyaruta omu mikono y'abarikukwita kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Abaakugizire bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Inama, tukwambukireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Naiwe omugongo gwawe okagugira nk'ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Nk'enguuto yaabo y'okurabamu.<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="s1">Amakuru marungi aha b'ensi yoona</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 11:1">Neh 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:17">Yoel 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:27">Kush 21:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sisiimuka, sisiimuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Ojware amaani gaawe, iwe Saayuuni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Jwara ebijwaro byawe ebirungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Iwe Yerusaalemu, orurembo orurikwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Ahabw'okuba abatashazirwe n'abatashemeire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Tibarigaruka kukwijamu.<verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Yekunkumure omucuucu, oimukye, oshutame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">Iwe Yerusaalemu enkwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">Yuzya enkomo ezikuri omu bitsya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">Iwe saayuuni enkwatwa.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:13">Isa 45:13</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:18">1 Pet 1:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Mukagurwa busha, kandi muryacungurwa ahatari mpiiha. <verse eid="ISA 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:6">Kut 46:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Okubanza abantu bangye bakashuuma Misri kushuuhuukirayo; bwanyima Abaasiria baabaitira kubi busha. <verse eid="ISA 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:20">Ezk 36:20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 36:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu aha nteekirweho ki, nindeeba abantu bangye nibatwarirwa busha? Nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. Abarikubategyeka nibababoroozya, kandi obutoosha eiziina ryangye risiiba nirigaywa, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. <verse eid="ISA 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:26">Isa 49:26</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo abantu bangye barimanyira eiziina ryangye; ahari eryo izooba baryamanya ngu niinye orikugamba; reeba niinye.<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:15">Rom 10:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigyere by'orikureeta amakuru g'ebigambo birungi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">Ka ni birungi aha bibungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">Orikuranga eby'obusingye, akareeta amakuru marungi g'ebigambo birungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">Orikuranga eby'okujunwa, akagira Saayuuni ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">Ruhanga waawe ari aha ngoma.<verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 33:17">Isa 33:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:6">62:6</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:2">1 Yoh 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hurira, abarinzi baawe nibaimutsya eiraka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">Nibeeshongorera hamwe n'okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA, ku arigaruka Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">Baryareebana nawe.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 98:3">Zab 98:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 98:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe emyanya ya Yerusaalemu eyaabaire amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">Muteere akaari k'okushemererwa nimweshongorera hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ahuumuriize abantu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">Yaacungura Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:6">Luk 3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA afungiize omukono gwe ogurikwera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">Omu maisho g'amahanga goona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">N'emperu z'ensi zoona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">Ziryareeba okujuna kwa Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:20">Isa 48:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:7-11">Ezr 1:7-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:17">2 Kor 6:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mugyende, mugyende, murugyemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">Mutakora aha kintu kyona ekitashemeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">Imwe abeekorera ebintu bya MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">Murugye ahagati yaarwo, mweyeze.<verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:8">Isa 58:8</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:11">Kur 12:11</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:33">33</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:19">14:19</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 2:13">Mik 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba timurirugayo nimurahukiiriza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">Kandi timurigyenda nimuhunga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">Ahakuba MUKAMA niwe aribeebembera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">Kandi Ruhanga wa Israeli niwe aribaza enyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">Akaguma naabarinda.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuragura aha busaasi bwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, omuheereza wangye aryakoresa obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:13">Aryahimbisibwa, atunguurwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:13">Aze ahaiguru munonga.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:2">Isa 53:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 53:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku baingi baamutangaariire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:14">Ahabw'okusiisikara ahamaisho okukira abantu boona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:14">N'enshusha ye okutaba nk'ey'abantu,<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:7">Isa 49:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:21">Rom 15:21</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:25">16:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikwo arikanga amahanga maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">Abagabe bakeekwata aha munwa ahabwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">Ahabw'okuba baryareeba ekitakabahoga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">Kandi n'eki batakahuriraga baryakyetegyereza.<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="s1">Ebirikuragura aha kubonabonesibwa kwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:9">Isa 51:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:38">Yoh 12:38</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha oikiriize ebi tuhuriire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:1">Kandi omukono gwa MUKAMA gushuururiirwe oha?<verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa 11:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba akakurira omu maisho ge nk'ekibyairwe ekito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">Kandi nk'akati akatookire omu itaka ryomire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">Akaba ataine ku arikushusha, n'obu bwakuba oburungi, ngu tumureebe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">Nari akandi karungi aku turikumwetengaho.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:6">Zab 22:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:12">Mak 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:10">Yoh 1:10</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akagaywa, yaayangwa abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Omuntu w'obujune, omanyiire enaku;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Kandi nk'ou abantu batiinisa amaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Nikwo yaagayirwe atyo, naitwe tutamwetemu kaabuntu.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:26">Zab 69:26</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:17">Mat 8:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima akeekorera enaku zaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">Yaatwara obujune bwaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">Haza itwe twateekateeka ngu Ruhanga niwe amuteire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">Akamwasha, akamubonabonesa.<verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 4:25">Rom 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet 2:24</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 2:25">25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka akahutaazibwa ahabw'eby'okushiisha byaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">Yaahondahondwa ahabw'okutahikiirira kwaitu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">Okuteerwa kw'okutureetera obusingye niwe yaakuteirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">Kandi emihiririzi ye niyo etukiza.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:6">Yer 50:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 50:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:21">2 Kor 5:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Twena tukahaba nk'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">Twateishuka, buri muntu yaatoora omuhanda gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">Kwonka MUKAMA yaamutaho okutahikiirira kwaitu twena.<verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:19">Yer 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:63">Mat 26:63</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:32">Byak 8:32</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:23">1 Pet 2:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akaitwa kubi yaabonabonesibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">Kwonka tiyaayashamya kanwa ke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">Yaaba nk'akataama akarikutwarwa kwitwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">Kandi nk'entaama oku ecureera omu maisho g'abakyemuzi b'ebyoya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">Okwo nikwo nawe ataraashamize kanwa ke.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:1">Isa 57:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okwitwa kubi n'okucwerwa orubanja akaihwaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">Omu b'omu busingye bwe n'oha owaateekateekire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">Ngu akaihirwaho kimwe omu nsi y'abahuriire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">Ahabw'eby'okushiisha by'abantu bangye nikyo yaateereirwe.<verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:57">Mat 27:57</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:60">60</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:22">1 Pet 2:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bakamuteekateekyera ah'okuziikwa hamwe n'ababi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">Kandi n'omutungi omu kufa kwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">N'obu araabe atarakozire by'obubisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">N'obu bwakuba obugobya kuruga omu kanwa ke.<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Kwonka MUKAMA akasiima kumuhondahonda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">Yaamusaasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">Ku araayehindure ekitambo ahabw'ekibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">Aryareeba oruzaaro rwe, ayongyere aha biro bye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">Ebi MUKAMA arikwenda bihikiirizibwe gye omu mukono gwe.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:39">Byak 13:39</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:18">Rom 5:18</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 5:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:1">1 Yoh 2:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryareeba ebirikuruga omu busaasi bw'amagara ge, amarwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">Ahabw'okumanya kwe omuheereza wangye ohikiriire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">Aryahaisa baingi okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">Kandi ayekorere eby'okutahikiirira byabo.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:37">Luk 22:37</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:34">Rom 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:9">Fil 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:15">Kol 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:5">1 Tim 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo ndyamubaganisiza omugabo hamwe n'abakuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Nawe aryabagana eminyago n'ab'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Ahabw'okuba akashuka amagara ge okuhitsya aha kufa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Yaabarirwa hamwe n'enkozi z'bibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Yaayekorera ebibi by'abaingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Kandi yaatonganira abasiisi.<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugarura abantu be abarikubonabonesibwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:4">Isa 62:4</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:5">1 Sam 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:27">Gal 4:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe ngumba 'we, yeshongore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Iwe otakazaaraga, teera akaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Oyeshongore n'eiraka rihango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Iwe otakarumwaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Ahabw'okuba abaana b'otsigirweho nibakira ab'oine iba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:19">Isa 49:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hangusya omwanya gw'eihema ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">Oreegye emikingo y'omu maju gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">Otagira eki waima, yongyera aha mirunga yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">Ohamye enkondo zaawe;<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:14">Kut 28:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba muryayeshanzira aha rubaju rwa buryo n'orwa bumosho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:3">Oruzaaro rwawe rukubuure amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:3">N'endembo ezaabaire ziri amatongo zituurwemu.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:17">Isa 45:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otatiina, ahabw'okuba torihemuka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">Otashoberwa, ahabw'okuba toriitwa nshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">Kureka oryayebwa enshoni z'omu butsigazi bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">Kandi ekijumo ky'obufaakazi bwawe torigaruka kukiijuka.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:4">Isa 62:4</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 62:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:9">Zek 14:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba Omuhangi waawe niwe baro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">MUKAMA ow'amahe niryo eiziina rye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">Kandi Orikwera wa Israeli niwe Mucunguzi waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">Naayetwa Ruhanga w'ensi yoona.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:14">Isa 49:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba MUKAMA akwetsire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">Nk'omukazi otsigirweho, ou omutima gwe gwijwire enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">Nk'omukazi oshenzirwe akiri muto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">Nikwo Ruhanga waawe arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:20">Isa 26:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba mbaire nkutsigireho akaanya kakye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:7">Kwonka ndyakutaaruura, nkwiniire embabazi nyingi.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Ahabw'okukugirira ekiniga kingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">Nkamara akaanya kakye nkwimire amaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">Kwonka ndyakugirira esaasi, nkwiniire rukundo etahwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">Nikwo MUKAMA, Omucunguzi waawe, arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 8:21">Kut 8:21</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 9:11">9:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ebyo nibinshusira eby'omu biro bya Noa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">Nk'oku naarahiire ku amaizi g'omu biro bye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">Gatarigaruka kushandaara mu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">Nikwo ndahiire ku ntarigaruka kukugirira kiniga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">N'obu kwakuba okukukabukira.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 25:12">Kub 25:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:25">Ezk 34:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba enshozi ziryarugaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">N'ebibungo biihweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">Kwonka embabazi zangye, ezitaruga ha rugyero, tizirikurugaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">N'endagaano yangye ey'obusingye teriihwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">Nikwo MUKAMA okwiniire esaasi arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:21">Isa 51:21</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:19">Kush 21:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai bambe iwe orikubonabonesibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:11">Okanagwa oku n'oku omuyaga, otarikuhuumurizibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:11">Reeba, amabaare gaawe ndyagasharuraho amabara marungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:11">N'emisingi yaawe ngyombekyese safiro.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Amatungu gaawe ndyagombekyesa kalukedoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:12">Kandi amarembo gaawe ngombekyese kabunkulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:12">N'orugo rwawe rwona ndwombekyese amabaare g'obuguzi bwingi.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:165">Zab 119:165</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Yer 31:33</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:45">Yoh 6:45</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batabani baawe boona baryayegyesibwa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:13">Kandi okugogyera kwabo kuryaba kwingi;<verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Omu kuhikiirira nimwo orihamiibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">Okuhatwa kuryakuba hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">Ahabw'okuba toritiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">N'ebirikwitsa obwoba biryakuba hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">Ahabw'okuba tibirikuhikaho.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:9">Isa 8:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 8:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haribaho owaimutsya engamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:15">Ziryaba zitarugire ahariinye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:15">Orikwimukiza engamba aryakuzira.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />Reeba, mpangire omuheesi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:16">Ojugutirira omuriro gw'amakara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:16">Akaihamu eby'okurwanisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:16">Kandi mpangire omuhwerekyerezi kucwekyereza.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Tihariho ky'okurwanisa, eki baheesire kukurwanisa, ekirikubaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Kandi orurimi rwona oruriimuka kukutonganisa oryarusinga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'abaheereza ba MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Kandi okwo nikwo kuhikiirira kwabo okurikuruga ahariinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Obunanukye bw'abarikwikiriza Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 9:5">Enf 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:6">Mat 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:37">Yoh 7:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe mwena abaine eiriho, mwije aha maizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Kandi otaine mpiiha, aije, agure, arye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Mwije mugure viinyo n'amate</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Ahatari kuha mpiiha, ahatari kucwererana.<verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:27">Yoh 6:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki nimuheera empiiha zaanyu ebitari by'okurya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">N'okuhendekyera ebitari kuhaazya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">Mumpurire mutaireho omutima, mubone kurya ebirungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">Amagara gaanyu gashemerererwe ebirimu ebishaju.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:21">Isa 59:21</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 4:4">Enf 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:9">Yer 30:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:40">32:40</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:26">Ezk 37:26</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:34">Byak 13:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutegye amatu, mwije ahariinye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">Muhurire, amagara gaanyu gabone kugumaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">Naanye ndyaragaana naimwe endagaano etarihwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">Nizo mbabazi ezitarirugaho ezi naaraganiise Daudi.<verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 9:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:43">Zab 18:43</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 5:31">Byak 5:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, mmugizire kareebi aha mahanga kuhamya ebyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:4">Kuba omwebembezi kandi omutegyeki waago.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:22">Zek 8:22</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 8:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 3:13">Byak 3:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba oryayeta eihanga eri otakamanyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">Kandi amahanga agatarikukumanya garyakwehongyera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">Ahabwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, Orikwera wa Israeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">Ahabw'okuba akuhaire ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:6">Zab 32:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musherure MUKAMA naakiboneka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:6">Mumutakire akiri haihi.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Omubi arekye omuhanda gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">N'otahikiriire arekye ebiteekateeko bye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">Agarukye ahairi MUKAMA, abone kumusaasira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">Ahari Ruhanga waitu, ahakuba naija kumusaasirira kimwe.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />Mumanye ngu ebiteekateeko byangye tibyo biteekateeko byanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:8">N'emitwarize yaanyu tiyo mitwarize yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:8">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:11">Zab 103:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nk'oku eiguru riri ahaiguru okukira ensi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:9">Nikwo n'emitwarize yangye eri ahaiguru okukira eyaanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:9">N'ebiteekateeko byangye nikwo birikukira ebyanyu.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 9:10">2 Kor 9:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nk'oku enjura nari ebirika biruga ahaiguru bikagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">Bitagarukyeyo, kureka bikaitirira eitaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">Bikarireetamu okutooka n'okumera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">Omubibi akabona embibo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">N'omuri bikamuha eby'okurya,<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />Nikwo n'ekigambo kyangye ekirikuruga omu kanwa kangye kiriba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:11">Tikirigaruka hariinye busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:11">Kureka kiryahikiiriza ebi ndikwenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:11">Kigire omugisha omuri ebyo ebi nkitumiire.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:1">Isa 35:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 35:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:23">44:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:8">Zab 98:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba muryashohora n'okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">Murugyeyo mwebembeirwe, mwine obusingye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">Enshozi n'ebibungo biryateera akaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">Byeshongore omu maisho gaanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">N'ebiti byona eby'omu ishwa biteere omu ngaro.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:19">Isa 41:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwanya gw'amahwa haryameramu omuberooshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">N'omu mwanya gw'emikwatangwe hameremu omukadasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">Kibe eky'okwijukiraho MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">Akamanyiso akatarihwaho ebiro byona.<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 46:12">Isa 46:12</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 46:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">Muhamire omu by'oburyo, mukore eby'okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">Ahabw'okuba okujuna kwangye kuri haihi kwija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">N'okuhikiirira kwangye kuri haihi kushuuruurwa.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:13">Isa 58:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu orikubikora aine omugisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:2">Omwana w'omuntu orikubihamiraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:2">Akarinda sabato, atagishiishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:2">Kandi akazibira omukono gwe kukora ekibi kyona.<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:1">Isa 14:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omunyaihanga oyehongyeire MUKAMA arekye kugira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:3">MUKAMA taribura kuntaanisa n'abantu be.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:3">Kandi omukonwa arekye kugira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:3">Reeba, ndi ekiti kyomire.<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:4">Abakonwa abarikurinda sabato zangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:4">Abatoorana ebirikunshemeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:4">Bakahamira aha ndagaano yangye,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 18:18">2 Sam 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:12">Yoh 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12">Kush 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabaha ekiijutsyo omu nju yangye n'omu rurembo rwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:5">Mbahe n'eiziina eririkukira okugira abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:5">Ndyabaha eiziina eririgumaho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:5">Eritariihwaho.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Kandi abanyamahanga abarikwehongyera MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">Kumukorera, kukunda eiziina rye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">N'okuba abaheereza be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">Buri muntu orikurinda sabato, atagishiishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">Akahamira aha ndagaano yangye,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:24">Isa 19:24</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 19:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mat 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:16">Rom 15:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abo nabo ndyabareeta aha nju yangye ey'okushabiramu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Ebitambo byabo by'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo byabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Biryaikirizibwa kutambirwa aha itambiro ryangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Ahabw'okuba enju yangye eryayetwa ey'okushabirwamu amahanga goona.<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:12">Isa 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:16">Yoh 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:10">Efe 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:11-16">2:11-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA orikutaaruura encuubwa za Israeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:8">Arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:8">Ndyamutaaruuriraho abandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:8">Mbongyere aha baabaire baataarwirwe.<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 12:9">Yer 12:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe nyamaishwa z'omu ishwa 'mwe mwena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:9">Naimwe mwena enyamaishwa z'omu kibira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:9">Nimwije mushonshomere.<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:13">Yer 6:13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 6:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarinzi be n'empumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">Boona tibaine bwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">Boona n'embwa ezikwatsirwe aha munwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">Ezitarikubaasa kumoka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">Nibaroota, nibabyama, kandi nibakunda kuhungira;<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:1">Yer 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:2">Ezk 34:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eego n'embwa z'omururu, ezitahaaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">N'abariisa abataine ki barikumanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">Boona bateishukire omuhanda, baatoora eyaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">Buri muntu naayesherurira amagoba ge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">Ah'arikubaasa kuhika hoona.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:7">Isa 28:7</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Kor 15:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibagira bati: Mwije, tushengyeere viinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:12">Twenywere ebirikusinza, tubikimbuure;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:12">Kandi na nyencakare tugire nka hati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:12">Turengyesereze.<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhiirwa kw'abahikiriire omu kufa kwabo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 12:1">Zab 12:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ohikiriire naahwerekyerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">Kwonka tihariho orikukitaho omutima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">Abarikutiina Ruhanga nibaihwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">Kwonka tihariho orikuteekateeka ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">Naaba aihirwe omu kabi,<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 16:14">2 Bus 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:25">Ezk 32:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ataahire omu busingye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:2">Abagyendera omu kuhikiirira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:2">Bahuumurira aha bitabo byabo.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuteisa abarikuramya ebishushani</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:41">Yoh 8:41</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 8:42">42</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka imwe, batabani b'omurogikazi 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:3">Oruzaaro rw'omushambani na maraaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:3">Nimwirire aha.<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:4">Isa 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:21">Zab 35:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ou murikugaaniiza n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:4">Ou murikushekyerera nimworekyeza orurimi n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:4">Timuri abaana b'ebibi, oruzaaro rw'obugobya,<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:4">2 Bag 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:20">Ezk 16:20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:21">21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abarikubugumwamu okwetenga, muri omu myela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:5">N'ahansi ya buri kiti kibisi ekyetwa omurinzi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:5">Mukaitira abaana omu mpanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:5">Omu biharamanga by'amabaare?<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Omugabo gwanyu guri omu mabaare ag'omu ruhanga agarikuterera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Ago nigwo mubagano gwanyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Nigo mwashukiire empongano zaanyu z'eby'okunywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Mukagahongyera empongano z'esaano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Nimugira ngu ekiniga eki nyine ahabw'ebyo nikibaasa kwikaikana?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:23">1 Bag 14:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaire ekitanda kyawe aha rushozi oruraingwa kandi orutunguukire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:7">Kandi okwo niyo waagiire kutambira ebitambo.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 1:2">Hos 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaire akamanyiso kaawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Enyima y'orwigi n'ebiti by'omuryango;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Ahakuba ojwariire busha ondiijo, otariinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Waatemba ekitanda kyawe, waakihangusya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Waaragaana nabo endagaano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Ku waareeba ekitanda kyabo, waakikunda.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Waaza ow'omugabe oyeesiigire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:9">Oyongyeire aha migaju yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:9">Waatuma entumwa zaawe hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:9">Waayemaramu ak'obuntu, waahika Okuzimu.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 18:12">Yer 18:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Waaruhibwa orugyendo ruhango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:10">Kwonka tiwaagira oti: Tikiine mugasho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:10">Kureka waabona eky'okukwongyeramu amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:10">Tiwaagwa nshazi.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:21">Zab 50:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:10">78:10</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:36">36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu shi owaakwitsize obwoba, okatiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Kikakureetera okubeiha, otanyijukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Okanga kuunyetaho, n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Timmazire omwanya muhango, nyetsirize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Haza otantiine?<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />Ndyagamba aha kuhikiirira kwawe n'aha bi orikukora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:12">Kwonka tibiine ki birikugasira.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:9">Isa 11:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:9">Zab 37:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 11:12">Yer 11:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Guma otakye, haza tureebe ebishushani ebi waashangurwize, ku byakutambira!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Omanye ku omuyaga gurikwija kubitwara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">N'omwitsyo gukabituntumura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Kwonka orikuunyesiga niwe arikubuura ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Akahungura orushozi rwangye orurikwera.<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:10">Isa 62:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi kiryagambwa kiti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:14">Mutinde, mutinde, mushemeze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:14">Murimbure enkongi zoona omu muhanda gw'abantu bangye.<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku Ruhanga atuura n'abarikweteisa akabahuumuriza</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:3">42:3</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:6">Mik 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:18">Zab 34:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 138:6">138:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo Orw'ahaiguru, kandi Omukuru, arikugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">Otuura Ahatahwaho, ou eiziina rye riri Orikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">Naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">Ntuura omu mwanya gw'ahaiguru kandi ogurikwera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">Hamwe n'ow'omutima ogurikweteisa kandi omucureezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">Ngu mbone kuhimbuura emyoyo y'abacureezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">N'emitima y'abarikweteisa.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:3">Kut 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:9">Zab 103:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba tinditongana ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:16">Kandi tindiguma nyine ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:16">Ahakuba ku naakutwaza ntyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:16">Emyoyo n'emitima ei naahangire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:16">Ekancwekyererera omu maisho.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:13">Yer 6:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'ekibi ky'okururuuha kwe nkaguubwa kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:17">Naamuteera, naamwima amaisho nyine ekiniga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:17">Kwonka yaagumizamu kugaruka enyima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:17">Omu muhanda ogu omutima gwe gurikwenda.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:3">Isa 61:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:22">Yer 3:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndeebire emicwe ye, ndyamutambira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:18">Mmwebembere, mmugarurire obuhuumure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:18">Mpangye omu barikumuyaagira <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">57:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Ruheburaayo, ebyana by'eminwa. </char></note>eminwa erikuhimbisa.<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:39">Byak 2:39</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:17">Efe 2:17</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:15">Heb 13:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obusingye, Obusingye bube omu ba hare n'aba haihi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:19">Naanye ndyamutambira, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JUD 1:13">Yud 13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ababi ni nk'enyanja erikwecunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:20">Ahakuba terikubaasa kucureera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:20">Kureka amaizi gaayo gaimukiiriza ebyondo n'oburofa.<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:22">Isa 48:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha mubi tihabaho busingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:21">Nikwo Ruhanga wangye arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Okwesiibyakwo oku Ruhanga arikusiima</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:1">Yoel 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:8">Mik 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ranguuza, otazinda eiraka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:1">Imutsya eiraka ryawe nk'enzamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:1">Ogambire abantu bangye okushiisha kwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:1">Ab'enju ya Yakobo oboorekye ebibi byabo.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:5">Zek 7:5</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 7:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka bansherura buri izooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Bashemerererwa okumanya emihanda yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Nk'eihanga erikora eby'okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Ritarekye biragiro bya Ruhanga waaryo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Banshaba kubacwera emanja z'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Bashemerererwa kwirira haihi Ruhanga.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:17">Isa 60:17</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 5:1-12">Neh 5:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:14">Mal 3:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Nibagira bati):</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Ahabw'enki twesiibizekwo, otakyeteho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Tukeebonabonesa, otakiteho omutima?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Mumanye ngu, omu biro by'okwesiibyakwo kwanyu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Muba nimusherura eby'okweshemeza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">N'okwita kubi abarikubakorera.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Reeba, eki mwesiibizakwo, n'okutongana n'okurwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:4">N'okuteerana entomi z'obubi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:4">Okwesiibyakwo nk'okwanyu okw'eri izooba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:4">Tikurikwija kureetera iraka ryanyu kuhurirwa ahaiguru.<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 16:29">Lev 16:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimugira ngu oku nikwo kwesiibyakwo oku ndikusiima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Eizooba eri omuntu ayebonabonesezaho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">N'okwinika omutwe nk'ekibingo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Omuntu akeeyarira ebiguniya, akabyama omu iju?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Okwo nikwo murikweta okwesiibyakwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">N'eizooba eri MUKAMA arikusiima?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />Okwesiibyakwo oku ndikusiima t'oku?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">Okubohoorora emirunga y'obubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">Okukomoorora enkomo z'obuhuuku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">Okurekura abarikuhatwa, bakeegyendera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">Kandi n'okuhenda emigamba yoona?<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:35">Mat 25:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> T'okubagana eby'okurya byawe n'abaine enjara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:7">N'okutaasya enshoberwa ezitaine butaaho omu maka gaawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:7">Okireeba ojwaire busha, okamujweka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:7">N'okuteehuzya abaanyu?<verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:12">Isa 52:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 11:17">Yob 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:17">Yer 30:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nibwo omushana gwawe gurijuguta nk'omushekye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:8">N'okukira kwawe kukarahuka kwija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:8">Okuhikiirira kwawe kukakwebembera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:8">N'ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kikakuza enyima, kikakurinda.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 6:13">Enf 6:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi obwo nibwo oryeta MUKAMA, akakwetaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">Okamutakira, akakuhuumuriza ati: Ndi aha!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">Ku muryemaramu okuhata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">okutunga omuntu orukumu, n'okugamba kubi,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />Ku oryehotorera omujara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:10">Okamarira abarikubonabonesibwa ebi barikwetenga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:10">Obwo nibwo omushana gwawe gurijwa omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:10">N'omwirima gwawe ndindindi gukaba nk'omushana gw'eihangwe.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:12">Yer 31:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA aryaguma akwebembere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">Ahaazye amagara gaawe omu biro by'enjara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">Agumye amagufa gaawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">Oryaba nk'omusiri ogurikwitirirwa amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">Kandi obe nk'enshuro y'amaizi etarikwoma.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:4">Isa 61:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:14">Ezr 6:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amatongo gaawe aga ira garyagaruka gombekwemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:12">Oryagaruka oteho emisingi emazire obusingye bwingi egwireho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:12">Kandi oryayetwa omuhunduuzi w'ahasheenyukire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:12">Orikugaruraho otuhanda oturikutaaha omu maka.<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 56:2">Isa 56:2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:15-21">Neh 13:15-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku orireka kuribatiirira sabato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">N'okukora eby'okweshemeza aha izooba ryangye eririkwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">Kureka sabato waagyeta okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">Eizooba rya MUKAMA eririkwera waaryeta ery'ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">Kandi waariha ekitiinisa, otaagyendera omu by'emitwarize yaawe wenka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">N'obu kwakuba okusherura eby'okweshemeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">Nari okugamba ebigambo ebitaine ku biri,<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:13">Bir 32:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:19">Yer 50:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo oryashemerererwa omuri MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:14">Naanye ndyakuha okutoogooga aha mitwe y'ebibungo by'ensi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:14">Kandi ndyakutungisa obuhunguzi bwa Yakobo shwenkuru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:14">Ahabw'okuba akanwa ka MUKAMA niko kaakigamba.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Oku ekibi kizibira Mukama kukora</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:23">Kub 11:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, omukono gwa MUKAMA tigubaire mugufu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:1">Kutabaasa kujuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:1">N'okutu kwe tikufiire kutabaasa kuhurira;<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:25">Yer 5:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kureka eby'okutahikiirira byanyu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:2">Nibyo bibataaniise na Ruhanga waanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:2">N'ebibi byanyu nibyo bimureeteire kubaima amaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:2">Akanga kubahurira.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:15">Isa 1:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba emikono yaanyu esiisirwe eshagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:3">N'engaro zaanyu zisiisirwe okutahikiirira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:3">Eminwa yaanyu egambire ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:3">N'orurimi rwanyu niruhwihwitsa eby'obugobya.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:14">Zab 7:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihariho orikutabaaririza mugyenzi we eby'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:4">Tihariho orikutongana eby'amazima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:4">Kureka nibeesiga ebitaine mugasho, bagamba ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:4">Babaka enda z'eitima, bazaara okutahikiirira.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Baatira amahuri g'empiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:5">Baruka orububi rw'orutangura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:5">Orikurya amahuri gaabo naafa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:5">Eihuri rikyatwa, hatimbiramu encwera.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:14">Yob 8:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Embubi zaabo tizirikubaasa kuba bijwaro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:6">Tihaine orikwenda kweshweka ebi bakozire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:6">Emirimo yaabo n'ey'okutahikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:6">Ebi barikukora n'engaro zaabo birimu eitima.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:15-17">Rom 3:15-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigyere byabo biirukira ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:7">Barahuka kusheesha eshagama y'abataine rubanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:7">Ebiteekateeko byabo n'ebiteekateeko by'okutahikiirira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:7">Ei baza yoona, n'okuhwerekyereza n'okumaraho.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:22">Isa 48:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tibarikumanya muhanda gw'obusingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:8">Kandi omu mitwarize yaabo tiharimu mazima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:8">Beeteereireho emihanda ekiikami;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:8">Ogitooramu weena, tagira busingye.<verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:2">Isa 60:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo eby'oburyo bitubeereire hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">N'eby'okuhikiirira bitatuhikyeho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">Nitutegyereza omushana, tureeba omwirima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">Tutegyereza okwaka, tugyendera omu mwirima ndindindi.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:29">Bir 28:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:9">1 Kor 4:9</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 4:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tukorakora aha rugo nk'empumi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:10">Eego, tubandagira nk'abataine maisho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:10">Tuteera entsibo omu ihangwe nk'omu rwita-waabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:10">Omu b'amaani turi nk'emitumbi.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 38:14">Isa 38:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:13">46:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Twena nitutsinda nk'edubu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:11">Nituganya nk'enkombe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:11">Nitutegyereza eby'oburyo, kwonka bibura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:11">Nitutegyereza okujunwa, kwonka kutuba hare.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Ahabw'okuba eby'okushiisha byaitu birengyesereize omu maisho gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:12">N'ebibi byaitu nibitushinja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:12">Ahabw'okuba eby'okushiisha byaitu bitwezingiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:12">Kandi n'okutahikiirira kwaitu nitukumanya,<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Nitucumura, twehakana MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:13">Nituteishuka, tureka kukuratira Ruhanga waitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:13">Nitugamba eby'okwita kubi n'eby'obugomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:13">Nitugunja eby'ebishuba, tubigamba tubiihire aha mutima.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Eby'oburyo nibinagwa enyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:14">N'okuhikiirira kwemerera hare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:14">Ahabw'okuba amazima gagwire omu muhanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:14">Kandi okugororoka tikurikubaasa kutaaha.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Eego, amazima gabuzire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:15">Orikureka ebibi, nibamwoya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:15">MUKAMA akabiireeba, byamugwisa kubi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:15">Ahabw'okureeba hatariho by'oburyo.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku Mukama arikurwanisa abazigu baitu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:5">Isa 63:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaareeba hatariho muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:16">Yaatangaara ahabw'okutabaho mutonganizi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:16">N'ahabw'ekyo omukono gwe gwamureetera obusinguzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:16">N'okuhikiirira kwe kwamuhigika.<verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Efe 6:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Tes 5:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaajwara okuhikiirira nk'ekyoma ky'okwekingiza aha kifuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:17">Yaata aha mutwe enkofiira y'okujuna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:17">Yaajwara eby'okuhoora enzigu, kuba ebijwaro bye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:17">Yaayehumbika obweziriki nk'omunagiro.<verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:4">Isa 63:4</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 63:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryabazimuurira, nk'ebi baakozire oku biri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:18">Ababisha be abazimuurire ekiniga, n'abazigu be abaihure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:18">N'ebirwa nabyo abizimuurire.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:27">Isa 30:27</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 113:3">Zab 113:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo baryatiina eiziina rya MUKAMA okuruga oburengyerwa-izooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:19">N'ekitiinisa kye okwiha ei eizooba riruga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:19">Ahabw'okuba aryaija nk'omugyera ogurikuhimintika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:19">Ogurikutwarwa omwitsyo gwa MUKAMA.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:32">Yoel 2:32</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:26">Rom 11:26</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 11:27">27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi aryaija Saayuuni ari omucunguzi aha ba Yakobo abarikuhinduka kuruga omu bibi, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. <verse eid="ISA 59:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:16">Isa 51:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:10">Bir 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31">Yer 31:31</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Egi niyo ndagaano ei ndikuragaana nabo. Omwoyo wangye ori ahariiwe, n'ebigambo byangye, ebi naata omu kanwa kaawe, tibiriruga aha rurimi rwawe, n'obu rwakuba orw'abaana baawe, nari orwa baijukuru baawe, okwiha hati n'okuhitsya ebiro byona, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Ei Omujuni w'abanyamahanga ariruga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 4:2">Mal 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:14">Efe 5:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imuka, oyakye; ahakuba omushana gwawe gwizire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:1">N'ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kikujwereire.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Ahakuba, reeba, omwirima guryashweka ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">Omwirima ndindindi gushwekye amahanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">Kwonka MUKAMA aryakuturukiraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">N'ekitiinisa kye kikureebekyereho.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:24">Kush 21:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahanga garyaija omu mushana gwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:3">N'abagabe omu kumurinkana kw'okuturuka kwawe.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:18">Isa 49:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imutsya amaisho gaawe, omagamagye, oreebe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">Boona nibateerana, nibaija ahariiwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">Batabani baawe baryaija barugye hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">Na bahara baawe baije bakiikiirwe omu mikono.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:5">Zab 34:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nibwo orireeba, okashemuuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">Omutima gwawe gukagurukaaguruka, gukashemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">Ahabw'okuba obwingi bw'ebirikuruga omu nyanja buryagarukira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">Obutungi bw'amahanga bukwizire.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 6:5">Bar 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 10:1">1 Bag 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:11">Mat 2:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amasyo g'engamira garyakushweka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">Engamira nto za Midiani n'eza Efa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">N'eziriruga Sheeba zoona ziryaija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">Zireetsire ezaabu n'obubaane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">Zimanyise hoona okusingizibwa kwa MUKAMA.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:9">Kut 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:7">Hag 2:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amasyo ga Kedari goona garyakuteeraniraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">N'empaya z'entaama za Nebayoosi zikuheereze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">Ziije aha itambiro ryangye, ziri ebitambo ebirikusiimwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">Naanye ndyahimbisisa enju yangye y'ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />Aba nibaahi abarikuguruka nk'ekicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:8">Bakashusha nk'enkombe ezirikugaruka kutaahira omu madirisa gaazo.<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:16">Isa 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:5">51:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:5">55:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima ebirwa biryantegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">N'emeeri za Tarushiishi nizo ziribanza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Kureeta batabani baawe nizibaiha hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Baine efeeza n'ezaabu zaabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Ahabw'eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Orikwera wa Israeli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">Ahabw'okuba akuhaisize ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:1">Isa 45:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 45:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamahanga baryakwombekyera engo z'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">N'abagabe baabo bakuheereze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">Ahabw'okuba nkakuteera nkwiniire ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">Kwonka nkusaasiire ahabw'embabazi zangye.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:25">Kush 21:25</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amarembo gaawe garyaguma gaigwirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">Tigarikingwa nyomushana na nyekiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">Abantu babone kukureetera obutungi bw'amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">Beebembeirwe abagabe baabo.<verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 14:17-19">Zek 14:17-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba eihanga n'obugabe ebiryanga kukuheereza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:12">Biryahwerekyerera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:12">Eego, ago mahanga gahwerekyererezibwe kimwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:19">Isa 41:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekitiinisa kya Lebanooni kiryakwizira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:13">Emyereezi, emiberooshi, n'emiteyashuuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:13">Okushemeza Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:13">Kandi omwanya ogu ntamu ebigyere byangye ndyagugira ogw'ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:1">Isa 14:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">62:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 62:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:9">Kush 3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batabani b'abaabaire nibakuhata</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">Baryaija nibakwinamira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">N'abaabaire nibakugaya baryajuumara aha bigyere byawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">Bakwete Orurembo rwa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">Saayuuni y'Orikwera wa Israeli.<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:18">Isa 65:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 47:4">Zab 47:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu oraabe waatsigirweho, okangwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">Okabura ow'okukurabamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">Ndyakuhindura ow'ekitiinisa ebiro byona okukira abandi boona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">Ow'okushemererwa, nk'oku obusingye burigyenda nibwihaihana.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:23">Isa 49:23</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:24">Kut 49:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryanywa amate g'amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">Oyonkye amabeere g'abagabe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">Kandi oryamanya ku nyowe, MUKAMA, ndi Omujuni waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">Omucunguzi waawe, Ow'amaani owa Yakobo.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:3">Isa 58:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwanya gw'omuringa ndyareeta ezaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Omu mwanya gw'ekyoma ndeete efeeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Omu mwanya gw'ebiti ndyatamu emiringa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">N'omu mwanya gw'amabaare, ntemu ebyoma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Obusingye nibwo ndigira abareeberezi baawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Kandi okuhikiirira nikwo ndigira abarikukoresa.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:9">Isa 11:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:1">26:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eitima tiririgaruka kuhurirwa mu nsi yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">n'obu kwakuba okuhwerekyereza n'okumaraho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">Kureka engo zaawe oryazeeta Kujunwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">N'amarembo gaawe ogeete Kuhimbisa.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:23">Isa 24:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:26">30:26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:23">Kush 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:5">22:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba tiririgaruka kukwakira nyomushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">Okumurinkana kw'okwezi tikurigaruka kukwakira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">Kureka MUKAMA niwe ariba omushana gwawe ogutahwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">Na Ruhanga waawe akaba ekitiinisa kyawe.<verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:10">Isa 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:4">Kush 21:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba ryawe tiririgaruka kurenga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">N'okwezi kwawe tikurituubya kwaka kwakwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aryaba omushana gwawe ogutahwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">N'ebiro by'okuganya kwawe biryahwaho.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa 52:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Ezk 37:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu baawe boona baryaba abahikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">Bakubuure ensi, ebe eyaabo ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">Babe eitaagi eri nyebyariire, omurimo gw'engaro zangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">Mbone kuheebwa ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:3">Hab 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:31">Mat 13:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikukira boona obuto aryarugwamu oruganda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">N'orikukira boona obukye arugyemu eihanga ry'amaani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">Niinye MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">Kandi ndyakirahutsya omu bunaku bwakyo.<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s1">Ebi nabi yaahanwire aha murimo gwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:2">Isa 11:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">42:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:18">Luk 4:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwoyo wa Mukama RUHANGA ari ahariinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Ahakuba MUKAMA anshukireho amajuta</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Kureetera abooro ebigambo birungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Kushemba abacwekire emitima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Kumanyisa enkwatwa eby'okurekurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">N'ababohirwe eby'okwigurirwa ekihome<verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:8">Isa 34:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:10">Lev 25:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:4">Mat 5:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:19">Luk 4:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kurangira abantu omwaka gwa MUKAMA ogw'embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">N'eizooba eri Ruhanga waitu arihooreraho enzigu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">Kuhuumuriza boona abarikuganya,<verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:21">Isa 60:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 45:7">Zab 45:7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:8">Yoh 15:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'okuha ab'omuri Saayuuni abarikuganya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Eihunde ry'ebirabyo omu mwanya gw'eiju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Amajuta g'okushemererwa omu mwanya gw'okuganya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Omunagiro gw'okuhimbisa omu mwanya gw'omutima gw'obujune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Babone kwetwa ebiti by'okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Ebyabyairwe MUKAMA kumuhaisa ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:12">Isa 58:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:21">65:21</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:14">Amo 9:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryayombeka omu myanya ya ira eyaasheenyirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">Baimutsye amaju agaabaire gaahindukire amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">Bahunduure endembo ezaasheenyirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">Ezaakurataine omu kusheenywa omu busingye butari bumwe.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:2">Isa 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:10">60:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamahanga nibo baribariisiza amasyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:5">Abantu b'enduga-mahanga nibo baribahingira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:5">Bakasharira emizaabibu yaanyu;<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:5">Isa 60:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kur 19:6</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:6">Kush 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka imwe muryayetwa abanyamurwa ba MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">Abantu babeete abaheereza ba Ruhanga waitu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">Muryatungwa obutungi bw'amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">Mwehimbisize omu kitiinisa kyago.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:12">Zek 9:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwanya gw'okukwatwa enshoni muryatunga emigabo ebiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">Omu mwanya gw'okuhemuka muryashemerererwa ebi mubagaine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">N'ahabw'ekyo muryatunga emigabo ebiri omu nsi yaanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">Kandi okushemererwa kwanyu tikurihwaho.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa 55:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:40">Yer 32:40</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:26">Ezk 37:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nyowe MUKAMA nkunda eby'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">Nyanga okunyaga n'okukora kubi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">Kandi ndyabazimuurira omu mazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">Ndagaane nabo endagaano etarihwaho.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Oruzaaro rwabo ruryamanywa omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">Na baijukuru baabo bamanywe omu bantu b'enganda nyingi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">Abaribareeba boona baryaikiriza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">Ku bari oruzaaro oru MUKAMA ahaire omugisha.<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:18">Isa 49:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59:17</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 3:18">Hab 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:4">Zek 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:46">Luk 1:46</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:8">Kush 19:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:2">21:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyashemerererwa munonga omuri MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Omutima gwangye gwesiimire omuri Ruhanga wangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Ahabw'okuba anjwekire ebijwaro by'okujunwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Yantaho ekanzu y'okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Nk'oku kishwera ajwara eihunde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Kandi nk'oku omugore ayehunda otubaare tw'obuguzi bwingi.<verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Ahakuba nk'oku ensi emeza ebirikutooka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">Kandi nk'oku omusiri gumeza ebigubyairwemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arimeza okuhikiirira n'okuhimbisa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">Omu maisho gw'amahanga goona.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s1">Okwendeza Saayuuni okujunwa n'okuba omushana gw'ensi yoona</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 4:18">Enf 4:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabwa Saayuuni tindihunama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">Ahabwa Yerusaalemu tindihuumura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">Okuhitsya obu okuhikiirira kwayo kurishohora nk'okumurinakana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">N'okujunwa kwayo kukaba nk'etabaaza erikwaka.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 98:2">Zab 98:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:17">Kush 2:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12">3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahanga garyareeba okuhikiirira kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">N'abagabe boona bareebe ekitiinisa kyawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">Haza obwo oryayetwa eiziina risya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">Eri akanwa ka MUKAMA karikweta.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:16">Zek 9:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryaba ekirunga kirungi omu ngaro za MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:3">N'eihunde ry'obugabe omu ngaro za Ruhanga waawe.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:1-7">Isa 54:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:12">Mal 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:10">1 Pet 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Torigaruka kwetwa Owaatsigirweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">N'ensi yaawe terigaruka kwetwa Amatongo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Kureka oryayetwa Enkundwakazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">N'ensi yaawe eyetwe Oshweirwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akushemerereirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Kandi ensi yaawe eryashwerwa.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:19">Isa 65:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba, nk'oku omutsigazi ashwera omwishiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">Nikwo batabani baawe barikushwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">Kandi nk'oku kishwera ashemerererwa kishwerwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">Nikwo Ruhanga waawe arikushemerererwa.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:8">Isa 52:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Yerusaalemu, ntaire abarinzi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">Aha ngo zaawe z'amabaare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">Tibarihunama nyomushana na nyekiro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">Imwe abaijutsya MUKAMA, mutahuumura;<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:18">Isa 60:18</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:20">Zef 3:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi mutamureka akahuumura</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:7">Okuhitsya obu arihamya Yerusaalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:7">Akagihindura eky'okuhimbisibwa omu nsi.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:21">Isa 65:21</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 65:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:17">Yer 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 6:18">Heb 6:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA arahiire omukono gwe gwa buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">Kandi omukono gwe gw'amaani, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">Buzimazima tindigaruka kuha abazigu baawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">Engano zaawe kuba eby'okurya byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">Kandi abanyamahanga tibarigaruka kunywa viinyo yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">Ei waafeereire kubi;<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 14:23">Bir 14:23</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 14:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kureka abarizishaaruura nibo barizirya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">Bakahimbisa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">Kandi abaricwa emizaabibu yaawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">Nibo bariginywera omu bikaari by'Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera.<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:3">40:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Murabe omu marembo, mugarabemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Mubonereze abantu omuhanda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Mutinde omuhanda rugyendwa, mugutinde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Mwihemu amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Mwimukize abantu orurango.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zek 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:5">Mat 21:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, MUKAMA arangire okuhika aha muheru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">Naagira ati: Mugambire Saayuuni muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">Reeba, okujunwa kwawe nikwija;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">Reeba Mukama naija aine ebihembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">N'enzimuurano ye emwebembeire.<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:6">Isa 61:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi baryayetwa abantu abarikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">Abacungwirwe MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">Naiwe oryayetwa Oshweirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">Orurembo orutatsigirweho.<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Okusingura kwa Kristo ahabwe wenka</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:6">Isa 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:7">Zab 68:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oriya n'oha owaareetwa Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Owaaruga Bozira ajwaire emyenda etukuziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Ojwaire eby'ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Kandi orikugyendesa amaani maingi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Niinye, orikuranga okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Oine amaani kujuna.<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 14:20">Kush 14:20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:13">19:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki emyenda yaawe neetukura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:2">Ebijwaro byawe bikashusha eby'orikunyuukira omu inyuukiro rya viinyo?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:16">Isa 59:16</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:13">Yoel 3:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nnyukiire omu inyuukiro nyenka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Omu bantu b'omu mahanga tihariho n'omwe ou mbaire nyine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Naabaribata ngwirwe kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Naabaribatiirira nyine ekiniga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Eshagama yaabo yaataraakira ebijwaro byangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Emyenda yangye yaagiibwaho amabara.<verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:8">Isa 34:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ku naabaire mmaririire kutaho eizooba ry'okuhooreraho enzigu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:4">Omwaka gwangye gw'okucungura gwahika.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Naamagamaga, naareeba hatariho w'okumpa emikono;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:5">Naatangaara kureeba hatariho w'okumpwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:5">N'ahabw'ekyo omukono gwangye gwandeetera obusinguzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:5">N'ekiniga kyangye kyangumya.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:26">Isa 49:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naaribatiirira amahanga ngwirwe kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:6">Naagasinza n'ekiniga kyangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:6">Eshagama yaabo naagishesha ahansi.<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'embabazi za Mukama ezi yaagiriire Abaisraeli ira</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 145:7">Zab 145:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyagamba aha by'embabazi ebi MUKAMA yaakozire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">N'aha by'okumuhimbisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">Nk'ebi yaatuhaire byona oku biri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">N'ebirungi bingi ebi yaahaire enju ya Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">Nk'okusaasira kwe oku kuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">N'embabazi ze nyingi oku ziri.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />Ahabw'okuba akagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:8">Buzimazima aba n'abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:8">Abaana abatarikukoresa bugobya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:8">Atyo yaaba Omujuni waabo.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:7">Bir 7:7</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:10-12">32:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 10:16">Bar 10:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kubonabonesibwa kwabo kwona nawe akabonabonesibwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">Kandi maraika wa Ruhanga wenka yaabajuna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">Ahabw'okukunda kwe n'okubagirira esaasi akabajuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">Yaabakiriza, yaabaheeka omu biro bya ira byona.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:17">Zab 78:17</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:40">40</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:56">56</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:8">Ezk 20:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:51">Byak 7:51</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:30">Efe 4:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka bakagoma, baagwisa kubi Omwoyo we Orikwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:10">N'ahabw'ekyo yaahinduka omuzigu waabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:10">Kandi We wenka yaabeerwanisiza.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:19-22">Kur 14:19-22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:11-20">Zab 77:11-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abantu be baijuka ebiro bya ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">Baijuka na Musa omugaragwa we, nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">Owaabaihire omu nyanja</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">N'abariisa b'entaama ze, arahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">Owaabataire Omwoyo we Orikwera ahagati, arahi,<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:23">2 Sam 7:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Owaagyendeise omukono gwe gw'ekitiinisa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:12">Aha mukono gwa buryo ogwa Musa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:12">Akataanisa amaizi omu maisho gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:12">Ngu ayetungire eiziina eritahwaho,<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Akabarabya ahagati y'amaizi maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:13">Batateere ntsibo nk'embaraasi erikuraba omu ihamba?<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 10:33">Kub 10:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'ente ezirikushuuma omu ruhita</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:14">Nikwo Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaabahaire obuhuumure.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:14">Okwo nikwo waayebembeire abantu baawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:14">Ngu oyetungire eiziina ry'ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okushaba Mukama okugaruka kuzigirira abaana be ab'ebiro ebi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:15">Bir 26:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naga amaisho ahansi nooyema omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">Oreebe ori omu butaaho bwawe oburikwera kandi obw'ekitiinisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">Obweziriki bwawe n'eby'amaani ebi waakozire, birahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">Okwetenga kw'omu mutima gwawe n'embabazi zaawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">Mbiimirwe.<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:6">Bir 32:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manya, niiwe Tataitwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">N'obu Abrahamu araabe atarikutumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">Israeli atwogire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">Iwe MUKAMA niiwe Tataitwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">Omucunguzi waitu okuruga ira ryona niryo iziina ryawe.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:13">Zab 90:13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Yoh 12:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, ahabw'enki nootuhabya emihanda yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">Okatugangaaza emitima, tutakutiine?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">Garuka ahabw'abairu baawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">Nizo nganda z'obuhunguzi bwawe.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Abantu baawe abarikwera bakamara omwanya mukye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:18">Baine Omwanya gwawe ogurikwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:18">Mbwenu abazigu baitu baguribatiriire.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Twaba nk'abu otakategyekahoga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:19">Kandi nk'abatakeetererwaga iziina ryawe.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="s1">Okweshengyereza Ruhanga kutusaasira ebibi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:10">2 Sam 22:10</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 1:4">Mik 1:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaabaasibwa ki, oshatura eiguru, oshuuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:1">Enshozi zitengatenga omu maisho gaawe,<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 2:9">Yos 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 2:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku omuriro gwotsya obuyaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:2">Gukareetera amaizi kubira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:2">Eiziina ryawe ribona kumanywa ababisha baawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:2">Amahanga gatetemera omu maisho gaawe!<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:13">Kur 14:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:11">15:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obu waakora ebirikwitsa obwoba, ebi twabaire tutarikuteekateeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:3">okashuuma, enshozi zaatengatenga omu maisho gaawe.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:19">Zab 31:19</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:9">1 Kor 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba okuruga ira abantu bakaba batakamanyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:4">Kandi n'okutu kwabo kutakahuriraga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:4">N'amaisho gatakareebaga Ruhanga ondiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:4">Oine eki arikukorera abarikumutegyereza, okwihaho iwe.<verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Iwe otangirira abarikushemerererwa eby'okuhikiirira, bakabikora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Abarikukwijuka, iwe n'emitwarize yaawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Kwonka okagira ekiniga ahabw'okuba tukakora ebibi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Twabimaramu omwanya muhango.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Ebyo turyajunwa?<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:5">Zab 90:5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 90:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba twena tukahinduka nk'omuntu otashemeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:6">N'eby'okuhikiirira kwaitu byona ni nk'ekijwaro ekisiisikaire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:6">Twena tuhonga nk'eibabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:6">N'eby'okutahikiirira byaitu bitutwara nk'ekirikutwarwa omuyaga.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 7:7">Hos 7:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihariho orikutakira eiziina ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:7">Nari orikwebatura kukukwata amaguru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:7">Ahabw'okuba otwimire amaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:7">Waatumaraho ahabw'eby'okutahikiirira byaitu.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:16">Isa 63:16</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:20">Rom 9:20</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 9:21">21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka, ai MUKAMA, niiwe Tataitwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:8">Itwe turi eibumba, niiwe mubumbi waitu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:8">Twena turi ebibumbirwe engaro zaawe.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:11">Isa 45:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:16">57:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:1">Zab 74:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 74:2">2</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 74:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:8">79:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, otatugirira ekiniga, okarengyesereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:9">Kandi otaijuka eby'okutahikiirira byaitu ebiro byona.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:9">2 Bag 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 1:9">Hag 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:3">2:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endembo zaawe ezirikwera zihindukire eihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:10">Saayuuni ebaire eihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:10">Yerusaalemu yaaba amatongo.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Enju yaitu erikwera, kandi enungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:11">Ei baatatenkuriitwe baabaire bakuhimbisizamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:11">Ekasya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:11">Ebi twabaire nitukunda byona byacwekyerera.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 1:12">Zek 1:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, noija kwehuzya ebi bintu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:12">Ohuname, otubonabonese munonga?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Ebifubiro by'Abaisraeli ahabw'okugomera Mukama</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 14:16">Zek 14:16</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:20">Rom 10:20</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:12">Efe 2:12</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaba nyeteekateekire kusherurwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Abatakambuuririzaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Nkaba nyeteekateekire kubonwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Abatakansheruraga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Naagira eihanga eritakatakiraga iziina ryangye nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Reeba, ndi aha! Reeba, ndi aha!<verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Eizooba ryona nsiiba ntegire emikono eihanga erigomi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:2">Abantu abarikugyendera omu muhanda ogutashemeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:2">Nibakuratira obwengye bwabo bonka;<verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:29">Isa 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:3-6">57:3-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu abarikungwisa kubi obutoosha nindeeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:3">Nibatambira ebitambo omu misiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:3">Nibooterera obubaane aha matofaari,<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />Abashutama omu bituuro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:4">Bakaraara aha kiro bari omu myanya eyekiikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:4">Abarya enyama y'empunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:4">N'omucuuzi gw'enyama zirikunugwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:4">Guri omu nyabya zaabo;<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:13">Isa 9:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarikugira bati: Guma wenka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:5">Otampika; ahabw'okuba ndi orikwera okukukira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:5">Abo bantu n'omwika gw'omu nyindo zangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:5">Omuriro ogusiiba nigwaka.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:3">Zab 50:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:12">79:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:22">Yer 2:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:1">17:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, kihandiikirwe omu maisho gangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:6">Tindihunama, kureka ndyahoora;<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:5">Kur 20:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:27">Ezk 20:27</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:28">28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eego, ndyabazimuurira ahabw'ebibi byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">N'ahabw'ebya baishenkurubo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Kibasaase munonga, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Ahabw'okwoterera obubaane aha nshozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Kandi bakanjumira aha bibungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Ndyabanza ngyere eki bashemereire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Bwanyima mbafubire nk'ebi baakozire oku biri.<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:6">Isa 17:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">Nk'oku viinyo eshangwa omu mutsitsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">Bakagira bati: Otagushiisha, ahakuba gurimu omugisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">Naanye nikwo nditwaza, ahabw'abaheereza bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">Nkareka kubamaraho boona.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 27:6">Isa 27:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyaiha omuri Yakobo abaijukuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:9">N'omuri Yuda nyihemu abarihungura ebibungo byangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:9">Abashongore bangye babihungure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:9">N'abaheereza bangye babituuremu.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 33:9">Isa 33:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:1">51:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 7:26">Yos 7:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:20">24:20</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:15">Hos 2:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sharooni eryaba amariisizo g'amasyo g'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:10">N'oruhanga rwa Akori rube orw'amasyo g'ente kubyamamu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:10">Ahabw'abantu bangye abanshwerwire.<verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 23:41">Ezk 23:41</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:21">1 Kor 10:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka imwe abarikutsigaho MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:11">Mukeebwa orushozi rwangye orurikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:11">Mukateekyera <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gaadi ni ruhanga w'emigisha. </char></note>Gaadi obugyenyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:11">Mukaijuriza <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meeni ni ruhanga w'omujumo. </char></note>Meeni ebikopo bya viinyo ejwangize,<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:4">Isa 66:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:24">Enf 1:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabateeraho okwitwa rurara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Mwena muryacureerera okwitwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Ahabw'okuba, ku naayetsire, timureetabire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Ku naagambire, timurategire kutu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">kureka mukakora ebi ntarikusiima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Mwatoorana ebi ntarikushemerererwa.<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:26">Zab 22:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">Reeba, abaheereza bangye baryarya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">Kwonka imwe mugume n'enjara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">Reeba, abaheereza bangye baryanywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">Kwonka imwe mugume n'eiriho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">Reeba, abaheereza bangye baryashemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">Kwonka imwe mwitwe enshoni;<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:11">Zab 5:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, abaheereza bangye baryayeshongora ahabw'obunanukye bw'omu mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:14">Kwonka imwe muryaborooga ahabw'obusaasi bw'omu mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:14">Muteere ekiboroogo ahabw'emitima y'obujune.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Isa 62:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:13">Zek 8:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eiziina ryanyu riryatsigara aha batoorainwe bangye riri ekijumo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:15">Mukama RUHANGA aryabaita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:15">Kwonka abaheereza be aryabeeta erindi iziina.<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:18">Isa 43:18</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:4">Bir 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:2">Yer 4:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo orikweshabira omugisha omu nsi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Aryagweshabira ahari Ruhanga ow'amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Kandi orikurahirira omu nsi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Aryarahira Ruhanga ow'amazima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Ahabw'okuba enaku eza ira zeebire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Zanduga omu maisho.<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuraganisa eiguru risya n'ensi nsya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2 Pet 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Kush 21:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nimpanga eiguru risya n'ensi nsya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:17">Ebya ira tibiriijukwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:17">N'obu kwakuba okuteebwaho omutima.<verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:7">Yer 31:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka mushemererwe, munanukye ebiro byona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:18">Ahabw'okuba, reeba, nimpanga Yerusaalemu kuba ey'okunanukiramu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:18">N'abantu baayo kuba abarikushemeza.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:10">Isa 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:5">62:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:10">66:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyashemerererwa Yerusaalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:19">Nnanukye ahabw'abantu bangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:19">Terihuririrwamu iraka ry'okucura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:19">N'obu kwakuba okurira kw'abaine enaku.<verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:2">Enf 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tiharigaruka kubayo keereere</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Akarikufa kamazire ebiro bikye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">N'obu yaakuba omugurusi otarikuhitsya biro bye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Ahakuba omwana aryafa ahikize emyaka igana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Kandi omusiisi, orifa ahikize emyaka igana, biri akyeenirwe.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 28:26">Ezk 28:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryayombeka amaju, bagatuuremu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:21">Baryabyara emizaabibu, barye ebijuma byayo.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 92:12-14">Zab 92:12-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tibaryombeka maju, abandi bakagataahamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Tibaribyara mizaabibu, ekariibwa abandi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Ahabw'okuba nk'oku ebiro by'omuti biba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">n'eby'abantu bangye nikwo biriba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Kandi abatoorainwe bangye baryamara omwanya muhango</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Nibashemerererwa ebi emikono yaabo ekozire.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:4">Isa 49:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:41">Bir 28:41</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:12-15">Zab 115:12-15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tibarihendekyera busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:23">N'obu kwakuba okuzaara abaana b'okugwerwa akagwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:23">Ahabw'okuba baryaba oruzaaro rw'abu MUKAMA ahaire omugisha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:23">Hamwe na baijukuru baabo.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:5">Zab 32:5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">Dan 9:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batakaanyetsire, ndyabeetaba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:24">Kandi ndyabahurira nibakigamba.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:6">Isa 11:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:14">Kut 3:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushega n'omwana gw'entaama biryarya kumwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Entare eryarya obunyaatsi nk'ente,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Kandi omucuucu guryaba eby'okurya by'enjoka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Aha rushozi rwangye orurikwera rwona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Tibarikoreraho kubi, n'obu kwakuba okucwekyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Embabazi za Mukama aha booro n'abakyene abarikweteisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Bag 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mat 5:34</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 5:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:49-50">Byak 7:49-50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:24">17:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">Eiguru nikyo kitebe kyangye ky'obukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">N'ensi n'akatebe k'ebigyere byangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">Ni nju ki ei muriinyombekyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">Nari shi ni mwanya ki ogu ndihuumuriramu?<verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:15">Isa 57:15</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:14">1 Bus 29:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:18">Zab 34:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo byona omukono gwangye nigwo gwabihangire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">N'ahabw'ekyo byona n'ebyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">Kwonka omuntu ou nditaho omutima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">N'oine omutima omucureezi, kandi ogurikweteisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">Kandi orikutetema ahabw'ekigambo kyangye.<verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:24">Yer 7:24</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:31">31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikwita ente ni nk'orikwita omuntu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Orikutamba omwana gw'entaama, ni nk'orikuhotora embwa ebitsya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Orikuhonga empongano y'eby'okunywa ni nk'orikuhonga eshagama y'empunu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Orikwotera obubaane, ni nk'orikushabira ekishushani ekirikuramibwa omugisha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Buzima beetooraniire emihanda yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Emitima yaabo eshemerererwa ebirikunugwa byabo.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Naanye ndyabatooranira okubonabonesibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Mbareeteho ebi barikutiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Ahabw'okuba ku naayetsire, haabura owaayetaba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Ku naagambire, tibaatega matu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Kureka baakora ebi ntarashemerereirwe.<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:19">Isa 5:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abarikutetema ahabw'ekigambo kya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Nimuhurire ekigambo kye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Beene waanyu abarikubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Bakabacwa nibabatura eiziina ryangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Bagizire bati: Ka MUKAMA ahimbisibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Haza tureebe okwo kushemererwa kwanyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Kwonka nibo barikwatwa enshoni.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:18">Isa 59:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hurira orwari orurikwimuka omu rurembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:6">Eiraka eririkuruga omuri hekalu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:6">Eiraka rya MUKAMA orikuzimuurira abazigu be!<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />Ku yaabaire atakarumirwe, yaazaara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:7">Ku yaabaire atakagizire bisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:7">Yaateeraho omwana w'omwojo.<verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Orareebire ekintu nk'ekyo n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Nari shi, ebyo birareebirwe oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Ensi ekaabaasa kuzaarwa omu izooba rimwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Eihanga rikaabaasa kuruga omunda omu kaanya kakye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Ahakuba Saayuuni ku yaarumirwe ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Ahonaaho yaazaara abaana be b'aboojo.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Ndyakuhitysa aha bunaku bw'okuzaara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:9">Ndemwe kukuzaaza? Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:9">Nyowe oha okuzaara, niinye ndiigara enda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:9">Nikwo Ruhanga waawe arikugira.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:19">Isa 65:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abarikukunda Yerusaalemu mwena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">Mushemererwe hamwe nayo, mwesiime ahabwayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">Imwe abarikugicurira mwena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">Mwesiime hamwe nayo n'okushemererwa.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Mwonkye amabeere g'okurembesereza kwayo, muhaagye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:11">Munywe munonga aha kitiinisa kyayo kingi mushemereirwe.<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:18">Isa 48:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">Reeba ndyamuha obusingye oburi nk'omugyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">Mmuhe n'obutungi bw'amahanga nk'omugyera ogushandaire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">Mwonkye, muheekwe omu rubaju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">Mugurukagurukibwe aha bibero.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:12">Isa 51:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku nyina w'omwana amurembesereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:13">Nikwo ndibarembesereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:13">Mukagwisizibwa gye omuri Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:11">Isa 58:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 8:22">Ezr 8:22</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 8:31">31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku murikireeba, emitima yaanyu eryashemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:14">Amagufa gaanyu gakure gye nk'obunyaatsi bw'omuroba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:14">Kandi kiryamanywa ku omukono gwa MUKAMA guri hamwe n'abaheereza be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:14">N'ekiniga kye ku kiri aha bazigu be.<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 33:14">Isa 33:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:17">Zab 68:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:3">97:3</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:7-8">2 Tes 1:7-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba, reeba, MUKAMA aryaija n'omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:15">N'ebigaari bye biri nk'akasooroora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:15">Ngu okuguubwa kubi kwe akuhikiirize n'ekiniga kingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:15">Kandi abahanise endimi z'omuriro.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:2">Yoel 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba MUKAMA aryacwera abantu boona orubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:16">Abateho ekifubiro ky'omuriro na rurara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:16">Kandi abariitwa MUKAMA baryaba baingi.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />Abarikweyeza, bakeeshemeza, ngu baze omu misiri bakurataine, barye empunu n'ebirikunugwa n'embeba, abo boona baryacwekyererera hamwe, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 14:16">Zek 14:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nimmanya emirimo yaabo n'ebiteekateeko byabo; obunaku nibwija, obu nditeeranira hamwe amahanga goona n'endimi zoona, bakaija, bakareeba ekitiinisa kyangye. <verse eid="ISA 66:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:20">Rom 15:20</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 15:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Ndyata akamanyiso omuribo, abaahonokireho mbatume omu b'amahanga, Tarushiishi, Puuli, Luudi, ab'omu barasi, Tubali, Yavani omu birwa ebiri hare, ei batakahuriraga kurangaanwa kwangye, n'obu kwakuba okureeba ekitiinisa kyangye; batyo baryamanyisa amahanga ekitiinisa kyangye. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:2">Isa 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:16">Rom 15:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baryareeta beene waanyu boona, baheekirwe aha mbaraasi, omu bigaari, omu ngozi, aha nyumbu n'aha ngamira, nibabaiha omu mahanga goona kuba empongano y'okuhongyera MUKAMA, babahitsye Yerusaalemu aha rushozi rwangye orurikwera, babitwaze nk'oku Abaisraeli bashangwa bareeta omu nju ya MUKAMA empongano zaabo z'esaano, omu nyabya zishemeziibwe, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kur 19:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyaihamu bamwe omuribo, mbagire abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:29">Zab 89:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku eiguru risya n'ensi nsya ebi ndihanga birigumaho omu maisho gangye, nikwo n'oruzaaro rwanyu n'eiziina ryanyu birigumaho, nikwo MUKAMA arigamba. <verse eid="ISA 66:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 86:9">Zab 86:9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:16">Zek 14:16</ref>. </char></note> Obunaku buryahika, obu abantu boona bariguma nibaija omu maisho gangye kuramya, buri kuboneka kw'okwezi, n'ahari buri sabato, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. <verse eid="ISA 66:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:48">Mak 9:48</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baryashohora baze kureeba emitumbi y'abangomeire; ahabw'okuba enyogori zaabo tizirifa, n'omuriro gwabo tiguriraazibwa, baryaba ekihagaro aha bantu boona.<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>